|Biology||Structural biology||Neutron diffraction\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_1317||topic_3448\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Neutron diffraction\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3448\"}], \"name\": \"Neutron diffraction\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3448\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Neutron diffraction experiment\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Elastic neutron scattering\", \"Neutron microscopy\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Cells, such as key genes and proteins involved in the cell cycle.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Cell biology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_2229\"}], \"name\": \"Cell biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2229\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Cells\", \"Cellular processes\", \"Protein subcellular localization\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The holistic modelling and analysis of complex biological systems and the interactions therein.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Systems biology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_2259\"}], \"name\": \"Systems biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2259\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Biological modelling\", \"Biological system modelling\", \"Systems modelling\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The study of human beings in general, including the human genome and proteome.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Human biology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_2815\"}], \"name\": \"Human biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2815\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Humans\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The molecular basis of biological activity, particularly the macromolecules (e.g. proteins and nucleic acids) that are essential to life.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Molecular biology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3047\"}], \"n