|topic_2814||topic_3542\"}], \"name\": \"Protein secondary structure\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3542\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Protein features (secondary structure)\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Protein super-secondary structure\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The biology, archival, detection, prediction and analysis of positional features such as functional and other key sites, in protein sequences and the conserved patterns (motifs, profiles etc.) that may be used to describe them.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Proteins||Protein sites, features and motifs\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0078||topic_3510\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Sequence sites, features and motifs||Protein sites, features and motifs\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0160||topic_3510\"}], \"name\": \"Protein sites, features and motifs\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3510\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Protein sequence features\", \"Signal peptide cleavage sites\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Protein binding sites\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3534\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"Binding sites in proteins, including cleavage sites (for a proteolytic enzyme or agent), key residues involved in protein folding, catalytic residues (active site) of an enzyme, ligand-binding (non-catalytic) residues of a protein, such as sites that bind metal, prosthetic groups or lipids, RNA and DNA-binding proteins and binding sites etc.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Proteins||Protein sites, features and motifs||Protein binding sites\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0078||topic_3510||topic_3534\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Sequence sites, features and motifs||Protein sites, features and motifs||Protein binding sites\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0160||topic_3510||topic_3534\"}], \"name\": \"Protein binding sites\", \"