etic linkage\", \"Linkage\", \"Linkage mapping\", \"Synteny\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The archival, processing and analysis of the basic character composition of molecular sequences, for example character or word frequency, ambiguity, complexity, particularly regions of low complexity, and repeats or the repetitive nature of molecular sequences.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Sequence analysis||Sequence composition, complexity and repeats\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0080||topic_0157\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence composition, complexity and repeats\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0157\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Low complexity sequences\", \"Nucleic acid repeats\", \"Protein repeats\", \"Protein sequence repeats\", \"Repeat sequences\", \"Sequence complexity\", \"Sequence composition\", \"Sequence repeats\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The integrated study of evolutionary relationships and whole genome data, for example, in the analysis of species trees, horizontal gene transfer and evolutionary reconstruction.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Sequence analysis||Phylogenomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0080||topic_0194\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Phylogenomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_0194\"}], \"name\": \"Phylogenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0194\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The assembly of fragments of a DNA sequence to reconstruct the original sequence.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Sequence analysis||Sequence assembly\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0080||topic_0196\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence assembly\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0196\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Assembly\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Molecular probes (e.g. a peptide probe or DNA microarray probe) or PCR primers and hybridisation oligos in a nucleic acid sequence.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Sequence analysis||Probes and primers\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0080||topic_0632\"}], \"name\": \"Probes and primers\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0632\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Primer quality\", \"Primers\", \"Probes\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The study of evolutionary relationships amongst organisms from analysis of genetic information (typically gene or protein sequences).\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Sequence analysis||Phylogenetics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0080||topic_3293\"}, \"name\": \"Phylogenetics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3293\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The biological classification of organisms by categorizing them in groups (\\\"clades\\\") based on their most recent common ancestor.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Sequence analysis||Cladistics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0080||topic_3944\"}, \"name\": \"Cladistics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3944\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Tree of life\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The curation, processing, analysis and prediction of data about the structure of biological molecules, typically proteins and nucleic acids and other macromolecules.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Structure analysis\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0081\"}], \"name\": \"Structure analysis\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0081\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Biomolecular structure\", \"Structural bioinformatics\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Computational structural biology\", \"Molecular structure\", \"Structure data resources\", \"Structure data