xperiments\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Sequencing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3168\"}, {\"name\": \"Imaging\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3382\"}, {\"name\": \"Genotyping experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3516\"}, {\"name\": \"Microarray experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3518\"}, {\"name\": \"PCR experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3519\"}, {\"name\": \"Proteomics experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3520\"}, {\"name\": \"RNAi experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3523\"}, {\"name\": \"Simulation experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3524\"}, {\"name\": \"Immunoprecipitation experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3656\"}, {\"name\": \"Cytometry\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3934\"}, {\"name\": \"Chromosome conformation capture\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3940\"}, {\"name\": \"Protein interaction experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3957\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"The determination of complete (typically nucleotide) sequences, including those of genomes (full genome sequencing, de novo sequencing and resequencing), amplicons and transcriptomes.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Sequencing\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3168\"}], \"name\": \"Sequencing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3168\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"DNA-Seq\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Chromosome walking\", \"Clone verification\", \"DNase-Seq\", \"High throughput sequencing\", \"High-throughput sequencing\", \"NGS\", \"NGS data analysis\", \"Next gen sequencing\", \"Next generation sequencing\", \"Panels\", \"Primer walking\", \"Sanger sequencing\", \"Targeted next-generation sequencing panels\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"ChIP-seq\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3169\"}, {\"name\": \"RNA-Seq\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3170\"}, {\"name\": \"Whole genome sequencing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3673\"}, {\"name\": \"Exome sequencing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3676\"}, {\"name\": \"Metagenomic sequencing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3837\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"The analysis of protein-DNA interactions where chromatin immunoprecipitation (ChIP) is used in combination with massively parallel DNA sequencing to identify the binding sites of DNA-associated proteins.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Sequencing||ChIP-seq\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3168||topic_3169\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Immunoprecipitation experiment||ChIP-seq\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3656||topic_3169\"}], \"name\": \"ChIP-seq\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3169\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"ChIP-sequencing\", \"Chip Seq\", \"Chip sequencing\", \"Chip-sequencing\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"ChIP-exo\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A topic concerning high-throughput sequencing of cDNA to measure the RNA content (transcriptome) of a sample, for example, to investigate how different alleles of a gene are expressed, detect post-transcriptional mutations or identify gene fusions.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Sequencing||RNA-Seq\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3168||topic_3170\"}], \"name\": \"RNA-Seq\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3170\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"RNA sequencing\", \"RNA-Seq analysis\", \"Small RNA sequencing\", \"Small RNA-Seq\", \"Small-Seq\", \"Transcriptome profiling\", \"WTSS\", \"Whole transcriptome shotgun sequencing\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"MicroRNA sequencing\", \"miRNA-seq\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Laboratory technique to sequence the complete DNA sequence of an organism\'s genome at a single time.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Sequencing||Whole genome sequencing\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3168||topic_3673\"}], \"name\": \"Whole genome sequencing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3673\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Genome sequencing\", \"WGS\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"De novo genome sequencing\", \"Whole genome resequencing\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Laboratory technique to sequence all the protein-coding regions in a genome, i.e., the exome.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Sequencing||Exome sequencing\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3168||topic_3676\"}], \"name\": \"Exome sequencing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3676\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Exome\", \"Exome analysis\", \"Exome capture\", \"Targeted exome capture\", \"WES\", \"Whole exome sequencing\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Approach which samples, in parallel, all genes in all organisms present in a given sample, e.g. to provide insight into biodiversity and function.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Sequencing||Metagenomic sequencing\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3168||topic_3837\"}], \"name\": \"Metagenomic sequencing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3837\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Shotgun metagenomic sequencing\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The visual representation of an object.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382\"}], \"name\": \"Imaging\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3382\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Diffraction experiment\", \"Microscopy\", \"Microscopy imaging\", \"Optical super resolution microscopy\", \"Photonic force microscopy\", \"Photonic microscopy\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"NMR\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0593\"}, {\"name\": \"Electron microscopy\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0611\"}, {\"name\": \"X-ray diffraction\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2828\"}, {\"name\": \"Bioimaging\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3383\"}, {\"name\": \"Medical imaging\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3384\"}, {\"name\": \"Light microscopy\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3385\"}, {\"name\": \"MRI\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3444\"}, {\"name\": \"Neutron diffraction\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3448\"}, {\"name\": \"Tomography\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3452\"}, {\"name\": \"Echography\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3954\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"An analytical technique that exploits the magenetic properties of certain atomic nuclei to provide information on the structure, dynamics, reaction state and chemical environment of molecules.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||NMR\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_0593\"}, \"name\": \"NMR\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0593\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"NMR spectroscopy\", \"Nuclear magnetic resonance spectroscopy\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"HOESY\", \"Heteronuclear Overhauser Effect Spectroscopy\", \"NOESY\", \"Nuclear Overhauser Effect Spectroscopy\", \"ROESY\", \"Rotational Frame Nuclear Overhauser Effect Spectroscopy\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The study of matter by studying the interference pattern from firing electrons at a sample, to analyse structures at resolutions higher than can be achieved using light.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Electron microscopy\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_0611\"}, \"name\": \"Electron microscopy\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0611\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Electron crystallography\", \"SEM\", \"Scanning electron microscopy\", \"Single particle electron microscopy\", \"TEM\", \"Transmission electron microscopy\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The study of matter and their structure by means of the diffraction of X-rays, typically the diffraction pattern caused by the regularly spaced atoms of a crystalline sample.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||X-ray diffraction\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_2828\"}, \"name\": \"X-ray diffraction\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2828\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Crystallography\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"X-ray crystallography\", \"X-ray microscopy\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The use of imaging techniques to understand biology.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Bioimaging\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3383\"}], \"name\": \"Bioimaging\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3383\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Biological imaging\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The use of imaging techniques for clinical purposes for medical research.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Medical imaging\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3384\"}], \"name\": \"Medical imaging\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3384\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Neuroimaging\", \"Nuclear medicine\", \"Radiology\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The use of optical instruments to magnify the image of an object.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Light microscopy\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3385\"}], \"name\": \"Light microscopy\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3385\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Techniques that uses magnetic fields and radiowaves to form images, typically to investigate the anatomy and physiology of the human body.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||MRI\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3444\"}], \"name\": \"MRI\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3444\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"MRT\", \"Magnetic resonance imaging\", \"Magnetic resonance tomography\", \"NMRI\", \"Nuclear magnetic resonance imaging\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The study of matter by studying the diffraction pattern from firing neutrons at a sample, typically to determine atomic and/or magnetic structure.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Neutron diffraction\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3448\"}, \"name\": \"Neutron diffraction\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3448\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Neutron diffraction experiment\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Elastic neutron scattering\", \"Neutron microscopy\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Imaging in sections (sectioning), through the use of a wave-generating device (tomograph) that generates an image (a tomogram).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Tomography\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3452\"}], \"name\": \"Tomography\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3452\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"CT\", \"Computed tomography\", \"TDM\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Electron tomography\", \"PET\", \"Positron emission tomography\", \"X-ray tomography\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A diagnostic imaging technique based on the application of ultrasound.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Echography\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3954\"}], \"name\": \"Echography\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3954\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Standardized echography\", \"Ultrasound imaging\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Diagnostic sonography\", \"Medical ultrasound\", \"Standard echography\", \"Ultrasonography\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Genotype experiment including case control, population, and family studies. These might use array based methods and re-sequencing methods.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Genotyping experiment\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3516\"}], \"name\": \"Genotyping experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3516\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Microarray experiments including conditions, protocol, sample:data relationships etc.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Microarray experiment\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3518\"}], \"name\": \"Microarray experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3518\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Microarrays\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Gene expression microarray\", \"Genotyping array\", \"Methylation array\", \"MicroRNA array\", \"Multichannel microarray\", \"One channel microarray\", \"Proprietary platform micoarray\", \"RNA chips\", \"RNA microarrays\", \"Reverse phase protein array\", \"SNP array\", \"Tiling arrays\", \"Tissue microarray\", \"Two channel microarray\", \"aCGH microarray\", \"mRNA microarray\", \"miRNA array\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"PCR experiments, e.g. quantitative real-time PCR.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||PCR experiment\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3519\"}], \"name\": \"PCR experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3519\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Polymerase chain reaction\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Quantitative PCR\", \"RT-qPCR\", \"Real Time Quantitative PCR\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Proteomics experiments.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Proteomics experiment\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3520\"}], \"name\": \"Proteomics experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3520\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"2D PAGE experiment\", \"DIA\", \"Data-independent acquisition\", \"MS\", \"MS experiments\", \"Mass spectrometry\", \"Mass spectrometry experiments\", \"Northern blot experiment\", \"Spectrum demultiplexing\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"RNAi experiments.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||RNAi experiment\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3523\"}], \"name\": \"RNAi experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3523\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Biological computational model experiments (simulation), for example the minimum information required in order to permit its correct interpretation and reproduction.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Simulation experiment\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3524\"}], \"name\": \"Simulation experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3524\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Experimental techniques to purify a protein-DNA crosslinked complex.  Usually sequencing follows e.g. in the techniques ChIP-chip, ChIP-seq and MeDIP-seq.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Immunoprecipitation experiment\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3656\"}], \"name\": \"Immunoprecipitation experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3656\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Chromatin immunoprecipitation\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"ChIP-seq\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3169\"}, {\"name\": \"ChIP-on-chip\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3179\"}, {\"name\": \"Methylated DNA immunoprecipitation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3674\"}, {\"name\": \"RNA immunoprecipitation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3794\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"The analysis of protein-DNA interactions where chromatin immunoprecipitation (ChIP) is used in combination with massively parallel DNA sequencing to identify the binding sites of DNA-associated proteins.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Immunoprecipitation experiment||ChIP-seq\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3656||topic_3169\"}, \"name\": \"ChIP-seq\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3169\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"ChIP-sequencing\", \"Chip Seq\", \"Chip sequencing\", \"Chip-sequencing\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"ChIP-exo\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Experimental techniques that combine chromatin immunoprecipitation (\'ChIP\') with microarray (\'chip\'). ChIP-on-chip is used for high-throughput study protein-DNA interactions.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Immunoprecipitation experiment||ChIP-on-chip\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3656||topic_3179\"}], \"name\": \"ChIP-on-chip\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3179\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"ChIP-chip\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"ChiP\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Laboratory technique to sequence the methylated regions in DNA.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Immunoprecipitation experiment||Methylated DNA immunoprecipitation\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3656||topic_3674\"}], \"name\": \"Methylated DNA immunoprecipitation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3674\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"MeDIP-chip\", \"MeDIP-seq\", \"mDIP\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"BS-Seq\", \"Bisulfite sequencing\", \"MeDIP\", \"Methylated DNA immunoprecipitation (MeDIP)\", \"Methylation sequencing\", \"WGBS\", \"Whole-genome bisulfite sequencing\", \"methy-seq\", \"methyl-seq\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"An antibody-based technique used to map in vivo RNA-protein interactions.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Immunoprecipitation experiment||RNA immunoprecipitation\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3656||topic_3794\"}], \"name\": \"RNA immunoprecipitation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3794\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"RIP\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"CLIP\", \"CLIP-seq\", \"HITS-CLIP\", \"PAR-CLIP\", \"iCLIP\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Cytometry is the measurement of the characteristics of cells.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Cytometry\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3934\"}], \"name\": \"Cytometry\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3934\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Flow cytometry\", \"Image cytometry\", \"Mass cytometry\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Molecular biology methods used to analyze the spatial organization of chromatin in a cell.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Chromosome conformation capture\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3940\"}], \"name\": \"Chromosome conformation capture\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3940\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"3C technologies\", \"3C-based methods\", \"Chromosome conformation analysis\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Chromatin accessibility\", \"Chromatin accessibility assay\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"An experiment for studying protein-protein interactions.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Protein interaction experiment\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3957\"}], \"name\": \"Protein interaction experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3957\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Co-immunoprecipitation\", \"Phage display\", \"Yeast one-hybrid\", \"Yeast two-hybrid\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The collective characterisation and quantification of pools of biological molecules that translate into the structure, function, and dynamics of an organism or organisms.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391\"}], \"name\": \"Omics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3391\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Proteomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0121\"}, {\"name\": \"Genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0622\"}, {\"name\": \"Metabolomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3172\"}, {\"name\": \"Phenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3298\"}, {\"name\": \"Molecular evolution\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3945\"}, {\"name\": \"Fluxomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3955\"}, {\"name\": \"Immunomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3967\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"Protein and peptide identification, especially in the study of whole proteomes of organisms.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Proteomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0121\"}], \"name\": \"Proteomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0121\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Bottom-up proteomics\", \"Discovery proteomics\", \"MS-based targeted proteomics\", \"MS-based untargeted proteomics\", \"Metaproteomics\", \"Peptide identification\", \"Protein and peptide identification\", \"Quantitative proteomics\", \"Targeted proteomics\", \"Top-down proteomics\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Whole genomes of one or more organisms, or genomes in general, such as meta-information on genomes, genome projects, gene names etc.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622\"}], \"name\": \"Genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0622\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Exomes\", \"Genome annotation\", \"Genomes\", \"Personal genomics\", \"Synthetic genomics\", \"Viral genomics\", \"Whole genomes\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Functional genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0085\"}, {\"name\": \"Structural genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0122\"}, {\"name\": \"Phylogenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0194\"}, {\"name\": \"Pharmacogenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0208\"}, {\"name\": \"Comparative genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0797\"}, {\"name\": \"Epigenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3173\"}, {\"name\": \"Metagenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3174\"}, {\"name\": \"Transcriptomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3308\"}, {\"name\": \"Population genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3796\"}, {\"name\": \"Proteogenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3922\"}, {\"name\": \"Paleogenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3943\"}, {\"name\": \"Epistasis\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3974\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"The study of gene or protein functions and their interactions in totality in a given organism, tissue, cell etc.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Functional genomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_0085\"}, \"name\": \"Functional genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0085\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The elucidation of the three dimensional structure for all (available) proteins in a given organism.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Structural genomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_0122\"}, \"name\": \"Structural genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0122\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The integrated study of evolutionary relationships and whole genome data, for example, in the analysis of species trees, horizontal gene transfer and evolutionary reconstruction.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Phylogenomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_0194\"}, \"name\": \"Phylogenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0194\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The influence of genotype on drug response, for example by correlating gene expression or single-nucleotide polymorphisms with drug efficacy or toxicity.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Pharmacogenomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_0208\"}, \"name\": \"Pharmacogenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0208\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Pharmacogenetics\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The study (typically comparison) of the sequence, structure or function of multiple genomes.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Comparative genomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_0797\"}], \"name\": \"Comparative genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0797\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The study of the epigenetic modifications of a whole cell, tissue, organism etc.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Epigenomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3173\"}, \"name\": \"Epigenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3173\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The study of genetic material recovered from environmental samples, and associated environmental data.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Metagenomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3174\"}, \"name\": \"Metagenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3174\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Biome sequencing\", \"Shotgun metagenomics\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The analysis of transcriptomes, or a set of all the RNA molecules in a specific cell, tissue etc.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Transcriptomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3308\"}, \"name\": \"Transcriptomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3308\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Comparative transcriptomics\", \"Metatranscriptomics\", \"Transcriptome\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Metatranscriptomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3941\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"The study of microbe gene expression within natural environments (i.e. the metatranscriptome).\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Transcriptomics||Metatranscriptomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3308||topic_3941\"}, \"name\": \"Metatranscriptomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3941\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Large-scale study (typically comparison) of DNA sequences of populations.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Population genomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3796\"}], \"name\": \"Population genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3796\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A field of biological research focused on the discovery and identification of peptides, typically by comparing mass spectra against a protein database.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Proteogenomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3922\"}], \"name\": \"Proteogenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3922\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The reconstruction and analysis of genomic information in extinct species.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Paleogenomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3943\"}], \"name\": \"Paleogenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3943\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Ancestral genomes\", \"Paleogenetics\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The study of the epigenetic modifications of a whole cell, tissue, organism etc.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Epistasis\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3974\"}, \"name\": \"Epistasis\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3974\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Epistatic genetic interaction\", \"Epistatic interactions\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The systematic study of metabolites, the chemical processes they are involved, and the chemical fingerprints of specific cellular processes in a whole cell, tissue, organ or organism.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Metabolomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_3172\"}], \"name\": \"Metabolomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3172\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Exometabolomics\", \"LC-MS-based metabolomics\", \"MS-based metabolomics\", \"MS-based targeted metabolomics\", \"MS-based untargeted metabolomics\", \"Mass spectrometry-based metabolomics\", \"Metabolites\", \"Metabolome\", \"Metabonomics\", \"NMR-based metabolomics\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Phenomes, or the study of the change in phenotype (the physical and biochemical traits of organisms) in response to genetic and environmental factors.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Phenomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_3298\"}, \"name\": \"Phenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3298\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The study of the process and mechanism of change of biomolecules such as DNA, RNA, and proteins across generations.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Molecular evolution\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_3945\"}, \"name\": \"Molecular evolution\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3945\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Experimental approaches to determine the rates of metabolic reactions - the metabolic fluxes - within a biological entity.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Fluxomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_3955\"}], \"name\": \"Fluxomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3955\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The study of immune system as a whole, its regulation and response to pathogens using genome-wide approaches.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Immunomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_3967\"}], \"name\": \"Immunomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3967\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The design of an experiment intended to test a hypothesis, and describe or explain empirical data obtained under various experimental conditions.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Experimental design and studies\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3678\"}], \"name\": \"Experimental design and studies\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3678\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Design of experiments\", \"Experimental design\", \"Studies\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Preclinical and clinical studies\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3379\"}, {\"name\": \"GWAS study\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3517\"}, {\"name\": \"Animal study\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3679\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"The testing of new medicines, vaccines or procedures on animals (preclinical) and humans (clinical) prior to their approval by regulatory authorities.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Experimental design and studies||Preclinical and clinical studies\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3678||topic_3379\"}, \"name\": \"Preclinical and clinical studies\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3379\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Clinical studies\", \"Clinical study\", \"Clinical trial\", \"Drug trials\", \"Preclinical studies\", \"Preclinical study\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Genome-wide association study experiments.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Experimental design and studies||GWAS study\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3678||topic_3517\"}], \"name\": \"GWAS study\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3517\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"GWAS\", \"GWAS analysis\", \"Genome-wide association study\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The design of an experiment involving non-human animals.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Experimental design and studies||Animal study\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3678||topic_3679\"}, \"name\": \"Animal study\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3679\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Challenge study\"], \"children\": []}]','2025-08-27 12:52:45.380937'),(4,'flat_EDAM_Topic_1.25','[{\"definition\": \"A category denoting a rather broad domain or field of interest, of study, application, work, data, or technology. Topics have no clearly defined borders between each other.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic\", \"key\": \"topic_0003\"}], \"name\": \"Topic\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0003\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Informatics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0605\"}, {\"name\": \"Literature and language\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3068\"}, {\"name\": \"Biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3070\"}, {\"name\": \"Medicine\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3303\"}, {\"name\": \"Computational biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3307\"}, {\"name\": \"Chemistry\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3314\"}, {\"name\": \"Mathematics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3315\"}, {\"name\": \"Computer science\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3316\"}, {\"name\": \"Physics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3318\"}, {\"name\": \"Biomedical science\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3344\"}, {\"name\": \"Laboratory techniques\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3361\"}, {\"name\": \"Omics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3391\"}, {\"name\": \"Experimental design and studies\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3678\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"The study and practice of information processing and use of computer information systems.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605\"}], \"name\": \"Informatics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0605\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Information management\", \"Information science\", \"Knowledge management\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Ontology and terminology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0089\"}, {\"name\": \"Bioinformatics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0091\"}, {\"name\": \"Laboratory information management\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0607\"}, {\"name\": \"Cheminformatics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2258\"}, {\"name\": \"Medical informatics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3063\"}, {\"name\": \"Biological databases\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3071\"}, {\"name\": \"Immunoinformatics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3948\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"The conceptualisation, categorisation and nomenclature (naming) of entities or phenomena within biology or bioinformatics. This includes formal ontologies, controlled vocabularies, structured glossary, symbols and terminology or other related resource.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Ontology and terminology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_0089\"}], \"name\": \"Ontology and terminology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0089\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Applied ontology\", \"Ontologies\", \"Ontology\", \"Ontology relations\", \"Terminology\", \"Upper ontology\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The archival, curation, processing and analysis of complex biological data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Bioinformatics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_0091\"}], \"name\": \"Bioinformatics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0091\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Laboratory management and resources, for example, catalogues of biological resources for use in the lab including cell lines, viruses, plasmids, phages, DNA probes and primers and so on.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Laboratory information management\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_0607\"}], \"name\": \"Laboratory information management\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0607\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Laboratory resources\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The application of information technology to chemistry in biological research environment.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Cheminformatics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_2258\"}], \"name\": \"Cheminformatics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2258\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Chemical informatics\", \"Chemoinformatics\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The application of information technology to health, disease and biomedicine.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Medical informatics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3063\"}], \"name\": \"Medical informatics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3063\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Biomedical informatics\", \"Clinical informatics\", \"Health and disease\", \"Health informatics\", \"Healthcare informatics\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The development and use of architectures, policies, practices and procedures for management of data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071\"}], \"name\": \"Biological databases\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3071\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Data management\", \"Databases and information systems\", \"Information systems\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Data submission, annotation and curation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0219\"}, {\"name\": \"Workflows\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0769\"}, {\"name\": \"Data acquisition\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3077\"}, {\"name\": \"Data security\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3263\"}, {\"name\": \"Data identity and mapping\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3345\"}, {\"name\": \"Data architecture, analysis and design\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3365\"}, {\"name\": \"Data integration and warehousing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3366\"}, {\"name\": \"Database management\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3489\"}, {\"name\": \"Data governance\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3571\"}, {\"name\": \"Data quality management\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3572\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"Deposition and curation of database accessions, including annotation, typically with terms from a controlled vocabulary.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data submission, annotation and curation\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_0219\"}], \"name\": \"Data submission, annotation and curation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0219\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Data curation\", \"Data provenance\", \"Database curation\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Biological or biomedical analytical workflows or pipelines.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Workflows\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_0769\"}], \"name\": \"Workflows\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0769\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Pipelines\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Software integration\", \"Tool integration\", \"Tool interoperability\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The acquisition of data, typically measurements of physical systems using any type of sampling system, or by another other means.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data acquisition\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3077\"}], \"name\": \"Data acquisition\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3077\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Data collection\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The protection of data, such as patient health data, from damage or unwanted access from unauthorised users.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data security\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3263\"}], \"name\": \"Data security\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3263\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Data privacy\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Topic concerning the identity of biological entities, or reports on such entities, and the mapping of entities and records in different databases.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data identity and mapping\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3345\"}], \"name\": \"Data identity and mapping\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3345\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The development of policies, models and standards that cover data acquisition, storage and integration, such that it can be put to use, typically through a process of systematically applying statistical and / or logical techniques to describe, illustrate, summarise or evaluate data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data architecture, analysis and design\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3365\"}], \"name\": \"Data architecture, analysis and design\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3365\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Data analysis\", \"Data architecture\", \"Data design\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The combination and integration of data from different sources, for example into a central repository or warehouse, to provide users with a unified view of these data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data integration and warehousing\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3366\"}], \"name\": \"Data integration and warehousing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3366\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Data integration\", \"Data warehousing\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The general handling of data stored in digital archives such as databanks, databases proper, web portals and other data resources.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Database management\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3489\"}], \"name\": \"Database management\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3489\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Database administration\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Content management\", \"Data maintenance\", \"Document management\", \"Document, record and content management\", \"File management\", \"Record management\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The control of data entry and maintenance to ensure the data meets defined standards, qualities or constraints.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data governance\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3571\"}], \"name\": \"Data governance\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3571\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Data stewardship\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The quality, integrity, and cleaning up of data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data quality management\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3572\"}], \"name\": \"Data quality management\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3572\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Data clean-up\", \"Data cleaning\", \"Data integrity\", \"Data quality\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Immunoinformatics is the field of computational biology that deals with the study of immunoloogical questions. Immunoinformatics is at the interface between immunology and computer science. It takes advantage of computational, statistical, mathematical approaches and enhances the understanding of immunological knowledge.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Immunoinformatics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3948\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Immunology||Immunoinformatics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_0804||topic_3948\"}], \"name\": \"Immunoinformatics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3948\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Computational immunology\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The scientific literature, language processing, reference information, and documentation.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Literature and language\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3068\"}], \"name\": \"Literature and language\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3068\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Language\", \"Literature\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Bibliography\", \"Citations\", \"Documentation\", \"References\", \"Scientific literature\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Natural language processing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0218\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"The processing and analysis of natural language, such as scientific literature in English, in order to extract data and information, or to enable human-computer interaction.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Literature and language||Natural language processing\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3068||topic_0218\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Computer science||Natural language processing\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3316||topic_0218\"}], \"name\": \"Natural language processing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0218\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"NLP\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"BioNLP\", \"Literature mining\", \"Text analytics\", \"Text data mining\", \"Text mining\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The study of life and living organisms, including their morphology, biochemistry, physiology, development, evolution, and so on.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070\"}], \"name\": \"Biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3070\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Biological science\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Aerobiology\", \"Behavioural biology\", \"Biological rhythms\", \"Chronobiology\", \"Cryobiology\", \"Reproductive biology\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Ecology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0610\"}, {\"name\": \"Model organisms\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0621\"}, {\"name\": \"Plant biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0780\"}, {\"name\": \"Virology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0781\"}, {\"name\": \"Structural biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_1317\"}, {\"name\": \"Cell biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2229\"}, {\"name\": \"Systems biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2259\"}, {\"name\": \"Human biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2815\"}, {\"name\": \"Molecular biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3047\"}, {\"name\": \"Genetics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3053\"}, {\"name\": \"Developmental biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3064\"}, {\"name\": \"Biochemistry\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3292\"}, {\"name\": \"Biotechnology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3297\"}, {\"name\": \"Evolutionary biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3299\"}, {\"name\": \"Microbiology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3301\"}, {\"name\": \"Biophysics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3306\"}, {\"name\": \"Biomarkers\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3360\"}, {\"name\": \"Chemical biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3369\"}, {\"name\": \"Marine biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3387\"}, {\"name\": \"Zoology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3500\"}, {\"name\": \"Freshwater biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3573\"}, {\"name\": \"Agricultural science\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3810\"}, {\"name\": \"Environmental science\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3855\"}, {\"name\": \"Synthetic biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3895\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"The ecological and environmental sciences and especially the application of information technology (ecoinformatics).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Ecology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_0610\"}], \"name\": \"Ecology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0610\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Computational ecology\", \"Ecoinformatics\", \"Ecological informatics\", \"Ecosystem science\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Biodiversity\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3050\"}, {\"name\": \"Metagenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3174\"}, {\"name\": \"Microbial ecology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3697\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"The degree of variation of life forms within a given ecosystem, biome or an entire planet.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Ecology||Biodiversity\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_0610||topic_3050\"}], \"name\": \"Biodiversity\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3050\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The study of genetic material recovered from environmental samples, and associated environmental data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Ecology||Metagenomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_0610||topic_3174\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Metagenomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3174\"}], \"name\": \"Metagenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3174\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Biome sequencing\", \"Shotgun metagenomics\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The ecology of microorganisms including their relationship with one another and their environment.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Ecology||Microbial ecology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_0610||topic_3697\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Microbiology||Microbial ecology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3301||topic_3697\"}], \"name\": \"Microbial ecology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3697\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Environmental microbiology\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Community analysis\", \"Microbiome\", \"Molecular community analysis\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A specific organism, or group of organisms, used to study a particular aspect of biology.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Model organisms\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_0621\"}], \"name\": \"Model organisms\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0621\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Organisms\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Plants, e.g. information on a specific plant genome including molecular sequences, genes and annotation.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Plant biology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_0780\"}], \"name\": \"Plant biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0780\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Botany\", \"Plant\", \"Plant science\", \"Plants\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Plant anatomy\", \"Plant cell biology\", \"Plant ecology\", \"Plant genetics\", \"Plant physiology\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Study of viruses, e.g. sequence and structural data, interactions of viral proteins, or a viral genome including molecular sequences, genes and annotation.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Virology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_0781\"}], \"name\": \"Virology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0781\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The molecular structure of biological molecules, particularly macromolecules such as proteins and nucleic acids.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Structural biology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_1317\"}], \"name\": \"Structural biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_1317\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Structural assignment\", \"Structural determination\", \"Structure determination\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Structural genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0122\"}, {\"name\": \"NMR\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0593\"}, {\"name\": \"Electron microscopy\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0611\"}, {\"name\": \"X-ray diffraction\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2828\"}, {\"name\": \"Neutron diffraction\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3448\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"The elucidation of the three dimensional structure for all (available) proteins in a given organism.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Structural biology||Structural genomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_1317||topic_0122\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Structural genomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_0122\"}], \"name\": \"Structural genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0122\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"An analytical technique that exploits the magenetic properties of certain atomic nuclei to provide information on the structure, dynamics, reaction state and chemical environment of molecules.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Structural biology||NMR\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_1317||topic_0593\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||NMR\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_0593\"}], \"name\": \"NMR\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0593\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"NMR spectroscopy\", \"Nuclear magnetic resonance spectroscopy\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"HOESY\", \"Heteronuclear Overhauser Effect Spectroscopy\", \"NOESY\", \"Nuclear Overhauser Effect Spectroscopy\", \"ROESY\", \"Rotational Frame Nuclear Overhauser Effect Spectroscopy\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The study of matter by studying the interference pattern from firing electrons at a sample, to analyse structures at resolutions higher than can be achieved using light.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Structural biology||Electron microscopy\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_1317||topic_0611\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Electron microscopy\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_0611\"}], \"name\": \"Electron microscopy\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0611\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Electron crystallography\", \"SEM\", \"Scanning electron microscopy\", \"Single particle electron microscopy\", \"TEM\", \"Transmission electron microscopy\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The study of matter and their structure by means of the diffraction of X-rays, typically the diffraction pattern caused by the regularly spaced atoms of a crystalline sample.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Structural biology||X-ray diffraction\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_1317||topic_2828\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||X-ray diffraction\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_2828\"}], \"name\": \"X-ray diffraction\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2828\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Crystallography\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"X-ray crystallography\", \"X-ray microscopy\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The study of matter by studying the diffraction pattern from firing neutrons at a sample, typically to determine atomic and/or magnetic structure.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Structural biology||Neutron diffraction\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_1317||topic_3448\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Neutron diffraction\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3448\"}], \"name\": \"Neutron diffraction\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3448\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Neutron diffraction experiment\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Elastic neutron scattering\", \"Neutron microscopy\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Cells, such as key genes and proteins involved in the cell cycle.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Cell biology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_2229\"}], \"name\": \"Cell biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2229\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Cells\", \"Cellular processes\", \"Protein subcellular localization\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The holistic modelling and analysis of complex biological systems and the interactions therein.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Systems biology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_2259\"}], \"name\": \"Systems biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2259\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Biological modelling\", \"Biological system modelling\", \"Systems modelling\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The study of human beings in general, including the human genome and proteome.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Human biology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_2815\"}], \"name\": \"Human biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2815\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Humans\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The molecular basis of biological activity, particularly the macromolecules (e.g. proteins and nucleic acids) that are essential to life.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Molecular biology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3047\"}], \"name\": \"Molecular biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3047\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Biological processes\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The study of genes, genetic variation and heredity in living organisms.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Genetics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3053\"}], \"name\": \"Genetics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3053\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Genes\", \"Heredity\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Genotype and phenotype\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0625\"}, {\"name\": \"Population genetics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3056\"}, {\"name\": \"Epigenetics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3295\"}, {\"name\": \"Molecular genetics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3321\"}, {\"name\": \"Human genetics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3574\"}, {\"name\": \"Genetic engineering\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3912\"}, {\"name\": \"Immunogenetics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3930\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"The study of genetic constitution of a living entity, such as an individual, and organism, a cell and so on, typically with respect to a particular observable phenotypic traits, or resources concerning such traits, which might be an aspect of biochemistry, physiology, morphology, anatomy, development and so on.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Genetics||Genotype and phenotype\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3053||topic_0625\"}], \"name\": \"Genotype and phenotype\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0625\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Genotype and phenotype resources\", \"Genotype-phenotype\", \"Genotype-phenotype analysis\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Genotype\", \"Genotyping\", \"Phenotype\", \"Phenotyping\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Quantitative genetics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3055\"}, {\"name\": \"Phenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3298\"}, {\"name\": \"Molecular evolution\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3945\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"The genes and genetic mechanisms such as Mendelian inheritance that underly continuous phenotypic traits (such as height or weight).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Genetics||Genotype and phenotype||Quantitative genetics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3053||topic_0625||topic_3055\"}], \"name\": \"Quantitative genetics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3055\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Phenomes, or the study of the change in phenotype (the physical and biochemical traits of organisms) in response to genetic and environmental factors.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Genetics||Genotype and phenotype||Phenomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3053||topic_0625||topic_3298\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Evolutionary biology||Phenomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3299||topic_3298\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Phenomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_3298\"}], \"name\": \"Phenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3298\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The study of the process and mechanism of change of biomolecules such as DNA, RNA, and proteins across generations.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topi