cs\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3173\"}], \"name\": \"Epigenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3173\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The study of the epigenetic modifications of a whole cell, tissue, organism etc.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Genetics||Epigenetics||Epistasis\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3053||topic_3295||topic_3974\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Epistasis\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3974\"}], \"name\": \"Epistasis\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3974\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Epistatic genetic interaction\", \"Epistatic interactions\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The structure and function of genes at a molecular level.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Genetics||Molecular genetics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3053||topic_3321\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Molecular genetics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_3321\"}], \"name\": \"Molecular genetics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3321\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Gene structure\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0114\"}, {\"name\": \"Genetic variation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0199\"}, {\"name\": \"Gene expression\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0203\"}, {\"name\": \"Gene and protein families\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0623\"}, {\"name\": \"Cytogenetics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3959\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"Gene structure, regions which make an RNA product and features such as promoters, coding regions, gene fusion, splice sites etc.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Genetics||Molecular genetics||Gene structure\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3053||topic_3321||topic_0114\"}, {\"name\