ology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3697\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Environmental microbiology\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Community analysis\", \"Microbiome\", \"Molecular community analysis\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The use of physics to study biological system.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Biophysics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3306\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Physics||Biophysics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3318||topic_3306\"}], \"name\": \"Biophysics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3306\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Medical physics\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Objective indicators of biological state often used to assess health, and determinate treatment.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Biomarkers\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3360\"}], \"name\": \"Biomarkers\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3360\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Diagnostic markers\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The use of synthetic chemistry to study and manipulate biological systems.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Chemical biology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3369\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Chemistry||Synthetic chemistry||Chemical biology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3314||topic_3371||topic_3369\"}], \"name\": \"Chemical biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3369\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The study of organisms in the ocean or brackish waters.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Marine biology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3387\"}], \"name\": \"Marine biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3387\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Animals, e.g. information on a specific animal genome including molecular sequences, genes and annotation.\", 