"Neurological disorders\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The diseases and abnormalities of the heart and circulatory system.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Cardiology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_3335\"}], \"name\": \"Cardiology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3335\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Cardiovascular medicine\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Cardiovascular disease\", \"Heart disease\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"\'translating\' the output of basic and biomedical research into better diagnostic tools, medicines, medical procedures, policies and advice.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Translational medicine\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_3342\"}], \"name\": \"Translational medicine\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3342\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Molecular medicine\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3388\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"The identification of molecular and genetic causes of disease and the development of interventions to correct them.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Translational medicine||Molecular medicine\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_3342||topic_3388\"}], \"name\": \"Molecular medicine\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3388\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"An interdisciplinary field of study that looks at the dynamic systems of the human body as part of an integrted whole, incoporating biochemical, physiological, and environmental interactions that sustain life.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Systems medicine\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_3396\"}], \"name\": \"Systems medicine\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3396\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Topic concerning the branch of medicine that deals with the prevention, diagnosis, and treatment of disease, disorder and injury in animals.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Veterinary medicine\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_3397\"}], \"name\": \"Veterinary medicine\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3397\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Clinical veterinary medicine\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The branch of medicine dealing with the diagnosis, treatment and prevention of disease in older people, and the problems specific to aging.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Geriatric medicine\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_3399\"}], \"name\": \"Geriatric medicine\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3399\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Geriatrics\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Health issues related to the immune system and their prevention, diagnosis and mangement.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Allergy, clinical immunology and immunotherapeutics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_3400\"}], \"name\": \"Allergy, clinical immunology and immunotherapeutics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3400\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Allergy\", \"Clinical immunology\", \"Immune disorders\", \"Immunomodulators\", \"Immunotherapeutics\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The prevention of pain and the evaluation, treatment and rehabilitation of persons in pain.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Pain medicine\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_3401\"}], \"name\": \"Pain medicine\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3401\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Algiatry\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Anaesthesia and anaesthetics.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Anaesthesiology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_3402\"}], \"name\": \"Anaesthesiology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3402\", \"exact_synonyms