_0176\"}, {\"name\": \"Molecular modelling\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2275\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"The study and simulation of molecular (typically protein) conformation using a computational model of physical forces and computer simulation.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Structure analysis||Structure prediction||Molecular dynamics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0081||topic_0082||topic_0176\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Biomolecular simulation||Molecular dynamics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_3892||topic_0176\"}], \"name\": \"Molecular dynamics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0176\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Protein dynamics\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The construction, analysis, evaluation, refinement etc. of models of a molecules properties or behaviour, including the modelling the structure of proteins in complex with small molecules or other macromolecules (docking).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Structure analysis||Structure prediction||Molecular modelling\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0081||topic_0082||topic_2275\"}], \"name\": \"Molecular modelling\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2275\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Comparative modelling\", \"Docking\", \"Homology modeling\", \"Homology modelling\", \"Molecular docking\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The archival, curation, processing and analysis of nucleic acid structural information, such as whole structures, structural features and alignments, and associated annotation.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Structure analysis||Nucleic acid structure analysis\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0081||topic_0097\"}, \"name\": \"Nucleic acid structure analysis\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0097\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Nucleic acid structure\"], \"narro