ylated DNA immunoprecipitation (MeDIP)\", \"Methylation sequencing\", \"WGBS\", \"Whole-genome bisulfite sequencing\", \"methy-seq\", \"methyl-seq\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"An antibody-based technique used to map in vivo RNA-protein interactions.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Immunoprecipitation experiment||RNA immunoprecipitation\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3656||topic_3794\"}], \"name\": \"RNA immunoprecipitation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3794\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"RIP\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"CLIP\", \"CLIP-seq\", \"HITS-CLIP\", \"PAR-CLIP\", \"iCLIP\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Cytometry is the measurement of the characteristics of cells.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Cytometry\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3934\"}], \"name\": \"Cytometry\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3934\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Flow cytometry\", \"Image cytometry\", \"Mass cytometry\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Molecular biology methods used to analyze the spatial organization of chromatin in a cell.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Chromosome conformation capture\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3940\"}], \"name\": \"Chromosome conformation capture\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3940\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"3C technologies\", \"3C-based methods\", \"Chromosome conformation analysis\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Chromatin accessibility\", \"Chromatin accessibility assay\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"An experiment for studying protein-protein interactions.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Protein interaction experiment\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3957\"}], \"name\": \"Protein interaction experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3957\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Co-immunoprecipitation\", \"Phage display\", \"Yeast one-hybrid\", \"Yeast two-hybrid\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The collective characterisation and quantification of pools of biological molecules that translate into the structure, function, and dynamics of an organism or organisms.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391\"}], \"name\": \"Omics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3391\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Proteomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0121\"}, {\"name\": \"Genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0622\"}, {\"name\": \"Metabolomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3172\"}, {\"name\": \"Phenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3298\"}, {\"name\": \"Molecular evolution\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3945\"}, {\"name\": \"Fluxomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3955\"}, {\"name\": \"Immunomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3967\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"Protein and peptide identification, especially in the study of whole proteomes of organisms.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Proteomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0121\"}], \"name\": \"Proteomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0121\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Bottom-up proteomics\", \"Discovery proteomics\", \"MS-based targeted proteomics\", \"MS-based untargeted proteomics\", \"Metaproteomics\", \"Peptide identification\", \"Protein and peptide identification\", \"Quantitative proteomics\", \"Targeted proteomics\", \"Top-down proteomics\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Whole genomes of one or more organisms, or genomes in general, such as meta-information on genomes, genome projects, gene names etc.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622\"}], \"name\": \"Genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0622\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Exomes\", \"Genome annotation\", \"Genomes\", \"Personal genomics\", \"Synthetic genomics\", \"Viral genomics\", \"Whole genomes\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Functional genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0085\"}, {\"name\": \"Structural genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0122\"}, {\"name\": \"Phylogenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0194\"}, {\"name\": \"Pharmacogenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0208\"}, {\"name\": \"Comparative genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0797\"}, {\"name\": \"Epigenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3173\"}, {\"name\": \"Metagenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3174\"}, {\"name\": \"Transcriptomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3308\"}, {\"name\": \"Population genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3796\"}, {\"name\": \"Proteogenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3922\"}, {\"name\": \"Paleogenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3943\"}, {\"name\": \"Epistasis\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3974\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"The study of gene or protein functions and their interactions in totality in a given organism, tissue, cell etc.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Functional genomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_0085\"}, \"name\": \"Functional genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0085\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The elucidation of the three dimensional structure for all (available) proteins in a given organism.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Structural genomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_0122\"}, \"name\": \"Structural genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0122\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The integrated study of evolutionary relationships and whole genome data, for example, in the analysis of species trees, horizontal gene transfer and evolutionary reconstruction.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Phylogenomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_0194\"}, \"name\": \"Phylogenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0194\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The influence of genotype on drug response, for example by correlating gene expression or single-nucleotide polymorphisms with drug efficacy or toxicity.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Pharmacogenomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_0208\"}, \"name\": \"Pharmacogenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0208\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Pharmacogenetics\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The study (typically comparison) of the sequence, structure or function of multiple genomes.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Comparative genomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_0797\"}], \"name\": \"Comparative genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0797\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The study of the epigenetic modifications of a whole cell, tissue, organism etc.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Epigenomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3173\"}, \"name\": \"Epigenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3173\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The study of genetic material recovered from environmental samples, and associated environmental data.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Metagenomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3174\"}, \"name\": \"Metagenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3174\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Biome sequencing\", \"Shotgun metagenomics\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The analysis of transcriptomes, or a set of all the RNA molecules in a specific cell, tissue etc.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Transcriptomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3308\"}, \"name\": \"Transcriptomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3308\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Comparative transcriptomics\", \"Metatranscriptomics\", \"Transcriptome\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Metatranscriptomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3941\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"The study of microbe gene expression within natural environments (i.e. the metatranscriptome).\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Transcriptomics||Metatranscriptomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3308||topic_3941\"}, \"name\": \"Metatranscriptomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3941\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Large-scale study (typically comparison) of DNA sequences of populations.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Population genomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3796\"}], \"name\": \"Population genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3796\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A field of biological research focused on the discovery and identification of peptides, typically by comparing mass spectra against a protein database.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Proteogenomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3922\"}], \"name\": \"Proteogenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3922\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The reconstruction and analysis of genomic information in extinct species.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Paleogenomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3943\"}], \"name\": \"Paleogenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3943\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Ancestral genomes\", \"Paleogenetics\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The study of the epigenetic modifications of a whole cell, tissue, organism etc.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Epistasis\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3974\"}, \"name\": \"Epistasis\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3974\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Epistatic genetic interaction\", \"Epistatic interactions\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The systematic study of metabolites, the chemical processes they are involved, and the chemical fingerprints of specific cellular processes in a whole cell, tissue, organ or organism.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Metabolomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_3172\"}], \"name\": \"Metabolomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3172\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Exometabolomics\", \"LC-MS-based metabolomics\", \"MS-based metabolomics\", \"MS-based targeted metabolomics\", \"MS-based untargeted metabolomics\", \"Mass spectrometry-based metabolomics\", \"Metabolites\", \"Metabolome\", \"Metabonomics\", \"NMR-based metabolomics\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Phenomes, or the study of the change in phenotype (the physical and biochemical traits of organisms) in response to genetic and environmental factors.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Phenomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_3298\"}, \"name\": \"Phenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3298\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"