Informatics||Biological databases||Data submission, annotation and curation\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_0219\"}], \"name\": \"Data submission, annotation and curation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0219\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Data curation\", \"Data provenance\", \"Database curation\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0769\": {\"definition\": \"Biological or biomedical analytical workflows or pipelines.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Workflows\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_0769\"}], \"name\": \"Workflows\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0769\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Pipelines\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Software integration\", \"Tool integration\", \"Tool interoperability\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3077\": {\"definition\": \"The acquisition of data, typically measurements of physical systems using any type of sampling system, or by another other means.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data acquisition\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3077\"}], \"name\": \"Data acquisition\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3077\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Data collection\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3263\": {\"definition\": \"The protection of data, such as patient health data, from damage or unwanted access from unauthorised users.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data security\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3263\"}], \"name\": \"Data security\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3263\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Data privacy\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3345\": {\"definition\": \"Topic concerning the identity of biological entities, or reports on such entities, and the mapping of entities and records in different databases.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data identity and mapping\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3345\"}], \"name\": \"Data identity and mapping\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3345\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3365\": {\"definition\": \"The development of policies, models and standards that cover data acquisition, storage and integration, such that it can be put to use, typically through a process of systematically applying statistical and / or logical techniques to describe, illustrate, summarise or evaluate data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data architecture, analysis and design\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3365\"}], \"name\": \"Data architecture, analysis and design\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3365\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Data analysis\", \"Data architecture\", \"Data design\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3366\": {\"definition\": \"The combination and integration of data from different sources, for example into a central repository or warehouse, to provide users with a unified view of these data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data integration and warehousing\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3366\"}], \"name\": \"Data integration and warehousing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3366\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Data integration\", \"Data warehousing\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3489\": {\"definition\": \"The general handling of data stored in digital archives such as databanks, databases proper, web portals and other data resources.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Database management\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3489\"}], \"name\": \"Database management\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3489\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Database administration\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Content management\", \"Data maintenance\", \"Document management\", \"Document, record and content management\", \"File management\", \"Record management\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3571\": {\"definition\": \"The control of data entry and maintenance to ensure the data meets defined standards, qualities or constraints.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data governance\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3571\"}], \"name\": \"Data governance\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3571\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Data stewardship\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3572\": {\"definition\": \"The quality, integrity, and cleaning up of data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data quality management\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3572\"}], \"name\": \"Data quality management\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3572\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Data clean-up\", \"Data cleaning\", \"Data integrity\", \"Data quality\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3948\": {\"definition\": \"Immunoinformatics is the field of computational biology that deals with the study of immunoloogical questions. Immunoinformatics is at the interface between immunology and computer science. It takes advantage of computational, statistical, mathematical approaches and enhances the understanding of immunological knowledge.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Informatics||Immunoinformatics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3948\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Immunology||Immunoinformatics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_0804||topic_3948\"}], \"name\": \"Immunoinformatics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3948\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Computational immunology\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3068\": {\"definition