|topic_3070||topic_0610\"}], \"name\": \"Ecology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0610\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Computational ecology\", \"Ecoinformatics\", \"Ecological informatics\", \"Ecosystem science\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Biodiversity\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3050\"}, {\"name\": \"Metagenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3174\"}, {\"name\": \"Microbial ecology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3697\"}]}, \"topic_3050\": {\"definition\": \"The degree of variation of life forms within a given ecosystem, biome or an entire planet.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Ecology||Biodiversity\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_0610||topic_3050\"}], \"name\": \"Biodiversity\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3050\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3174\": {\"definition\": \"The study of genetic material recovered from environmental samples, and associated environmental data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Ecology||Metagenomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_0610||topic_3174\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Metagenomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3174\"}], \"name\": \"Metagenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3174\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Biome sequencing\", \"Shotgun metagenomics\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3697\": {\"definition\": \"The ecology of microorganisms including their relationship with one another and their environment.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Ecology||Microbial ecology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_0610||topic_3697\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Microbiology||Microbial ecology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3301||topic_3697\"}], \"name\": \"Microbial ecology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3697\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Environmental microbiology\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Community analysis\", \"Microbiome\", \"Molecular community analysis\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0621\": {\"definition\": \"A specific organism, or group of organisms, used to study a particular aspect of biology.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Model organisms\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_0621\"}], \"name\": \"Model organisms\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0621\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Organisms\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0780\": {\"definition\": \"Plants, e.g. information on a specific plant genome including molecular sequences, genes and annotation.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Plant biology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_0780\"}], \"name\": \"Plant biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0780\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Botany\", \"Plant\", \"Plant science\", \"Plants\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Plant anatomy\", \"Plant cell biology\", \"Plant ecology\", \"Plant genetics\", \"Plant physiology\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0781\": {\"definition\": \"Study of viruses, e.g. sequence and structural data, interactions of viral proteins, or a viral genome including molecular sequences, genes and annotation.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Virology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_0781\"}], \"name\": \"Virology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0781\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_1317\": {\"definition\": \"The molecular structure of biological molecules, particularly macromolecules such as proteins and nucleic acids.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Structural biology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_1317\"}], \"name\": \"Structural biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_1317\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Structural assignment\", \"Structural determination\", \"Structure determination\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Structural genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0122\"}, {\"name\": \"NMR\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0593\"}, {\"name\": \"Electron microscopy\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0611\"}, {\"name\": \"X-ray diffraction\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2828\"}, {\"name\": \"Neutron diffraction\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3448\"}]}, \"topic_0122\": {\"definition\": \"The elucidation of the three dimensional structure for all (available) proteins in a given organism.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Structural biology||Structural genomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_1317||topic_0122\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Structural genomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_0122\"}], \"name\": \"Structural genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0122\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0593\": {\"definition\": \"An analytical technique that exploits the magenetic properties of certain atomic nuclei to provide information on the structure, dynamics, reaction state and chemical environment of molecules.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Structural biology||NMR\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_1317||topic_0593\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||NMR\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_0593\"}], \"name\": \"NMR\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0593\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"NMR spectroscopy\", \"Nuclear magnetic resonance spectroscopy\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"HOESY\", \"Heteronuclear Overhauser Effect Spectroscopy\", \"NOESY\", \"Nuclear Overhauser Effect Spectroscopy\", \"ROESY\", \"Rotational Frame Nuclear Overhauser Effect Spectroscopy\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0611\": {\"definition\": \"The study of matter by studying the interference pattern from firing electrons at a sample, to analyse structures at resolutions higher than can be achieved using light.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Structural biology||Electron microscopy\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_1317||topic_0611\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Electron microscopy\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_0611\"}], \"name\": \"Electron microscopy\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0611\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Electron crystallography\", \"SEM\", \"Scanning electron microscopy\", \"Single particle electron microscopy\", \"TEM\", \"Transmission electron microscopy\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_2828\": {\"definition\": \"The study of matter and their structure by means of the diffraction of X-rays, typically the diffraction pattern caused by the regularly spaced atoms of a crystalline sample.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Structural biology||X-ray diffraction\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_1317||topic_2828\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||X-ray diffraction\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_2828\"}], \"name\": \"X-ray diffraction\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2828\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Crystallography\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"X-ray crystallography\", \"X-ray microscopy\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3448\": {\"definition\": \"The study of matter by studying the diffraction pattern from firing neutrons at a sample, typically to determine atomic and/or magnetic structure.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Structural biology||Neutron diffraction\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_1317||topic_3448\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Neutron diffraction\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3448\"}], \"name\": \"Neutron diffraction\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3448\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Neutron diffraction experiment\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Elastic neutron scattering\", \"Neutron microscopy\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_2229\": {\"definition\": \"Cells, such as key genes and proteins involved in the cell cycle.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Cell biology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_2229\"}], \"name\": \"Cell biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2229\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Cells\", \"Cellular processes\", \"Protein subcellular localization\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_2259\": {\"definition\": \"The holistic modelling and analysis of complex biological systems and the interactions therein.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Systems biology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_2259\"}], \"name\": \"Systems biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2259\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Biological modelling\", \"Biological system modelling\", \"Systems modelling\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_2815\": {\"definition\": \"The study of human beings in general, including the human genome and proteome.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Human biology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_2815\"}], \"name\": \"Human biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2815\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Humans\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3047\": {\"definition\": \"The molecular basis of biological activity, particularly the macromolecules (e.g. proteins and nucleic acids) that are essential to life.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Molecular biology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3047\"}], \"name\": \"Molecular biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3047\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Biological processes\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3053\": {\"definition\": \"The study of genes, genetic variation and heredity in living organisms.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Genetics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||