ms in freshwater ecosystems.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Freshwater biology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3573\"}], \"name\": \"Freshwater biology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3573\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3810\": {\"definition\": \"Multidisciplinary study, research and development within the field of agriculture.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Agricultural science\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3810\"}], \"name\": \"Agricultural science\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3810\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Agricultural biotechnology\", \"Agricultural economics\", \"Animal breeding\", \"Animal husbandry\", \"Animal nutrition\", \"Farming systems research\", \"Food process engineering\", \"Food security\", \"Horticulture\", \"Phytomedicine\", \"Plant breeding\", \"Plant cultivation\", \"Plant nutrition\", \"Plant pathology\", \"Soil science\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3855\": {\"definition\": \"Study of the environment, the interactions between its physical, chemical, and biological components and it\'s effect on life.  Also how humans impact upon the environment, and how we can manage and utilise natural resources.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biology||Environmental science\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3855\"}], \"name\": \"Environmental science\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3855\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Environment\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3303\": {\"definition\": \"Research in support of healing by diagnosis, treatment, and prevention of disease.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303\"}], \"name\": \"Medicine\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3303\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Biomedical research\", \"Clinical medicine\", \"Experimental medicine\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"General medicine\", \"Inter