lling\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2275\"}]}, \"topic_0176\": {\"definition\": \"The study and simulation of molecular (typically protein) conformation using a computational model of physical forces and computer simulation.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Structure analysis||Structure prediction||Molecular dynamics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0081||topic_0082||topic_0176\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Biomolecular simulation||Molecular dynamics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_3892||topic_0176\"}], \"name\": \"Molecular dynamics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0176\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Protein dynamics\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_2275\": {\"definition\": \"The construction, analysis, evaluation, refinement etc. of models of a molecules properties or behaviour, including the modelling the structure of proteins in complex with small molecules or other macromolecules (docking).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Structure analysis||Structure prediction||Molecular modelling\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0081||topic_0082||topic_2275\"}], \"name\": \"Molecular modelling\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2275\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Comparative modelling\", \"Docking\", \"Homology modeling\", \"Homology modelling\", \"Molecular docking\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0152\": {\"definition\": \"Carbohydrates, typically including structural information.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Structure analysis||Carbohydrates\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0081||topic_0152\"}], \"name\": \"Carbohydrates\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0152\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0153\": {\"definition\": \"Lipids and their structures.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Structure analysis||Lipids\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0081||topic_0153\"}], \"name\": \"Lipids\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0153\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Lipidomics\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0154\": {\"definition\": \"Small molecules of biological significance, typically archival, curation, processing and analysis of structural information.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Structure analysis||Small molecules\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0081||topic_0154\"}], \"name\": \"Small molecules\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0154\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Amino acids\", \"Chemical structures\", \"Drug structures\", \"Drug targets\", \"Drugs and target structures\", \"Metabolite structures\", \"Peptides\", \"Peptides and amino acids\", \"Target structures\", \"Targets\", \"Toxins\", \"Toxins and targets\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0160\": {\"definition\": \"The archival, detection, prediction and analysis of positional features such as functional and other key sites, in molecular sequences and the conserved patterns (motifs, profiles etc.) that may be used to describe them.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Sequence sites, features and motifs\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0160\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence sites, features and motifs\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0160\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Functional sites\", \"HMMs\", \"Sequence features\", \"Sequence motifs\", \"Sequence profiles\", \"Sequence sites\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Protein sites, features and motifs\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3510\"}, {\"name\": \"Nucleic acid sites, features and motifs\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3511\"}]}, \"topic_0602\": {\"definition\": \"Molecular interactions, biological pathways, networks and other models.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Computa