montology.org/topic_3394\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Healthcare RA\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3966\": {\"definition\": \"The design of vaccines to protect against a particular pathogen, including antigens, delivery systems, and adjuvants to elicit a predictable immune response against specific epitopes.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Medicines research and development||Vaccinology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3376||topic_3966\"}], \"name\": \"Vaccinology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3966\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Rational vaccine design\", \"Reverse vaccinology\", \"Structural vaccinology\", \"Structure-based immunogen design\", \"Vaccine design\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3386\": {\"definition\": \"The use of animals and alternatives in experimental research.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Laboratory animal science\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3386\"}], \"name\": \"Laboratory animal science\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3386\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Animal experimentation\", \"Animal research\", \"Animal testing\", \"In vivo testing\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Animal study\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3679\"}]}, \"topic_3679\": {\"definition\": \"The design of an experiment involving non-human animals.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Laboratory animal science||Animal study\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3386||topic_3679\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Experimental design and studies||Animal study\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3678||topic_3679\"}], \"name\": \"Animal study\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3679\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Challenge study\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3390\": {\"definition\": \"The study of the effects of food components on the metabolism, health, performance and disease