lved in one or more specific diseases.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Pathology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_0634\"}], \"name\": \"Pathology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0634\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Disease\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Infectious disease\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3324\"}, {\"name\": \"Rare diseases\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3325\"}]}, \"topic_3324\": {\"definition\": \"The branch of medicine that deals with the prevention, diagnosis and management of transmissable disease with clinically evident illness resulting from infection with pathogenic biological agents (viruses, bacteria, fungi, protozoa, parasites and prions).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Pathology||Infectious disease\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_0634||topic_3324\"}], \"name\": \"Infectious disease\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3324\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Communicable disease\", \"Transmissable disease\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3325\": {\"definition\": \"The study of rare diseases.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Pathology||Rare diseases\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_0634||topic_3325\"}], \"name\": \"Rare diseases\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3325\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_2640\": {\"definition\": \"The study of cancer, for example, genes and proteins implicated in cancer.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Oncology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_2640\"}], \"name\": \"Oncology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2640\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Cancer biology\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Cancer\", \"Neoplasm\", \"Neoplasms\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_2840\": {\"definition\": \"Toxins and the adverse effects of these chemical substances on living organisms.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Toxicology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_2840\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Medicines research and development||Safety sciences||Toxicology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3376||topic_3377||topic_2840\"}], \"name\": \"Toxicology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2840\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Computational toxicology\", \"Toxicoinformatics\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3300\": {\"definition\": \"The functions of living organisms and their constituent parts.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Physiology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_3300\"}], \"name\": \"Physiology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3300\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Electrophysiology\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3305\": {\"definition\": \"Topic concerning the the patterns, cause, and effect of disease within populations.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Public health and epidemiology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_3305\"}], \"name\": \"Public health and epidemiology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3305\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Epidemiology\", \"Public health\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3322\": {\"definition\": \"The study of respiratory system.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Respiratory medicine\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_3322\"}], \"name\": \"Respiratory medicine\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3322\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Pulmonary medicine\", \"Pulmonology\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Pulmonary disorders\", \"Respiratory disease\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3334\": {\"definition\": \"The branch of medicine that deals with the anatomy, functions and disorders of the nervous system.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Neurology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_3334\"}], \"name\": \"Neurology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3334\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Neurological disorders\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3335\": {\"definition\": \"The diseases and abnormalities of the heart and circulatory system.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Cardiology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_3335\"}], \"name\": \"Cardiology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3335\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Cardiovascular medicine\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Cardiovascular disease\", \"Heart disease\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3342\": {\"definition\": \"\'translating\' the output of basic and biomedical research into better diagnostic tools, medicines, medical procedures, policies and advice.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Translational medicine\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_3342\"}], \"name\": \"Translational medicine\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3342\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Molecular medicine\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3388\"}]}, \"topic_3388\": {\"definition\": \"The identification of molecular and genetic causes of disease and the development of interventions to correct them.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Translational medicine||Molecular medicine\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_3342||topic_3388\"}], \"name\": \"Molecular medicine\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3388\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3396\": {\"definition\": \"An interdisciplinary field of study that looks at the dynamic systems of the human body as part of an integrted whole, incoporating biochemical, physiological, and environmental interactions that sustain life.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Systems medicine\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_3396\"}], \"name\": \"Systems medicine\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3396\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3397\": {\"definition\": \"Topic concerning the branch of medicine that deals with the prevention, diagnosis, and treatment of disease, disorder and injury in animals.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Veterinary medicine\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_3397\"}], \"name\": \"Veterinary medicine\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3397\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Clinical veterinary medicine\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3399\": {\"definition\": \"The branch of medicine dealing with the diagnosis, treatment and prevention of disease in older people, and the problems specific to aging.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Geriatric medicine\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_3399\"}], \"name\": \"Geriatric medicine\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3399\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Geriatrics\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3400\": {\"definition\": \"Health issues related to the immune system and their prevention, diagnosis and mangement.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Allergy, clinical immunology and immunotherapeutics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_3400\"}], \"name\": \"Allergy, clinical immunology and immunotherapeutics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3400\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Allergy\", \"Clinical immunology\", \"Immune disorders\", \"Immunomodulators\", \"Immunotherapeutics\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3401\": {\"definition\": \"The prevention of pain and the evaluation, treatment and rehabilitation of persons in pain.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Medicine||Pain medicine\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3303||topic_3401\"}], \"name\": \"Pain medicine\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3401\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Algiatry\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3402\": {\"definition\": \"Anaesthesia and anaesthetics.\", \