2275\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Comparative modelling\", \"Docking\", \"Homology modeling\", \"Homology modelling\", \"Molecular docking\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0152\": {\"definition\": \"Carbohydrates, typically including structural information.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Structure analysis||Carbohydrates\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0081||topic_0152\"}], \"name\": \"Carbohydrates\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0152\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0153\": {\"definition\": \"Lipids and their structures.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Structure analysis||Lipids\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0081||topic_0153\"}], \"name\": \"Lipids\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0153\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Lipidomics\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0154\": {\"definition\": \"Small molecules of biological significance, typically archival, curation, processing and analysis of structural information.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Structure analysis||Small molecules\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0081||topic_0154\"}], \"name\": \"Small molecules\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0154\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Amino acids\", \"Chemical structures\", \"Drug structures\", \"Drug targets\", \"Drugs and target structures\", \"Metabolite structures\", \"Peptides\", \"Peptides and amino acids\", \"Target structures\", \"Targets\", \"Toxins\", \"Toxins and targets\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0160\": {\"definition\": \"The archival, detection, prediction and analysis of positional features such as functional and other key sites, in molecular sequences and the conserved patterns (motifs, profiles etc.) that may be used to describe them.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Sequence sites, f