ogy.org/topic_0208\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Pharmacogenetics\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0804\": {\"definition\": \"The application of information technology to immunology such as immunological processes, immunological genes, proteins and peptide ligands, antigens and so on.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Immunology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_0804\"}], \"name\": \"Immunology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0804\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Immunoproteins and antigens\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2830\"}, {\"name\": \"Immunogenetics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3930\"}, {\"name\": \"Immunoinformatics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3948\"}]}, \"topic_3067\": {\"definition\": \"The form and function of the structures of living organisms.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Anatomy\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3067\"}], \"name\": \"Anatomy\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3067\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3277\": {\"definition\": \"Biological samples and specimens.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Sample collections\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3277\"}], \"name\": \"Sample collections\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3277\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Specimen collections\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"biosamples\", \"samples\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Biobank\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3337\"}, {\"name\": \"Mouse clinic\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3338\"}, {\"name\": \"Microbial collection\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3339\"}, {\"name\": \"Cell culture collection\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3340\"}, {\"name\": \"Clone library\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3341\"}]}, \"topic_3337\": {\