Sample collections||Clone library\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3277||topic_3341\"}], \"name\": \"Clone library\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3341\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3302\": {\"definition\": \"The biology of parasites.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Parasitology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3302\"}], \"name\": \"Parasitology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3302\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3304\": {\"definition\": \"The study of the nervous system and brain; its anatomy, physiology and function.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Neurobiology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3304\"}], \"name\": \"Neurobiology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3304\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Molecular neuroscience\", \"Neurophysiology\", \"Systemetic neuroscience\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3376\": {\"definition\": \"The discovery, development and approval of medicines.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Medicines research and development\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3376\"}], \"name\": \"Medicines research and development\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3376\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Drug discovery and development\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Drug discovery\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3336\"}, {\"name\": \"Drug development\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3373\"}, {\"name\": \"Biotherapeutics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3374\"}, {\"name\": \"Drug metabolism\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3375\"}, {\"name\": \"Safety sciences\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3377\"}, {\"name\": \"Preclinical and clinical studies\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3379\"}, {\"name\": \"Quality affairs\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3393\"}, {\"name\": \"Regulatory affairs\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3394\"}, {\"name\": \"Vaccinology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3966\"}]}, \"topic_3373\": {\"definition\": \"The process of bringing a new drug to market once a lead compounds has been identified through drug discovery.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Medicines research and development||Drug development\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3376||topic_3373\"}], \"name\": \"Drug development\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3373\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Drug development science\", \"Medicine development\", \"Medicines development\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3374\": {\"definition\": \"The process of formulating and administering a pharmaceutical compound to achieve a therapeutic effect.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Medicines research and development||Biotherapeutics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3376||topic_3374\"}], \"name\": \"Biotherapeutics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3374\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3375\": {\"definition\": \"The study of how a drug interacts with the body.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Medicines research and development||Drug metabolism\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3376||topic_3375\"}], \"name\": \"Drug metabolism\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3375\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"ADME\", \"Drug absorption\", \"Drug distribution\", \"Drug excretion\", \"Pharmacodynamics\", \"Pharmacokinetics\", \"Pharmacokinetics and pharmacodynamics\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3377\": {\"definition\": \"The safety (or lack) of drugs and other medical interventions.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Medicines research and development||Safety sciences\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3376||topic_3377\"}], \"name\": \"Safety sciences\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3377\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Drug safety\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Toxicology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2840\"}, {\"name\": \"Pharmacovigilance\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3378\"}]}, \"topic_3378\": {\"definition\": \"The detection, assesment, understanding and prevention of adverse effects of medicines.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Medicines research and development||Safety sciences||Pharmacovigilance\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3376||topic_3377||topic_3378\"}], \"name\": \"Pharmacovigilance\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3378\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3379\": {\"definition\": \"The testing of new medicines, vaccines or procedures on animals (preclinical) and humans (clinical) prior to their approval by regulatory authorities.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Medicines research and development||Preclinical and clinical studies\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3376||topic_3379\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Experimental design and studies||Preclinical and clinical studies\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3678||topic_3379\"}], \"name\": \"Preclinical and clinical studies\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3379\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Clinical studies\", \"Clinical study\", \"Clinical trial\", \"Drug trials\", \"Preclinical studies\", \"Preclinical study\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3393\": {\"definition\": \"The processes that need to be in place to ensure the quality of products for human or animal use.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Medicines research and development||Quality affairs\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3376||topic_3393\"}], \"name\": \"Quality affairs\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3393\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Quality assurance\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Good clinical practice\", \"Good laboratory practice\", \"Good manufacturing practice\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3394\": {\"definition\": \"The protection of public health by controlling the safety and efficacy of products in areas including pharmaceuticals, veterinary medicine, medical devices, pesticides, agrochemicals, cosmetics, and complementary medicines.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Medicines research and development||Regulatory affairs\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3376||topic_3394\"}], \"name\": \"Regulatory affairs\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3394\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Healthcare RA\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3966\": {\"definition\": \"The design of vaccines to protect against a particular pathogen, including antigens, delivery systems, and adjuvants to elicit a predictable immune response against specific epitopes.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Medicines research and development||Vaccinology\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3376||topic_3966\"}], \"name\": \"Vaccinology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3966\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Rational vaccine design\", \"Reverse vaccinology\", \"Structural vaccinology\", \"Structure-based immunogen design\", \"Vaccine design\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3386\": {\"definition\": \"The use of animals and alternatives in experimental research.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Laboratory animal science\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3386\"}], \"name\": \"Laboratory animal science\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3386\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Animal experimentation\", \"Animal research\", \"Animal testing\", \"In vivo testing\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Animal study\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3679\"}]}, \"topic_3679\": {\"definition\": \"The design of an experiment involving non-human animals.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Laboratory animal science||Animal study\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3386||topic_3679\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Experimental design and studies||Animal study\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3678||topic_3679\"}], \"name\": \"Animal study\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3679\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Challenge study\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3390\": {\"definition\": \"The study of the effects of food components on the metabolism, health, performance and disease resistance of humans and animals.  It also includes the study of human behaviours related to food choices.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Nutritional science\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3390\"}], \"name\": \"Nutritional science\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3390\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Nutrition\", \"Nutrition science\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Dietetics\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3395\": {\"definition\": \"Biomedical approaches to clinical interventions that involve the use of stem cells.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Regenerative medicine\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3395\"}], \"name\": \"Regenerative medicine\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3395\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Stem cell research\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3361\": {\"definition\": \"The procedures used to conduct an experiment.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361\"}], \"name\": \"Laboratory techniques\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3361\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Experimental techniques\", \"Lab method\", \"Lab techniques\", \"Laboratory method\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Experiments\", \"Laboratory experiments\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Sequencing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3168\"}, {\"name\": \"Imaging\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3382\"}, {\"name\": \"Genotyping experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3516\"}, {\"name\": \"Microarray experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3518\"}, {\"name\": \"PCR experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3519\"}, {\"name\": \"Proteomics experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3520\"}, {\"name\": \"RNAi experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3523\"}, {\"name\": \"Simulation experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3524\"}, {\"name\": \"Immunoprecipitation experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3656\"}, {\"name\": \"Cytometry\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3934\"}, {\"name\": \"Chromosome conformation capture\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3940\"}, {\"name\": \"Protein interaction experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3957\"}]}, \"topic_3168\": {\"definition\": \"The determination of complete (typically nucleotide) sequences, including those of genomes (full genome sequencing, de novo sequencing and resequencing), amplicons and transcriptomes.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Sequencing\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3168\"}], \"name\": \"Sequencing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3168\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"DNA-Seq\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Chromosome walking\", \"Clone verification\", \"DNase-Seq\", \"High throughput sequencing\", \"High-throughput sequencing\", \"NGS\", \"NGS data analysis\", \"Next gen sequencing\", \"Next generation sequencing\", \"Panels\", \"Primer walking\", \"Sanger sequencing\", \"Targeted next-generation sequencing panels\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"ChIP-seq\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3169\"}, {\"name\": \"RNA-Seq\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3170\"}, {\"name\": \"Whole genome sequencing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3673\"}, {\"name\": \"Exome sequencing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3676\"}, {\"name\": \"Metagenomic sequencing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3837\"}]}, \"topic_3169\": {\"definition\": \"The analysis of protein-DNA interactions where chromatin immunoprecipitation (ChIP) is used in combination with massively parallel DNA sequencing to identify the binding sites of DNA-associated proteins.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Sequencing||ChIP-seq\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3168||topic_3169\"}, {\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Immunoprecipitation experiment||ChIP-seq\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3656||topic_3169\"}], \"name\": \"ChIP-seq\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3169\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"ChIP-sequencing\", \"Chip Seq\", \"Chip sequencing\", \"Chip-sequencing\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"ChIP-exo\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3170\": {\"definition\": \"A topic concerning high-throughput sequencing of cDNA to measure the RNA content (transcriptome) of a sample, for example, to investigate how different alleles of a gene are expressed, detect post-transcriptional mutations or identify gene fusions.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Sequencing||RNA-Seq\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3168||topic_3170\"}], \"name\": \"RNA-Seq\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3170\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"RNA sequencing\", \"RNA-Seq analysis\", \"Small RNA sequencing\", \"Small RNA-Seq\", \"Small-Seq\", \"Transcriptome profiling\", \"WTSS\", \"Whole transcriptome shotgun sequencing\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"MicroRNA sequencing\", \"miRNA-seq\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3673\": {\"definition\": \"Laboratory technique to sequence the complete DNA sequence of an organism\'s genome at a single time.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Sequencing||Whole genome sequencing\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3168||topic_3673\"}], \"name\": \"Whole genome sequencing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3673\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Genome sequencing\", \"WGS\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"De novo genome sequencing\", \"Whole genome resequencing\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3676\": {\"definition\": \"Laboratory technique to sequence all the protein-coding regions in a genome, i.e., the exome.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Sequencing||Exome sequencing\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3168||topic_3676\"}], \"name\": \"Exome sequencing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3676\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Exome\", \"Exome analysis\", \"Exome capture\", \"Targeted exome capture\", \"WES\", \"Whole exome sequencing\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3837\": {\"definition\": \"Approach which samples, in parallel, all genes in all organisms present in a given sample, e.g. to provide insight into biodiversity and function.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Sequencing||Metagenomic sequencing\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3168||topic_3837\"}], \"name\": \"Metagenomic sequencing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3837\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Shotgun metagenomic sequencing\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3382\": {\"definition\": \"The visual representation of an object.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382\"}], \"name\": \"Imaging\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3382\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Diffraction experiment\", \"Microscopy\", \"Microscopy imaging\", \"Optical super resolution microscopy\", \"Photonic force microscopy\", \"Photonic microscopy\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"NMR\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0593\"}, {\"name\": \"Electron microscopy\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0611\"}, {\"name\": \"X-ray diffraction\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_2828\"}, {\"name\": \"Bioimaging\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3383\"}, {\"name\": \"Medical imaging\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3384\"}, {\"name\": \"Light microscopy\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3385\"}, {\"name\": \"MRI\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3444\"}, {\"name\": \"Neutron diffraction\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3448\"}, {\"name\": \"Tomography\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3452\"}, {\"name\": \"Echography\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3954\"}]}, \"topic_3383\": {\"definition\": \"The use of imaging techniques to understand biology.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Bioimaging\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3383\"}], \"name\": \"Bioimaging\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3383\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Biological imaging\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3384\": {\"definition\": \"The use of imaging techniques for clinical purposes for medical research.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Medical imaging\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3384\"}], \"name\": \"Medical imaging\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3384\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Neuroimaging\", \"Nuclear medicine\", \"Radiology\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3385\": {\"definition\": \"The use of optical instruments to magnify the image of an object.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Light microscopy\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3385\"}], \"name\": \"Light microscopy\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3385\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3444\": {\"definition\": \"Techniques that uses magnetic fields and radiowaves to form images, typically to investigate the anatomy and physiology of the human body.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||MRI\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3444\"}], \"name\": \"MRI\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3444\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"MRT\", \"Magnetic resonance imaging\", \"Magnetic resonance tomography\", \"NMRI\", \"Nuclear magnetic resonance imaging\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3452\": {\"definition\": \"Imaging in sections (sectioning), through the use of a wave-generating device (tomograph) that generates an image (a tomogram).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Tomography\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3452\"}], \"name\": \"Tomography\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3452\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"CT\", \"Computed tomography\", \"TDM\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Electron tomography\", \"PET\", \"Positron emission tomography\", \"X-ray tomography\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3954\": {\"definition\": \"A diagnostic imaging technique based on the application of ultrasound.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Echography\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3954\"}], \"name\": \"Echography\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3954\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Standardized echography\", \"Ultrasound imaging\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Diagnostic sonography\", \"Medical ultrasound\", \"Standard echography\", \"Ultrasonography\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3516\": {\"definition\": \"Genotype experiment including case control, population, and family studies. These might use array based methods and re-sequencing methods.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Genotyping experiment\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3516\"}], \"name\": \"Genotyping experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3516\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3518\": {\"definition\": \"Microarray experiments including conditions, protocol, sample:data relationships etc.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Microarray experiment\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3518\"}], \"name\": \"Microarray experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3518\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Microarrays\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Gene expression microarray\", \"Genotyping array\", \"Methylation array\", \"MicroRNA array\", \"Multichannel microarray\", \"One channel microarray\", \"Proprietary platform micoarray\", \"RNA chips\", \"RNA microarrays\", \"Reverse phase protein array\", \"SNP array\", \"Tiling arrays\", \"Tissue microarray\", \"Two channel microarray\", \"aCGH microarray\", \"mRNA microarray\", \"miRNA array\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3519\": {\"definition\": \"PCR experiments, e.g. quantitative real-time PCR.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||PCR experiment\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3519\"}], \"name\": \"PCR experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3519\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Polymerase chain reaction\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Quantitative PCR\", \"RT-qPCR\", \"Real Time Quantitative PCR\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3520\": {\"definition\": \"Proteomics experiments.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Proteomics experiment\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3520\"}], \"name\": \"Proteomics experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3520\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"2D PAGE experiment\", \"DIA\", \"Data-independent acquisition\", \"MS\", \"MS experiments\", \"Mass spectrometry\", \"Mass spectrometry experiments\", \"Northern blot experiment\", \"Spectrum demultiplexing\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3523\": {\"definition\": \"RNAi experiments.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||RNAi experiment\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3523\"}], \"name\": \"RNAi experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3523\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3524\": {\"definition\": \"Biological computational model experiments (simulation), for example the minimum information required in order to permit its correct interpretation and reproduction.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Simulation experiment\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3524\"}], \"name\": \"Simulation experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3524\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3656\": {\"definition\": \"Experimental techniques to purify a protein-DNA crosslinked complex.  Usually sequencing follows e.g. in the techniques ChIP-chip, ChIP-seq and MeDIP-seq.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Immunoprecipitation experiment\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3656\"}], \"name\": \"Immunoprecipitation experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3656\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Chromatin immunoprecipitation\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"ChIP-seq\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3169\"}, {\"name\": \"ChIP-on-chip\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3179\"}, {\"name\": \"Methylated DNA immunoprecipitation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3674\"}, {\"name\": \"RNA immunoprecipitation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3794\"}]}, \"topic_3179\": {\"definition\": \"Experimental techniques that combine chromatin immunoprecipitation (\'ChIP\') with microarray (\'chip\'). ChIP-on-chip is used for high-throughput study protein-DNA interactions.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Immunoprecipitation experiment||ChIP-on-chip\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3656||topic_3179\"}], \"name\": \"ChIP-on-chip\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3179\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"ChIP-chip\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"ChiP\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3674\": {\"definition\": \"Laboratory technique to sequence the methylated regions in DNA.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Immunoprecipitation experiment||Methylated DNA immunoprecipitation\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3656||topic_3674\"}], \"name\": \"Methylated DNA immunoprecipitation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3674\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"MeDIP-chip\", \"MeDIP-seq\", \"mDIP\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"BS-Seq\", \"Bisulfite sequencing\", \"MeDIP\", \"Methylated DNA immunoprecipitation (MeDIP)\", \"Methylation sequencing\", \"WGBS\", \"Whole-genome bisulfite sequencing\", \"methy-seq\", \"methyl-seq\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3794\": {\"definition\": \"An antibody-based technique used to map in vivo RNA-protein interactions.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Immunoprecipitation experiment||RNA immunoprecipitation\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3656||topic_3794\"}], \"name\": \"RNA immunoprecipitation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3794\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"RIP\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"CLIP\", \"CLIP-seq\", \"HITS-CLIP\", \"PAR-CLIP\", \"iCLIP\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3934\": {\"definition\": \"Cytometry is the measurement of the characteristics of cells.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Cytometry\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3934\"}], \"name\": \"Cytometry\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3934\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Flow cytometry\", \"Image cytometry\", \"Mass cytometry\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3940\": {\"definition\": \"Molecular biology methods used to analyze the spatial organization of chromatin in a cell.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Chromosome conformation capture\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3940\"}], \"name\": \"Chromosome conformation capture\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3940\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"3C technologies\", \"3C-based methods\", \"Chromosome conformation analysis\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Chromatin accessibility\", \"Chromatin accessibility assay\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3957\": {\"definition\": \"An experiment for studying protein-protein interactions.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Protein interaction experiment\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3957\"}], \"name\": \"Protein interaction experiment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3957\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Co-immunoprecipitation\", \"Phage display\", \"Yeast one-hybrid\", \"Yeast two-hybrid\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3391\": {\"definition\": \"The collective characterisation and quantification of pools of biological molecules that translate into the structure, function, and dynamics of an organism or organisms.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391\"}], \"name\": \"Omics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3391\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Proteomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0121\"}, {\"name\": \"Genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0622\"}, {\"name\": \"Metabolomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3172\"}, {\"name\": \"Phenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3298\"}, {\"name\": \"Molecular evolution\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3945\"}, {\"name\": \"Fluxomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3955\"}, {\"name\": \"Immunomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3967\"}]}, \"topic_0121\": {\"definition\": \"Protein and peptide identification, especially in the study of whole proteomes of organisms.\", \"path