, \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3974\"}]}, \"topic_0797\": {\"definition\": \"The study (typically comparison) of the sequence, structure or function of multiple genomes.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Comparative genomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_0797\"}], \"name\": \"Comparative genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0797\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3796\": {\"definition\": \"Large-scale study (typically comparison) of DNA sequences of populations.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Population genomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3796\"}], \"name\": \"Population genomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3796\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3922\": {\"definition\": \"A field of biological research focused on the discovery and identification of peptides, typically by comparing mass spectra against a protein database.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Proteogenomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3922\"}], \"name\": \"Proteogenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3922\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3943\": {\"definition\": \"The reconstruction and analysis of genomic information in extinct species.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Paleogenomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3943\"}], \"name\": \"Paleogenomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3943\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Ancestral genomes\", \"Paleogenetics\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3172\": {\"definition\": \"The systematic study of metabolites, the chemical processes they are involved, and the chemical fingerprints of specific cellular processes in a whole cell, tissue, organ or organism.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Metabolomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_3172\"}], \"name\": \"Metabolomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3172\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Exometabolomics\", \"LC-MS-based metabolomics\", \"MS-based metabolomics\", \"MS-based targeted metabolomics\", \"MS-based untargeted metabolomics\", \"Mass spectrometry-based metabolomics\", \"Metabolites\", \"Metabolome\", \"Metabonomics\", \"NMR-based metabolomics\"], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3955\": {\"definition\": \"Experimental approaches to determine the rates of metabolic reactions - the metabolic fluxes - within a biological entity.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Fluxomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_3955\"}], \"name\": \"Fluxomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3955\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3967\": {\"definition\": \"The study of immune system as a whole, its regulation and response to pathogens using genome-wide approaches.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Omics||Immunomics\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_3967\"}], \"name\": \"Immunomics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3967\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_3678\": {\"definition\": \"The design of an experiment intended to test a hypothesis, and describe or explain empirical data obtained under various experimental conditions.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Topic||Experimental design and studies\", \"key\": \"topic_0003||topic_3678\"}], \"name\": \"Experimental design and studies\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3678\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Design of experiments\", \"Experimental design\", \"Studies\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Preclinical and clinical studies\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3379\"}, {\"name\": \"GWAS study\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_3517\"}, {\"nam