smids, phages, DNA probes and primers and so on.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"Cheminformatics\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"topic_2258\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [\"Chemical informatics\", \"Chemoinformatics\"], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"The application of information technology to chemistry in biological research environment.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"Medical informatics\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"topic_3063\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [\"Biomedical informatics\", \"Clinical informatics\", \"Health and disease\", \"Health informatics\", \"Healthcare informatics\"], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"The application of information technology to health, disease and biomedicine.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"Biological databases\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"topic_3071\"}, \"ch\": [{\"t\": \"Data submission, annotation and curation\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"topic_0219\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [\"Data curation\", \"Data provenance\", \"Database curation\"], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Deposition and curation of database accessions, including annotation, typically with terms from a controlled vocabulary.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"Workflows\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"topic_0769\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [\"Pipelines\"], \"ns\": [\"Software integration\", \"Tool integration\", \"Tool interoperability\"], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Biological or biomedical analytical workflows or pipelines.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"Data acquisition\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"topic_3077\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [\"Data collection\"], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"The acquisition of data, typically measurements of physical systems using any type of sampling system, or by another other means.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"Data security\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"topic_3263\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [\"Data privacy\"], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"The protection of data, such as patient health data, from damage or unwanted access from unauthorised users.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"Data identity and mapping\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"topic_3345\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Topic concerning the identity of biological entities, or reports on such entities, and the mapping of entities and records in different databases.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"Data architecture, analysis and design\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"topic_3365\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [\"Data analysis\", \"Data architecture\", \"Data design\"], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"The development of policies, models and standards that cover data acquisition, storage and integration, such that it can be put to use, typically through a process of systematically applying statistical and / or logical techniques to describe, illustrate, summarise or evaluate data.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"Data integration and warehousing\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"topic_3366\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [\"Data integration\", \"Data warehousing\"], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"The combination and integration of data from different sources, for example into a central repository or warehouse, to provide users with a unified view of these data.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"Database management\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"topic_3489\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [\"Database administration\"], \"ns\": [\"Content management\", \"Data maintenance\", \"Document management\", \"Document, record and content management\", \"File management\", \"Record management\"], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"The general handling of data stored in digital archives such as databanks, databases proper, web portals and other data resources.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"Data governance\", \"data\": {\"uri\