pressed, detect post-transcriptional mutations or identify gene fusions.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"Whole genome sequencing\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"topic_3673\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [\"Genome sequencing\", \"WGS\"], \"ns\": [\"De novo genome sequencing\", \"Whole genome resequencing\"], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Laboratory technique to sequence the complete DNA sequence of an organism\'s genome at a single time.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"Exome sequencing\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"topic_3676\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [\"Exome\", \"Exome analysis\", \"Exome capture\", \"Targeted exome capture\", \"WES\", \"Whole exome sequencing\"], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Laboratory technique to sequence all the protein-coding regions in a genome, i.e., the exome.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"Metagenomic sequencing\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"topic_3837\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [\"Shotgun metagenomic sequencing\"], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Approach which samples, in parallel, all genes in all organisms present in a given sample, e.g. to provide insight into biodiversity and function.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}], \"es\": [\"DNA-Seq\"], \"ns\": [\"Chromosome walking\", \"Clone verification\", \"DNase-Seq\", \"High throughput sequencing\", \"High-throughput sequencing\", \"NGS\", \"NGS data analysis\", \"Next gen sequencing\", \"Next generation sequencing\", \"Panels\", \"Primer walking\", \"Sanger sequencing\", \"Targeted next-generation sequencing panels\"], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"The determination of complete (typically nucleotide) sequences, including those of genomes (full genome sequencing, de novo sequencing and resequencing), amplicons and transcriptomes.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"Imaging\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"topic_3382\"}, \"ch\": [{\"t\": \"NMR\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"topic_0593\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [\"NMR spectros