chniques||Imaging\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"An analytical technique that exploits the magenetic properties of certain atomic nuclei to provide information on the structure, dynamics, reaction state and chemical environment of molecules.\", \"n\": \"NMR\", \"ns\": [\"HOESY\", \"Heteronuclear Overhauser Effect Spectroscopy\", \"NOESY\", \"Nuclear Overhauser Effect Spectroscopy\", \"ROESY\", \"Rotational Frame Nuclear Overhauser Effect Spectroscopy\"], \"u\": \"topic_0593\", \"es\": [\"NMR spectroscopy\", \"Nuclear magnetic resonance spectroscopy\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": {\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||NMR\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_0593\"}, \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The study of matter by studying the interference pattern from firing electrons at a sample, to analyse structures at resolutions higher than can be achieved using light.\", \"n\": \"Electron microscopy\", \"ns\": [\"Electron crystallography\", \"SEM\", \"Scanning electron microscopy\", \"Single particle electron microscopy\", \"TEM\", \"Transmission electron microscopy\"], \"u\": \"topic_0611\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": {\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Electron microscopy\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_0611\"}, \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The study of matter and their structure by means of the diffraction of X-rays, typically the diffraction pattern caused by the regularly spaced atoms of a crystalline sample.\", \"n\": \"X-ray diffraction\", \"ns\": [\"X-ray crystallography\", \"X-ray microscopy\"], \"u\": \"topic_2828\", \"es\": [\"Crystallography\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": {\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||X-ray diffraction\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_2828\"}, \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The use of imaging techniques to understa