_0769\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3077\": {\"d\": \"The acquisition of data, typically measurements of physical systems using any type of sampling system, or by another other means.\", \"n\": \"Data acquisition\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3077\", \"es\": [\"Data collection\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data acquisition\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3077\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3263\": {\"d\": \"The protection of data, such as patient health data, from damage or unwanted access from unauthorised users.\", \"n\": \"Data security\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3263\", \"es\": [\"Data privacy\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data security\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3263\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3345\": {\"d\": \"Topic concerning the identity of biological entities, or reports on such entities, and the mapping of entities and records in different databases.\", \"n\": \"Data identity and mapping\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3345\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data identity and mapping\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3345\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3365\": {\"d\": \"The development of policies, models and standards that cover data acquisition, storage and integration, such that it can be put to use, typically through a process of systematically applying statistical and / or logical techniques to describe, illustrate, summarise or evaluate data.\", \"n\": \"Data architecture, analysis and design\", \"ns\": [\"Data analysis\", \"Data architecture\", \"Data design\"], \"u\": \"topic_3365\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data architecture, analysis and design\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3365\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3366\": {\"d\": \"The combination and integration of data from different sources, for example into a central repository or warehouse, to provide users with a unified view of these data.\", \"n\": \"Data integration and warehousing\", \"ns\": [\"Data integration\", \"Data warehousing\"], \"u\": \"topic_3366\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data integration and warehousing\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3366\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3489\": {\"d\": \"The general handling of data stored in digital archives such as databanks, databases proper, web portals and other data resources.\", \"n\": \"Database management\", \"ns\": [\"Content management\", \"Data maintenance\", \"Document management\", \"Document, record and content management\", \"File management\", \"Record management\"], \"u\": \"topic_3489\", \"es\": [\"Database administration\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Database management\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3489\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3571\": {\"d\": \"The control of data entry and maintenance to ensure the data meets defined standards, qualities or constraints.\", \"n\": \"Data governance\", \"ns\": [\"Data stewardship\"], \"u\": \"topic_3571\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data governance\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3571\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3572\": {\"d\": \"The quality, integrity, and cleaning up of data.\", \"n\": \"Data quality management\", \"ns\": [\"Data clean-up\", \"Data cleaning\", \"Data integrity\", \"Data quality\"], \"u\": \"topic_3572\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data quality management\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_30