ional analysis\"], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Functional genomics\", \"u\": \"topic_0085\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Function analysis\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_1775\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0085\": {\"d\": \"The study of gene or protein functions and their interactions in totality in a given organism, tissue, cell etc.\", \"n\": \"Functional genomics\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0085\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Function analysis||Functional genomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_1775||topic_0085\"}, {\"n\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Functional genomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_0085\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3892\": {\"d\": \"The study and simulation of molecular conformations using a computational model and computer simulations.\", \"n\": \"Biomolecular simulation\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3892\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Molecular dynamics\", \"u\": \"topic_0176\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Biomolecular simulation\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_3892\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3314\": {\"d\": \"The composition and properties of matter, reactions, and the use of reactions to create new substances.\", \"n\": \"Chemistry\", \"ns\": [\"Inorganic chemistry\", \"Mathematical chemistry\", \"Nuclear chemistry\", \"Organic chemistry\", \"Physical chemistry\"], \"u\": \"topic_3314\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Biochemistry\", \"u\": \"topic_3292\"}, {\"n\": \"Computational chemistry\", \"u\": \"topic_3332\"}, {\"n\": \"Drug discovery\", \"u\": \"topic_3336\"}, {\"n\": \"Analytical chemistry\", \"u\": \"topic_3370\"}, {\"n\": \"Synthetic chemistry\", \"u\": \"topic_3371\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Chemistry\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3314\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3332\": {\"d\": \"Topic concerning the develo