anism\'s genome at a single time.\", \"n\": \"Whole genome sequencing\", \"ns\": [\"De novo genome sequencing\", \"Whole genome resequencing\"], \"u\": \"topic_3673\", \"es\": [\"Genome sequencing\", \"WGS\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Sequencing||Whole genome sequencing\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3168||topic_3673\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3676\": {\"d\": \"Laboratory technique to sequence all the protein-coding regions in a genome, i.e., the exome.\", \"n\": \"Exome sequencing\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3676\", \"es\": [\"Exome\", \"Exome analysis\", \"Exome capture\", \"Targeted exome capture\", \"WES\", \"Whole exome sequencing\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Sequencing||Exome sequencing\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3168||topic_3676\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3837\": {\"d\": \"Approach which samples, in parallel, all genes in all organisms present in a given sample, e.g. to provide insight into biodiversity and function.\", \"n\": \"Metagenomic sequencing\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3837\", \"es\": [\"Shotgun metagenomic sequencing\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Sequencing||Metagenomic sequencing\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3168||topic_3837\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3382\": {\"d\": \"The visual representation of an object.\", \"n\": \"Imaging\", \"ns\": [\"Diffraction experiment\", \"Microscopy\", \"Microscopy imaging\", \"Optical super resolution microscopy\", \"Photonic force microscopy\", \"Photonic microscopy\"], \"u\": \"topic_3382\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"NMR\", \"u\": \"topic_0593\"}, {\"n\": \"Electron microscopy\", \"u\": \"topic_0611\"}, {\"n\": \"X-ray diffraction\", \"u\": \"topic_2828\"}, {\"n\": \"Bioimaging\", \"u\": \"topic_3383\"}, {\"n\": \"Medical imaging\", \"u\": \"topic_3384\"}, {\"n\": \"Light microscopy\", \"u\": \"topic_3385\"}, {\"n\": \"MRI\", \"u\": \"topic_3444\"}, {\"n\": \"Neutron diffraction\", \"u\": \"topic_3448\"}, {\"n\": \"Tomography\", \"u\": \"topic_3452\"}, {\"n\": \"Echography\", \"u\": \"topic_3954\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3383\": {\"d\": \"The use of imaging techniques to understand biology.\", \"n\": \"Bioimaging\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3383\", \"es\": [\"Biological imaging\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Bioimaging\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3383\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3384\": {\"d\": \"The use of imaging techniques for clinical purposes for medical research.\", \"n\": \"Medical imaging\", \"ns\": [\"Neuroimaging\", \"Nuclear medicine\", \"Radiology\"], \"u\": \"topic_3384\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Medical imaging\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3384\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3385\": {\"d\": \"The use of optical instruments to magnify the image of an object.\", \"n\": \"Light microscopy\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3385\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Light microscopy\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3385\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3444\": {\"d\": \"Techniques that uses magnetic fields and radiowaves to form images, typically to investigate the anatomy and physiology of the human body.\", \"n\": \"MRI\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3444\", \"es\": [\"MRT\", \"Magnetic resonance imaging\", \"Magnetic resonance tomography\", \"NMRI\", \"Nuclear magnetic resonance imaging\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||MRI\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3444\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3452\": {\"d\": \"Imaging in sections (sectioning), through the use of a wave-generating device (tomograph) that generates an image (a tomogram).\", \"n\": \"Tomography\", \"ns\": [\"Electron tomography\", \"PET\", \"Positron emission tomography\", \"X-ray tomography\"], \"u\": \"topic_3452\", \"es\": [\"CT\", \"Computed tomography\", \"TDM\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Tomography\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3452\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3954\": {\"d\": \"A diagnostic imaging technique based on the application of ultrasound.\", \"n\": \"Echography\", \"ns\": [\"Diagnostic sonography\", \"Medical ultrasound\", \"Standard echography\", \"Ultrasonography\"], \"u\": \"topic_3954\", \"es\": [\"Standardized echography\", \"Ultrasound imaging\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Echography\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3954\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3516\": {\"d\": \"Genotype experiment including case control, population, and family studies. These might use array based methods and re-sequencing methods.\", \"n\": \"Genotyping experiment\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3516\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Genotyping experiment\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3516\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3518\": {\"d\": \"Microarray experiments including conditions, protocol, sample:data relationships etc.\", \"n\": \"Microarray experiment\", \"ns\": [\"Gene expression microarray\", \"Genotyping array\", \"Methylation array\", \"MicroRNA array\", \"Multichannel microarray\", \"One channel microarray\", \"Proprietary platform micoarray\", \"RNA chips\", \"RNA microarrays\", \"Reverse phase protein array\", \"SNP array\", \"Tiling arrays\", \"Tissue microarray\", \"Two channel microarray\", \"aCGH microarray\", \"mRNA microarray\", \"miRNA array\"], \"u\": \"topic_3518\", \"es\": [\"Microarrays\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Microarray experiment\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3518\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3519\": {\"d\": \"PCR experiments, e.g. quantitative real-time PCR.\", \"n\": \"PCR experiment\", \"ns\": [\"Quantitative PCR\", \"RT-qPCR\", \"Real Time Quantitative PCR\"], \"u\": \"topic_3519\", \"es\": [\"Polymerase chain reaction\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||PCR experiment\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3519\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3520\": {\"d\": \"Proteomics experiments.\", \"n\": \"Proteomics experiment\", \"ns\": [\"2D PAGE experiment\", \"DIA\", \"Data-independent acquisition\", \"MS\", \"MS experiments\", \"Mass spectrometry\", \"Mass spectrometry experiments\", \"Northern blot experiment\", \"Spectrum demultiplexing\"], \"u\": \"topic_3520\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Proteomics experiment\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3520\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3523\": {\"d\": \"RNAi experiments.\", \"n\": \"RNAi experiment\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3523\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||RNAi experiment\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3523\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3524\": {\"d\": \"Biological computational model experiments (simulation), for example the minimum information required in order to permit its correct interpretation and reproduction.\", \"n\": \"Simulation experiment\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3524\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Simulation experiment\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3524\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3656\": {\"d\": \"Experimental techniques to purify a protein-DNA crosslinked complex.  Usually sequencing follows e.g. in the techniques ChIP-chip, ChIP-seq and MeDIP-seq.\", \"n\": \"Immunoprecipitation experiment\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3656\", \"es\": [\"Chromatin immunoprecipitation\"], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"ChIP-seq\", \"u\": \"topic_3169\"}, {\"n\": \"ChIP-on-chip\", \"u\": \"topic_3179\"}, {\"n\": \"Methylated DNA immunoprecipitation\", \"u\": \"topic_3674\"}, {\"n\": \"RNA immunoprecipitation\", \"u\": \"topic_3794\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Immunoprecipitation experiment\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3656\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3179\": {\"d\": \"Experimental techniques that combine chromatin immunoprecipitation (\'ChIP\') with microarray (\'chip\'). ChIP-on-chip is used for high-throughput study protein-DNA interactions.\", \"n\": \"ChIP-on-chip\", \"ns\": [\"ChiP\"], \"u\": \"topic_3179\", \"es\": [\"ChIP-chip\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Immunoprecipitation experiment||ChIP-on-chip\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3656||topic_3179\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3674\": {\"d\": \"Laboratory technique to sequence the methylated regions in DNA.\", \"n\": \"Methylated DNA immunoprecipitation\", \"ns\": [\"BS-Seq\", \"Bisulfite sequencing\", \"MeDIP\", \"Methylated DNA immunoprecipitation (MeDIP)\", \"Methylation sequencing\", \"WGBS\", \"Whole-genome bisulfite sequencing\", \"methy-seq\", \"methyl-seq\"], \"u\": \"topic_3674\", \"es\": [\"MeDIP-chip\", \"MeDIP-seq\", \"mDIP\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Immunoprecipitation experiment||Methylated DNA immunoprecipitation\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3656||topic_3674\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3794\": {\"d\": \"An antibody-based technique used to map in vivo RNA-protein interactions.\", \"n\": \"RNA immunoprecipitation\", \"ns\": [\"CLIP\", \"CLIP-seq\", \"HITS-CLIP\", \"PAR-CLIP\", \"iCLIP\"], \"u\": \"topic_3794\", \"es\": [\"RIP\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Immunoprecipitation experiment||RNA immunoprecipitation\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3656||topic_3794\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3934\": {\"d\": \"Cytometry is the measurement of the characteristics of cells.\", \"n\": \"Cytometry\", \"ns\": [\"Flow cytometry\", \"Image cytometry\", \"Mass cytometry\"], \"u\": \"topic_3934\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Cytometry\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3934\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3940\": {\"d\": \"Molecular biology methods used to analyze the spatial organization of chromatin in a cell.\", \"n\": \"Chromosome conformation capture\", \"ns\": [\"Chromatin accessibility\", \"Chromatin accessibility assay\"], \"u\": \"topic_3940\", \"es\": [\"3C technologies\", \"3C-based methods\", \"Chromosome conformation analysis\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Chromosome conformation capture\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3940\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3957\": {\"d\": \"An experiment for studying protein-protein interactions.\", \"n\": \"Protein interaction experiment\", \"ns\": [\"Co-immunoprecipitation\", \"Phage display\", \"Yeast one-hybrid\", \"Yeast two-hybrid\"], \"u\": \"topic_3957\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Protein interaction experiment\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3957\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3391\": {\"d\": \"The collective characterisation and quantification of pools of biological molecules that translate into the structure, function, and dynamics of an organism or organisms.\", \"n\": \"Omics\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3391\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Proteomics\", \"u\": \"topic_0121\"}, {\"n\": \"Genomics\", \"u\": \"topic_0622\"}, {\"n\": \"Metabolomics\", \"u\": \"topic_3172\"}, {\"n\": \"Phenomics\", \"u\": \"topic_3298\"}, {\"n\": \"Molecular evolution\", \"u\": \"topic_3945\"}, {\"n\": \"Fluxomics\", \"u\": \"topic_3955\"}, {\"n\": \"Immunomics\", \"u\": \"topic_3967\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Omics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0121\": {\"d\": \"Protein and peptide identification, especially in the study of whole proteomes of organisms.\", \"n\": \"Proteomics\", \"ns\": [\"Bottom-up proteomics\", \"Discovery proteomics\", \"MS-based targeted proteomics\", \"MS-based untargeted proteomics\", \"Metaproteomics\", \"Peptide identification\", \"Protein and peptide identification\", \"Quantitative proteomics\", \"Targeted proteomics\", \"Top-down proteomics\"], \"u\": \"topic_0121\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Omics||Proteomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0121\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0622\": {\"d\": \"Whole genomes of one or more organisms, or genomes in general, such as meta-information on genomes, genome projects, gene names etc.\", \"n\": \"Genomics\", \"ns\": [\"Exomes\", \"Genome annotation\", \"Genomes\", \"Personal genomics\", \"Synthetic genomics\", \"Viral genomics\", \"Whole genomes\"], \"u\": \"topic_0622\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Functional genomics\", \"u\": \"topic_0085\"}, {\"n\": \"Structural genomics\", \"u\": \"topic_0122\"}, {\"n\": \"Phylogenomics\", \"u\": \"topic_0194\"}, {\"n\": \"Pharmacogenomics\", \"u\": \"topic_0208\"}, {\"n\": \"Comparative genomics\", \"u\": \"topic_0797\"}, {\"n\": \"Epigenomics\", \"u\": \"topic_3173\"}, {\"n\": \"Metagenomics\", \"u\": \"topic_3174\"}, {\"n\": \"Transcriptomics\", \"u\": \"topic_3308\"}, {\"n\": \"Population genomics\", \"u\": \"topic_3796\"}, {\"n\": \"Proteogenomics\", \"u\": \"topic_3922\"}, {\"n\": \"Paleogenomics\", \"u\": \"topic_3943\"}, {\"n\": \"Epistasis\", \"u\": \"topic_3974\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0797\": {\"d\": \"The study (typically comparison) of the sequence, structure or function of multiple genomes.\", \"n\": \"Comparative genomics\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0797\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Comparative genomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_0797\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3796\": {\"d\": \"Large-scale study (typically comparison) of DNA sequences of populations.\", \"n\": \"Population genomics\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3796\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Population genomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3796\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3922\": {\"d\": \"A field of biological research focused on the discovery and identification of peptides, typically by comparing mass spectra against a protein database.\", \"n\": \"Proteogenomics\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3922\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Proteogenomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3922\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3943\": {\"d\": \"The reconstruction and analysis of genomic information in extinct species.\", \"n\": \"Paleogenomics\", \"ns\": [\"Ancestral genomes\", \"Paleogenetics\"], \"u\": \"topic_3943\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Paleogenomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3943\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3172\": {\"d\": \"The systematic study of metabolites, the chemical processes they are involved, and the chemical fingerprints of specific cellular processes in a whole cell, tissue, organ or organism.\", \"n\": \"Metabolomics\", \"ns\": [\"Exometabolomics\", \"LC-MS-based metabolomics\", \"MS-based metabolomics\", \"MS-based targeted metabolomics\", \"MS-based untargeted metabolomics\", \"Mass spectrometry-based metabolomics\", \"Metabolites\", \"Metabolome\", \"Metabonomics\", \"NMR-based metabolomics\"], \"u\": \"topic_3172\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Omics||Metabolomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_3172\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3955\": {\"d\": \"Experimental approaches to determine the rates of metabolic reactions - the metabolic fluxes - within a biological entity.\", \"n\": \"Fluxomics\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3955\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Omics||Fluxomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_3955\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3967\": {\"d\": \"The study of immune system as a whole, its regulation and response to pathogens using genome-wide approaches.\", \"n\": \"Immunomics\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3967\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Omics||Immunomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_3967\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3678\": {\"d\": \"The design of an experiment intended to test a hypothesis, and describe or explain empirical data obtained under various experimental conditions.\", \"n\": \"Experimental design and studies\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3678\", \"es\": [\"Design of experiments\", \"Experimental design\", \"Studies\"], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Preclinical and clinical studies\", \"u\": \"topic_3379\"}, {\"n\": \"GWAS study\", \"u\": \"topic_3517\"}, {\"n\": \"Animal study\", \"u\": \"topic_3679\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Experimental design and studies\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3678\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3517\": {\"d\": \"Genome-wide association study experiments.\", \"n\": \"GWAS study\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3517\", \"es\": [\"GWAS\", \"GWAS analysis\", \"Genome-wide association study\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Experimental design and studies||GWAS study\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3678||topic_3517\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}}','2025-08-27 12:52:45.452716');
INSERT INTO `elixir_ontology` VALUES (12,'min_index_EDAM_Topic_1.25','{\"topic_0003\": {\"d\": \"A category denoting a rather broad domain or field of interest, of study, application, work, data, or technology. Topics have no clearly defined borders between each other.\", \"n\": \"Topic\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0003\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Informatics\", \"u\": \"topic_0605\"}, {\"n\": \"Literature and language\", \"u\": \"topic_3068\"}, {\"n\": \"Biology\", \"u\": \"topic_3070\"}, {\"n\": \"Medicine\", \"u\": \"topic_3303\"}, {\"n\": \"Computational biology\", \"u\": \"topic_3307\"}, {\"n\": \"Chemistry\", \"u\": \"topic_3314\"}, {\"n\": \"Mathematics\", \"u\": \"topic_3315\"}, {\"n\": \"Computer science\", \"u\": \"topic_3316\"}, {\"n\": \"Physics\", \"u\": \"topic_3318\"}, {\"n\": \"Biomedical science\", \"u\": \"topic_3344\"}, {\"n\": \"Laboratory techniques\", \"u\": \"topic_3361\"}, {\"n\": \"Omics\", \"u\": \"topic_3391\"}, {\"n\": \"Experimental design and studies\", \"u\": \"topic_3678\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic\", \"k\": \"topic_0003\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0605\": {\"d\": \"The study and practice of information processing and use of computer information systems.\", \"n\": \"Informatics\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0605\", \"es\": [\"Information management\", \"Information science\", \"Knowledge management\"], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Ontology and terminology\", \"u\": \"topic_0089\"}, {\"n\": \"Bioinformatics\", \"u\": \"topic_0091\"}, {\"n\": \"Laboratory information management\", \"u\": \"topic_0607\"}, {\"n\": \"Cheminformatics\", \"u\": \"topic_2258\"}, {\"n\": \"Medical informatics\", \"u\": \"topic_3063\"}, {\"n\": \"Biological databases\", \"u\": \"topic_3071\"}, {\"n\": \"Immunoinformatics\", \"u\": \"topic_3948\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0089\": {\"d\": \"The conceptualisation, categorisation and nomenclature (naming) of entities or phenomena within biology or bioinformatics. This includes formal ontologies, controlled vocabularies, structured glossary, symbols and terminology or other related resource.\", \"n\": \"Ontology and terminology\", \"ns\": [\"Applied ontology\", \"Ontologies\", \"Ontology\", \"Ontology relations\", \"Terminology\", \"Upper ontology\"], \"u\": \"topic_0089\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics||Ontology and terminology\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_0089\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0091\": {\"d\": \"The archival, curation, processing and analysis of complex biological data.\", \"n\": \"Bioinformatics\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0091\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics||Bioinformatics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_0091\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0607\": {\"d\": \"Laboratory management and resources, for example, catalogues of biological resources for use in the lab including cell lines, viruses, plasmids, phages, DNA probes and primers and so on.\", \"n\": \"Laboratory information management\", \"ns\": [\"Laboratory resources\"], \"u\": \"topic_0607\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics||Laboratory information management\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_0607\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2258\": {\"d\": \"The application of information technology to chemistry in biological research environment.\", \"n\": \"Cheminformatics\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2258\", \"es\": [\"Chemical informatics\", \"Chemoinformatics\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics||Cheminformatics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_2258\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3063\": {\"d\": \"The application of information technology to health, disease and biomedicine.\", \"n\": \"Medical informatics\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3063\", \"es\": [\"Biomedical informatics\", \"Clinical informatics\", \"Health and disease\", \"Health informatics\", \"Healthcare informatics\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics||Medical informatics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3063\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3071\": {\"d\": \"The development and use of architectures, policies, practices and procedures for management of data.\", \"n\": \"Biological databases\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3071\", \"es\": [\"Data management\", \"Databases and information systems\", \"Information systems\"], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Data submission, annotation and curation\", \"u\": \"topic_0219\"}, {\"n\": \"Workflows\", \"u\": \"topic_0769\"}, {\"n\": \"Data acquisition\", \"u\": \"topic_3077\"}, {\"n\": \"Data security\", \"u\": \"topic_3263\"}, {\"n\": \"Data identity and mapping\", \"u\": \"topic_3345\"}, {\"n\": \"Data architecture, analysis and design\", \"u\": \"topic_3365\"}, {\"n\": \"Data integration and warehousing\", \"u\": \"topic_3366\"}, {\"n\": \"Database management\", \"u\": \"topic_3489\"}, {\"n\": \"Data governance\", \"u\": \"topic_3571\"}, {\"n\": \"Data quality management\", \"u\": \"topic_3572\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0219\": {\"d\": \"Deposition and curation of database accessions, including annotation, typically with terms from a controlled vocabulary.\", \"n\": \"Data submission, annotation and curation\", \"ns\": [\"Data curation\", \"Data provenance\", \"Database curation\"], \"u\": \"topic_0219\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data submission, annotation and curation\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_0219\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0769\": {\"d\": \"Biological or biomedical analytical workflows or pipelines.\", \"n\": \"Workflows\", \"ns\": [\"Software integration\", \"Tool integration\", \"Tool interoperability\"], \"u\": \"topic_0769\", \"es\": [\"Pipelines\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Workflows\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_0769\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3077\": {\"d\": \"The acquisition of data, typically measurements of physical systems using any type of sampling system, or by another other means.\", \"n\": \"Data acquisition\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3077\", \"es\": [\"Data collection\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data acquisition\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3077\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3263\": {\"d\": \"The protection of data, such as patient health data, from damage or unwanted access from unauthorised users.\", \"n\": \"Data security\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3263\", \"es\": [\"Data privacy\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data security\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3263\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3345\": {\"d\": \"Topic concerning the identity of biological entities, or reports on such entities, and the mapping of entities and records in different databases.\", \"n\": \"Data identity and mapping\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3345\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data identity and mapping\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3345\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3365\": {\"d\": \"The development of policies, models and standards that cover data acquisition, storage and integration, such that it can be put to use, typically through a process of systematically applying statistical and / or logical techniques to describe, illustrate, summarise or evaluate data.\", \"n\": \"Data architecture, analysis and design\", \"ns\": [\"Data analysis\", \"Data architecture\", \"Data design\"], \"u\": \"topic_3365\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data architecture, analysis and design\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3365\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3366\": {\"d\": \"The combination and integration of data from different sources, for example into a central repository or warehouse, to provide users with a unified view of these data.\", \"n\": \"Data integration and warehousing\", \"ns\": [\"Data integration\", \"Data warehousing\"], \"u\": \"topic_3366\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data integration and warehousing\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3366\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3489\": {\"d\": \"The general handling of data stored in digital archives such as databanks, databases proper, web portals and other data resources.\", \"n\": \"Database management\", \"ns\": [\"Content management\", \"Data maintenance\", \"Document management\", \"Document, record and content management\", \"File management\", \"Record management\"], \"u\": \"topic_3489\", \"es\": [\"Database administration\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Database management\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3489\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3571\": {\"d\": \"The control of data entry and maintenance to ensure the data meets defined standards, qualities or constraints.\", \"n\": \"Data governance\", \"ns\": [\"Data stewardship\"], \"u\": \"topic_3571\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data governance\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3571\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3572\": {\"d\": \"The quality, integrity, and cleaning up of data.\", \"n\": \"Data quality management\", \"ns\": [\"Data clean-up\", \"Data cleaning\", \"Data integrity\", \"Data quality\"], \"u\": \"topic_3572\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics||Biological databases||Data quality management\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3071||topic_3572\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3948\": {\"d\": \"Immunoinformatics is the field of computational biology that deals with the study of immunoloogical questions. Immunoinformatics is at the interface between immunology and computer science. It takes advantage of computational, statistical, mathematical approaches and enhances the understanding of immunological knowledge.\", \"n\": \"Immunoinformatics\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3948\", \"es\": [\"Computational immunology\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Informatics||Immunoinformatics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_0605||topic_3948\"}, {\"n\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Immunology||Immunoinformatics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_0804||topic_3948\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3068\": {\"d\": \"The scientific literature, language processing, reference information, and documentation.\", \"n\": \"Literature and language\", \"ns\": [\"Bibliography\", \"Citations\", \"Documentation\", \"References\", \"Scientific literature\"], \"u\": \"topic_3068\", \"es\": [\"Language\", \"Literature\"], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Natural language processing\", \"u\": \"topic_0218\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Literature and language\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3068\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0218\": {\"d\": \"The processing and analysis of natural language, such as scientific literature in English, in order to extract data and information, or to enable human-computer interaction.\", \"n\": \"Natural language processing\", \"ns\": [\"BioNLP\", \"Literature mining\", \"Text analytics\", \"Text data mining\", \"Text mining\"], \"u\": \"topic_0218\", \"es\": [\"NLP\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Literature and language||Natural language processing\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3068||topic_0218\"}, {\"n\": \"Topic||Computer science||Natural language processing\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3316||topic_0218\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3070\": {\"d\": \"The study of life and living organisms, including their morphology, biochemistry, physiology, development, evolution, and so on.\", \"n\": \"Biology\", \"ns\": [\"Aerobiology\", \"Behavioural biology\", \"Biological rhythms\", \"Chronobiology\", \"Cryobiology\", \"Reproductive biology\"], \"u\": \"topic_3070\", \"es\": [\"Biological science\"], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Ecology\", \"u\": \"topic_0610\"}, {\"n\": \"Model organisms\", \"u\": \"topic_0621\"}, {\"n\": \"Plant biology\", \"u\": \"topic_0780\"}, {\"n\": \"Virology\", \"u\": \"topic_0781\"}, {\"n\": \"Structural biology\", \"u\": \"topic_1317\"}, {\"n\": \"Cell biology\", \"u\": \"topic_2229\"}, {\"n\": \"Systems biology\", \"u\": \"topic_2259\"}, {\"n\": \"Human biology\", \"u\": \"topic_2815\"}, {\"n\": \"Molecular biology\", \"u\": \"topic_3047\"}, {\"n\": \"Genetics\", \"u\": \"topic_3053\"}, {\"n\": \"Developmental biology\", \"u\": \"topic_3064\"}, {\"n\": \"Biochemistry\", \"u\": \"topic_3292\"}, {\"n\": \"Biotechnology\", \"u\": \"topic_3297\"}, {\"n\": \"Evolutionary biology\", \"u\": \"topic_3299\"}, {\"n\": \"Microbiology\", \"u\": \"topic_3301\"}, {\"n\": \"Biophysics\", \"u\": \"topic_3306\"}, {\"n\": \"Biomarkers\", \"u\": \"topic_3360\"}, {\"n\": \"Chemical biology\", \"u\": \"topic_3369\"}, {\"n\": \"Marine biology\", \"u\": \"topic_3387\"}, {\"n\": \"Zoology\", \"u\": \"topic_3500\"}, {\"n\": \"Freshwater biology\", \"u\": \"topic_3573\"}, {\"n\": \"Agricultural science\", \"u\": \"topic_3810\"}, {\"n\": \"Environmental science\", \"u\": \"topic_3855\"}, {\"n\": \"Synthetic biology\", \"u\": \"topic_3895\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0610\": {\"d\": \"The ecological and environmental sciences and especially the application of information technology (ecoinformatics).\", \"n\": \"Ecology\", \"ns\": [\"Computational ecology\", \"Ecoinformatics\", \"Ecological informatics\", \"Ecosystem science\"], \"u\": \"topic_0610\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Biodiversity\", \"u\": \"topic_3050\"}, {\"n\": \"Metagenomics\", \"u\": \"topic_3174\"}, {\"n\": \"Microbial ecology\", \"u\": \"topic_3697\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Ecology\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_0610\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3050\": {\"d\": \"The degree of variation of life forms within a given ecosystem, biome or an entire planet.\", \"n\": \"Biodiversity\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3050\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Ecology||Biodiversity\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_0610||topic_3050\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3174\": {\"d\": \"The study of genetic material recovered from environmental samples, and associated environmental data.\", \"n\": \"Metagenomics\", \"ns\": [\"Biome sequencing\", \"Shotgun metagenomics\"], \"u\": \"topic_3174\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Ecology||Metagenomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_0610||topic_3174\"}, {\"n\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Metagenomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3174\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3697\": {\"d\": \"The ecology of microorganisms including their relationship with one another and their environment.\", \"n\": \"Microbial ecology\", \"ns\": [\"Community analysis\", \"Microbiome\", \"Molecular community analysis\"], \"u\": \"topic_3697\", \"es\": [\"Environmental microbiology\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Ecology||Microbial ecology\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_0610||topic_3697\"}, {\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Microbiology||Microbial ecology\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3301||topic_3697\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0621\": {\"d\": \"A specific organism, or group of organisms, used to study a particular aspect of biology.\", \"n\": \"Model organisms\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0621\", \"es\": [\"Organisms\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Model organisms\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_0621\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0780\": {\"d\": \"Plants, e.g. information on a specific plant genome including molecular sequences, genes and annotation.\", \"n\": \"Plant biology\", \"ns\": [\"Plant anatomy\", \"Plant cell biology\", \"Plant ecology\", \"Plant genetics\", \"Plant physiology\"], \"u\": \"topic_0780\", \"es\": [\"Botany\", \"Plant\", \"Plant science\", \"Plants\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Plant biology\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_0780\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0781\": {\"d\": \"Study of viruses, e.g. sequence and structural data, interactions of viral proteins, or a viral genome including molecular sequences, genes and annotation.\", \"n\": \"Virology\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0781\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Virology\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_0781\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_1317\": {\"d\": \"The molecular structure of biological molecules, particularly macromolecules such as proteins and nucleic acids.\", \"n\": \"Structural biology\", \"ns\": [\"Structural assignment\", \"Structural determination\", \"Structure determination\"], \"u\": \"topic_1317\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Structural genomics\", \"u\": \"topic_0122\"}, {\"n\": \"NMR\", \"u\": \"topic_0593\"}, {\"n\": \"Electron microscopy\", \"u\": \"topic_0611\"}, {\"n\": \"X-ray diffraction\", \"u\": \"topic_2828\"}, {\"n\": \"Neutron diffraction\", \"u\": \"topic_3448\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Structural biology\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_1317\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0122\": {\"d\": \"The elucidation of the three dimensional structure for all (available) proteins in a given organism.\", \"n\": \"Structural genomics\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0122\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Structural biology||Structural genomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_1317||topic_0122\"}, {\"n\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Structural genomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_0122\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0593\": {\"d\": \"An analytical technique that exploits the magenetic properties of certain atomic nuclei to provide information on the structure, dynamics, reaction state and chemical environment of molecules.\", \"n\": \"NMR\", \"ns\": [\"HOESY\", \"Heteronuclear Overhauser Effect Spectroscopy\", \"NOESY\", \"Nuclear Overhauser Effect Spectroscopy\", \"ROESY\", \"Rotational Frame Nuclear Overhauser Effect Spectroscopy\"], \"u\": \"topic_0593\", \"es\": [\"NMR spectroscopy\", \"Nuclear magnetic resonance spectroscopy\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Structural biology||NMR\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_1317||topic_0593\"}, {\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||NMR\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_0593\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0611\": {\"d\": \"The study of matter by studying the interference pattern from firing electrons at a sample, to analyse structures at resolutions higher than can be achieved using light.\", \"n\": \"Electron microscopy\", \"ns\": [\"Electron crystallography\", \"SEM\", \"Scanning electron microscopy\", \"Single particle electron microscopy\", \"TEM\", \"Transmission electron microscopy\"], \"u\": \"topic_0611\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Structural biology||Electron microscopy\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_1317||topic_0611\"}, {\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Electron microscopy\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_0611\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2828\": {\"d\": \"The study of matter and their structure by means of the diffraction of X-rays, typically the diffraction pattern caused by the regularly spaced atoms of a crystalline sample.\", \"n\": \"X-ray diffraction\", \"ns\": [\"X-ray crystallography\", \"X-ray microscopy\"], \"u\": \"topic_2828\", \"es\": [\"Crystallography\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Structural biology||X-ray diffraction\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_1317||topic_2828\"}, {\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||X-ray diffraction\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_2828\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3448\": {\"d\": \"The study of matter by studying the diffraction pattern from firing neutrons at a sample, typically to determine atomic and/or magnetic structure.\", \"n\": \"Neutron diffraction\", \"ns\": [\"Elastic neutron scattering\", \"Neutron microscopy\"], \"u\": \"topic_3448\", \"es\": [\"Neutron diffraction experiment\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Structural biology||Neutron diffraction\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_1317||topic_3448\"}, {\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Neutron diffraction\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3448\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2229\": {\"d\": \"Cells, such as key genes and proteins involved in the cell cycle.\", \"n\": \"Cell biology\", \"ns\": [\"Cells\", \"Cellular processes\", \"Protein subcellular localization\"], \"u\": \"topic_2229\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Cell biology\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_2229\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2259\": {\"d\": \"The holistic modelling and analysis of complex biological systems and the interactions therein.\", \"n\": \"Systems biology\", \"ns\": [\"Biological modelling\", \"Biological system modelling\", \"Systems modelling\"], \"u\": \"topic_2259\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Systems biology\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_2259\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2815\": {\"d\": \"The study of human beings in general, including the human genome and proteome.\", \"n\": \"Human biology\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2815\", \"es\": [\"Humans\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Human biology\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_2815\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3047\": {\"d\": \"The molecular basis of biological activity, particularly the macromolecules (e.g. proteins and nucleic acids) that are essential to life.\", \"n\": \"Molecular biology\", \"ns\": [\"Biological processes\"], \"u\": \"topic_3047\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Molecular biology\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3047\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3053\": {\"d\": \"The study of genes, genetic variation and heredity in living organisms.\", \"n\": \"Genetics\", \"ns\": [\"Genes\", \"Heredity\"], \"u\": \"topic_3053\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Genotype and phenotype\", \"u\": \"topic_0625\"}, {\"n\": \"Population genetics\", \"u\": \"topic_3056\"}, {\"n\": \"Epigenetics\", \"u\": \"topic_3295\"}, {\"n\": \"Molecular genetics\", \"u\": \"topic_3321\"}, {\"n\": \"Human genetics\", \"u\": \"topic_3574\"}, {\"n\": \"Genetic engineering\", \"u\": \"topic_3912\"}, {\"n\": \"Immunogenetics\", \"u\": \"topic_3930\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Genetics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3053\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0625\": {\"d\": \"The study of genetic constitution of a living entity, such as an individual, and organism, a cell and so on, typically with respect to a particular observable phenotypic traits, or resources concerning such traits, which might be an aspect of biochemistry, physiology, morphology, anatomy, development and so on.\", \"n\": \"Genotype and phenotype\", \"ns\": [\"Genotype\", \"Genotyping\", \"Phenotype\", \"Phenotyping\"], \"u\": \"topic_0625\", \"es\": [\"Genotype and phenotype resources\", \"Genotype-phenotype\", \"Genotype-phenotype analysis\"], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Quantitative genetics\", \"u\": \"topic_3055\"}, {\"n\": \"Phenomics\", \"u\": \"topic_3298\"}, {\"n\": \"Molecular evolution\", \"u\": \"topic_3945\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Genetics||Genotype and phenotype\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3053||topic_0625\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3055\": {\"d\": \"The genes and genetic mechanisms such as Mendelian inheritance that underly continuous phenotypic traits (such as height or weight).\", \"n\": \"Quantitative genetics\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3055\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Genetics||Genotype and phenotype||Quantitative genetics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3053||topic_0625||topic_3055\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3298\": {\"d\": \"Phenomes, or the study of the change in phenotype (the physical and biochemical traits of organisms) in response to genetic and environmental factors.\", \"n\": \"Phenomics\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3298\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Genetics||Genotype and phenotype||Phenomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3053||topic_0625||topic_3298\"}, {\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Evolutionary biology||Phenomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3299||topic_3298\"}, {\"n\": \"Topic||Omics||Phenomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_3298\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3945\": {\"d\": \"The study of the process and mechanism of change of biomolecules such as DNA, RNA, and proteins across generations.\", \"n\": \"Molecular evolution\", \"ns\": [], 