ation.\", \"n\": \"DNA mutation\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2533\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Genetics||Molecular genetics||Genetic variation||DNA mutation\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3053||topic_3321||topic_0199||topic_2533\"}, {\"n\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Nucleic acids||DNA||DNA mutation\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0077||topic_0654||topic_2533\"}, {\"n\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Molecular genetics||Genetic variation||DNA mutation\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_3321||topic_0199||topic_2533\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2885\": {\"d\": \"DNA polymorphism.\", \"n\": \"DNA polymorphism\", \"ns\": [\"Microsatellites\", \"RFLP\", \"SNP\", \"Single nucleotide polymorphism\", \"VNTR\", \"Variable number of tandem repeat polymorphism\", \"snps\"], \"u\": \"topic_2885\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Genetics||Molecular genetics||Genetic variation||DNA polymorphism\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3053||topic_3321||topic_0199||topic_2885\"}, {\"n\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Nucleic acids||DNA||DNA polymorphism\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0077||topic_0654||topic_2885\"}, {\"n\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Molecular genetics||Genetic variation||DNA polymorphism\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_3321||topic_0199||topic_2885\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3175\": {\"d\": \"Variation in chromosome structure including microscopic and submicroscopic types of variation such as deletions, duplications, copy-number variants, insertions, inversions and translocations.\", \"n\": \"Structural variation\", \"ns\": [\"Deletion\", \"Duplication\", \"Insertion\", \"Inversion\", \"Translocation\"], \"u\": \"topic_3175\", \"es\": [\"DNA structural variation\", \"Genomic structural variation\"], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Copy number variation\", \"u\": \"topic_3958\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Genetics||Molecular genetics||Genetic variation||Structural variation\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3053||topic_3321||topic_0199||topic_3175\"}, {\"n\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Nucleic acids||DNA||Structural variation\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0077||topic_0654||topic_3175\"}, {\"n\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Molecular genetics||Genetic variation||Structural variation\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_3321||topic_0199||topic_3175\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3958\": {\"d\": \"A DNA structural variation, specifically a duplication or deletion event, resulting in sections of the genome to be repeated, or the number of repeats in the genome to vary between individuals.\", \"n\": \"Copy number variation\", \"ns\": [\"CNV deletion\", \"CNV duplication\", \"CNV insertion / amplification\", \"Complex CNV\", \"Copy number variant\"], \"u\": \"topic_3958\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biology||Genetics||Molecular genetics||Genetic variation||Structural variation||Copy number variation\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3070||topic_3053||topic_3321||topic_0199||topic_3175||topic_3958\"}, {\"n\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Nucleic acids||DNA||Structural variation||Copy number variation\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_0077||topic_0654||topic_3175||topic_3958\"}, {\"n\": \"Topic||Computational biology||Molecular genetics||Genetic variation||Structural variation||Copy number variation\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3307||topic_3321||topic_0199||topic_3175||topic_3958\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0203\": {\"d\": \"The analysis of levels and patterns of synthesis of gene products (proteins and functional RNA) including interpretation in functional terms of gene expression data.\", \"n\": \"Gene expression\", \"ns\": [\"Codon usage\", \"DNA chips\", \"DNA microarrays\", \"Gene expression profiling\", \"Gene transcription\", \"Gene translation\", \"Transcription