||Medicines research and development||Safety sciences||Pharmacovigilance\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3376||topic_3377||topic_3378\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3379\": {\"d\": \"The testing of new medicines, vaccines or procedures on animals (preclinical) and humans (clinical) prior to their approval by regulatory authorities.\", \"n\": \"Preclinical and clinical studies\", \"ns\": [\"Clinical studies\", \"Clinical study\", \"Clinical trial\", \"Drug trials\", \"Preclinical studies\", \"Preclinical study\"], \"u\": \"topic_3379\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Medicines research and development||Preclinical and clinical studies\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3376||topic_3379\"}, {\"n\": \"Topic||Experimental design and studies||Preclinical and clinical studies\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3678||topic_3379\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3393\": {\"d\": \"The processes that need to be in place to ensure the quality of products for human or animal use.\", \"n\": \"Quality affairs\", \"ns\": [\"Good clinical practice\", \"Good laboratory practice\", \"Good manufacturing practice\"], \"u\": \"topic_3393\", \"es\": [\"Quality assurance\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Medicines research and development||Quality affairs\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3376||topic_3393\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3394\": {\"d\": \"The protection of public health by controlling the safety and efficacy of products in areas including pharmaceuticals, veterinary medicine, medical devices, pesticides, agrochemicals, cosmetics, and complementary medicines.\", \"n\": \"Regulatory affairs\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3394\", \"es\": [\"Healthcare RA\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Medicines research and development||Regulatory affairs\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3376||topic_3394\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3966\": {\"d\": \"The design of vaccines to protect against a particular pathogen, including antigens, delivery systems, and adjuvants to elicit a predictable immune response against specific epitopes.\", \"n\": \"Vaccinology\", \"ns\": [\"Rational vaccine design\", \"Reverse vaccinology\", \"Structural vaccinology\", \"Structure-based immunogen design\", \"Vaccine design\"], \"u\": \"topic_3966\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Medicines research and development||Vaccinology\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3376||topic_3966\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3386\": {\"d\": \"The use of animals and alternatives in experimental research.\", \"n\": \"Laboratory animal science\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3386\", \"es\": [\"Animal experimentation\", \"Animal research\", \"Animal testing\", \"In vivo testing\"], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Animal study\", \"u\": \"topic_3679\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Laboratory animal science\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3386\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3679\": {\"d\": \"The design of an experiment involving non-human animals.\", \"n\": \"Animal study\", \"ns\": [\"Challenge study\"], \"u\": \"topic_3679\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Biomedical science||Laboratory animal science||Animal study\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3344||topic_3386||topic_3679\"}, {\"n\": \"Topic||Experimental design and studies||Animal study\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3678||topic_3679\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3390\": {\"d\": \"The study of the effects of food components on the metabolism, health, performance and disease resistance of humans and animals.  It also includes the study of human behaviours related to food choices.\", \"n\": \"Nutritional science\", \"ns\": [\"Dietetics\"], \"u\": \"topic_3390\", \"es\": [\"Nutrition\", \"Nutrition science\"], \"ch\": [], \