tory techniques||Sequencing||RNA-Seq\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3168||topic_3170\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3673\": {\"d\": \"Laboratory technique to sequence the complete DNA sequence of an organism\'s genome at a single time.\", \"n\": \"Whole genome sequencing\", \"ns\": [\"De novo genome sequencing\", \"Whole genome resequencing\"], \"u\": \"topic_3673\", \"es\": [\"Genome sequencing\", \"WGS\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Sequencing||Whole genome sequencing\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3168||topic_3673\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3676\": {\"d\": \"Laboratory technique to sequence all the protein-coding regions in a genome, i.e., the exome.\", \"n\": \"Exome sequencing\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3676\", \"es\": [\"Exome\", \"Exome analysis\", \"Exome capture\", \"Targeted exome capture\", \"WES\", \"Whole exome sequencing\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Sequencing||Exome sequencing\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3168||topic_3676\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3837\": {\"d\": \"Approach which samples, in parallel, all genes in all organisms present in a given sample, e.g. to provide insight into biodiversity and function.\", \"n\": \"Metagenomic sequencing\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3837\", \"es\": [\"Shotgun metagenomic sequencing\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Sequencing||Metagenomic sequencing\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3168||topic_3837\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3382\": {\"d\": \"The visual representation of an object.\", \"n\": \"Imaging\", \"ns\": [\"Diffraction experiment\", \"Microscopy\", \"Microscopy imaging\", \"Optical super resolution microscopy\", \"Photonic force microscopy\", \"Photonic microscopy\"], \"u\": \"topic_3382\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"NMR\", \"u\": \"topic_0593\"}, {\"n\": \"Electron microscopy\", \"u\": \"topic_0611\"}, {\"n\": \"X-ray diffraction\", \"u\": \"topic_2828\"}, {\"n\": \"Bioimaging\", \"u\": \"topic_3383\"}, {\"n\": \"Medical imaging\", \"u\": \"topic_3384\"}, {\"n\": \"Light microscopy\", \"u\": \"topic_3385\"}, {\"n\": \"MRI\", \"u\": \"topic_3444\"}, {\"n\": \"Neutron diffraction\", \"u\": \"topic_3448\"}, {\"n\": \"Tomography\", \"u\": \"topic_3452\"}, {\"n\": \"Echography\", \"u\": \"topic_3954\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3383\": {\"d\": \"The use of imaging techniques to understand biology.\", \"n\": \"Bioimaging\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3383\", \"es\": [\"Biological imaging\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Bioimaging\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3383\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3384\": {\"d\": \"The use of imaging techniques for clinical purposes for medical research.\", \"n\": \"Medical imaging\", \"ns\": [\"Neuroimaging\", \"Nuclear medicine\", \"Radiology\"], \"u\": \"topic_3384\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Medical imaging\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3384\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3385\": {\"d\": \"The use of optical instruments to magnify the image of an object.\", \"n\": \"Light microscopy\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3385\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Light microscopy\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3385\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3444\": {\"d\": \"Techniques that uses magnetic fields and radiowaves to form images, typically to investigate the anatomy and physiology of the human body.\", \"n\": \"MRI\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3444\", \"es\": [\"MRT\", \"Magnetic resonance imaging\", \"Magnetic resonance tomography\", \"NMRI\", \"Nuclear magnetic resonance imaging\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||MRI\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3444\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3452\": {\"d\": \"Imaging in sections (sectioning), through the use of a wave-generating device (tomograph) that generates an image (a tomogram).\", \"n\": \"Tomography\", \"ns\": [\"Electron tomography\", \"PET\", \"Positron emission tomography\", \"X-ray tomography\"], \"u\": \"topic_3452\", \"es\": [\"CT\", \"Computed tomography\", \"TDM\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Tomography\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3452\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3954\": {\"d\": \"A diagnostic imaging technique based on the application of ultrasound.\", \"n\": \"Echography\", \"ns\": [\"Diagnostic sonography\", \"Medical ultrasound\", \"Standard echography\", \"Ultrasonography\"], \"u\": \"topic_3954\", \"es\": [\"Standardized echography\", \"Ultrasound imaging\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Imaging||Echography\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3382||topic_3954\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3516\": {\"d\": \"Genotype experiment including case control, population, and family studies. These might use array based methods and re-sequencing methods.\", \"n\": \"Genotyping experiment\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3516\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Genotyping experiment\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3516\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3518\": {\"d\": \"Microarray experiments including conditions, protocol, sample:data relationships etc.\", \"n\": \"Microarray experiment\", \"ns\": [\"Gene expression microarray\", \"Genotyping array\", \"Methylation array\", \"MicroRNA array\", \"Multichannel microarray\", \"One channel microarray\", \"Proprietary platform micoarray\", \"RNA chips\", \"RNA microarrays\", \"Reverse phase protein array\", \"SNP array\", \"Tiling arrays\", \"Tissue microarray\", \"Two channel microarray\", \"aCGH microarray\", \"mRNA microarray\", \"miRNA array\"], \"u\": \"topic_3518\", \"es\": [\"Microarrays\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Microarray experiment\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3518\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3519\": {\"d\": \"PCR experiments, e.g. quantitative real-time PCR.\", \"n\": \"PCR experiment\", \"ns\": [\"Quantitative PCR\", \"RT-qPCR\", \"Real Time Quantitative PCR\"], \"u\": \"topic_3519\", \"es\": [\"Polymerase chain reaction\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||PCR experiment\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3519\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3520\": {\"d\": \"Proteomics experiments.\", \"n\": \"Proteomics experiment\", \"ns\": [\"2D PAGE experiment\", \"DIA\", \"Data-independent acquisition\", \"MS\", \"MS experiments\", \"Mass spectrometry\", \"Mass spectrometry experiments\", \"Northern blot experiment\", \"Spectrum demultiplexing\"], \"u\": \"topic_3520\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Proteomics experiment\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3520\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3523\": {\"d\": \"RNAi experiments.\", \"n\": \"RNAi experiment\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3523\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||RNAi experiment\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3523\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3524\": {\"d\": \"Biological computational model experiments (simulation), for example the minimum information required in order to permit its correct interpretation and reproduction.\", \"n\": \"Simulation experiment\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3524\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Simulation experiment\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3524\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3656\": {\"d\": \"Experimental techniques to purify a protein-DNA crosslinked complex.  Usually sequencing follows e.g. in the techniques ChIP-chip, ChIP-seq and MeDIP-seq.\", \"n\": \"Immunoprecipitation experiment\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3656\", \"es\": [\"Chromatin immunoprecipitation\"], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"ChIP-seq\", \"u\": \"topic_3169\"}, {\"n\": \"ChIP-on-chip\", \"u\": \"topic_3179\"}, {\"n\": \"Methylated DNA immunoprecipitation\", \"u\": \"topic_3674\"}, {\"n\": \"RNA immunoprecipitation\", \"u\": \"topic_3794\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Immunoprecipitation experiment\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3656\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3179\": {\"d\": \"Experimental techniques that combine chromatin immunoprecipitation (\'ChIP\') with microarray (\'chip\'). ChIP-on-chip is used for high-throughput study protein-DNA interactions.\", \"n\": \"ChIP-on-chip\", \"ns\": [\"ChiP\"], \"u\": \"topic_3179\", \"es\": [\"ChIP-chip\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Immunoprecipitation experiment||ChIP-on-chip\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3656||topic_3179\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3674\": {\"d\": \"Laboratory technique to sequence the methylated regions in DNA.\", \"n\": \"Methylated DNA immunoprecipitation\", \"ns\": [\"BS-Seq\", \"Bisulfite sequencing\", \"MeDIP\", \"Methylated DNA immunoprecipitation (MeDIP)\", \"Methylation sequencing\", \"WGBS\", \"Whole-genome bisulfite sequencing\", \"methy-seq\", \"methyl-seq\"], \"u\": \"topic_3674\", \"es\": [\"MeDIP-chip\", \"MeDIP-seq\", \"mDIP\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Immunoprecipitation experiment||Methylated DNA immunoprecipitation\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3656||topic_3674\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3794\": {\"d\": \"An antibody-based technique used to map in vivo RNA-protein interactions.\", \"n\": \"RNA immunoprecipitation\", \"ns\": [\"CLIP\", \"CLIP-seq\", \"HITS-CLIP\", \"PAR-CLIP\", \"iCLIP\"], \"u\": \"topic_3794\", \"es\": [\"RIP\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Immunoprecipitation experiment||RNA immunoprecipitation\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3656||topic_3794\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3934\": {\"d\": \"Cytometry is the measurement of the characteristics of cells.\", \"n\": \"Cytometry\", \"ns\": [\"Flow cytometry\", \"Image cytometry\", \"Mass cytometry\"], \"u\": \"topic_3934\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Cytometry\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3934\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3940\": {\"d\": \"Molecular biology methods used to analyze the spatial organization of chromatin in a cell.\", \"n\": \"Chromosome conformation capture\", \"ns\": [\"Chromatin accessibility\", \"Chromatin accessibility assay\"], \"u\": \"topic_3940\", \"es\": [\"3C technologies\", \"3C-based methods\", \"Chromosome conformation analysis\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Chromosome conformation capture\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3940\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3957\": {\"d\": \"An experiment for studying protein-protein interactions.\", \"n\": \"Protein interaction experiment\", \"ns\": [\"Co-immunoprecipitation\", \"Phage display\", \"Yeast one-hybrid\", \"Yeast two-hybrid\"], \"u\": \"topic_3957\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Laboratory techniques||Protein interaction experiment\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3361||topic_3957\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3391\": {\"d\": \"The collective characterisation and quantification of pools of biological molecules that translate into the structure, function, and dynamics of an organism or organisms.\", \"n\": \"Omics\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3391\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Proteomics\", \"u\": \"topic_0121\"}, {\"n\": \"Genomics\", \"u\": \"topic_0622\"}, {\"n\": \"Metabolomics\", \"u\": \"topic_3172\"}, {\"n\": \"Phenomics\", \"u\": \"topic_3298\"}, {\"n\": \"Molecular evolution\", \"u\": \"topic_3945\"}, {\"n\": \"Fluxomics\", \"u\": \"topic_3955\"}, {\"n\": \"Immunomics\", \"u\": \"topic_3967\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Omics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0121\": {\"d\": \"Protein and peptide identification, especially in the study of whole proteomes of organisms.\", \"n\": \"Proteomics\", \"ns\": [\"Bottom-up proteomics\", \"Discovery proteomics\", \"MS-based targeted proteomics\", \"MS-based untargeted proteomics\", \"Metaproteomics\", \"Peptide identification\", \"Protein and peptide identification\", \"Quantitative proteomics\", \"Targeted proteomics\", \"Top-down proteomics\"], \"u\": \"topic_0121\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Omics||Proteomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0121\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0622\": {\"d\": \"Whole genomes of one or more organisms, or genomes in general, such as meta-information on genomes, genome projects, gene names etc.\", \"n\": \"Genomics\", \"ns\": [\"Exomes\", \"Genome annotation\", \"Genomes\", \"Personal genomics\", \"Synthetic genomics\", \"Viral genomics\", \"Whole genomes\"], \"u\": \"topic_0622\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Functional genomics\", \"u\": \"topic_0085\"}, {\"n\": \"Structural genomics\", \"u\": \"topic_0122\"}, {\"n\": \"Phylogenomics\", \"u\": \"topic_0194\"}, {\"n\": \"Pharmacogenomics\", \"u\": \"topic_0208\"}, {\"n\": \"Comparative genomics\", \"u\": \"topic_0797\"}, {\"n\": \"Epigenomics\", \"u\": \"topic_3173\"}, {\"n\": \"Metagenomics\", \"u\": \"topic_3174\"}, {\"n\": \"Transcriptomics\", \"u\": \"topic_3308\"}, {\"n\": \"Population genomics\", \"u\": \"topic_3796\"}, {\"n\": \"Proteogenomics\", \"u\": \"topic_3922\"}, {\"n\": \"Paleogenomics\", \"u\": \"topic_3943\"}, {\"n\": \"Epistasis\", \"u\": \"topic_3974\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0797\": {\"d\": \"The study (typically comparison) of the sequence, structure or function of multiple genomes.\", \"n\": \"Comparative genomics\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0797\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Comparative genomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_0797\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3796\": {\"d\": \"Large-scale study (typically comparison) of DNA sequences of populations.\", \"n\": \"Population genomics\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3796\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Population genomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3796\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3922\": {\"d\": \"A field of biological research focused on the discovery and identification of peptides, typically by comparing mass spectra against a protein database.\", \"n\": \"Proteogenomics\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3922\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Proteogenomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3922\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3943\": {\"d\": \"The reconstruction and analysis of genomic information in extinct species.\", \"n\": \"Paleogenomics\", \"ns\": [\"Ancestral genomes\", \"Paleogenetics\"], \"u\": \"topic_3943\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Omics||Genomics||Paleogenomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_0622||topic_3943\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3172\": {\"d\": \"The systematic study of metabolites, the chemical processes they are involved, and the chemical fingerprints of specific cellular processes in a whole cell, tissue, organ or organism.\", \"n\": \"Metabolomics\", \"ns\": [\"Exometabolomics\", \"LC-MS-based metabolomics\", \"MS-based metabolomics\", \"MS-based targeted metabolomics\", \"MS-based untargeted metabolomics\", \"Mass spectrometry-based metabolomics\", \"Metabolites\", \"Metabolome\", \"Metabonomics\", \"NMR-based metabolomics\"], \"u\": \"topic_3172\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Omics||Metabolomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_3172\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3955\": {\"d\": \"Experimental approaches to determine the rates of metabolic reactions - the metabolic fluxes - within a biological entity.\", \"n\": \"Fluxomics\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3955\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Omics||Fluxomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_3955\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3967\": {\"d\": \"The study of immune system as a whole, its regulation and response to pathogens using genome-wide approaches.\", \"n\": \"Immunomics\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3967\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Omics||Immunomics\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3391||topic_3967\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3678\": {\"d\": \"The design of an experiment intended to test a hypothesis, and describe or explain empirical data obtained under various experimental conditions.\", \"n\": \"Experimental design and studies\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3678\", \"es\": [\"Design of experiments\", \"Experimental design\", \"Studies\"], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Preclinical and clinical studies\", \"u\": \"topic_3379\"}, {\"n\": \"GWAS study\", \"u\": \"topic_3517\"}, {\"n\": \"Animal study\", \"u\": \"topic_3679\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Experimental design and studies\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3678\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3517\": {\"d\": \"Genome-wide association study experiments.\", \"n\": \"GWAS study\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3517\", \"es\": [\"GWAS\", \"GWAS analysis\", \"Genome-wide association study\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Topic||Experimental design and studies||GWAS study\", \"k\": \"topic_0003||topic_3678||topic_3517\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}}','2025-08-27 12:52:45.457400'),(13,'EDAM_Operation','{\"text\": \"Operation\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_0004\"}, \"definition\": \"A function that processes a set of inputs and results in a set of outputs, or associates arguments (inputs) with values (outputs). Special cases are: a) An operation that consumes no input (has no input arguments). Such operation is either a constant function, or an operation depending only on the underlying state. b) An operation that may modify the underlying state but has no output. c) The singular-case operation with no input or output, that still may modify the underlying state.\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Computational procedure\", \"Computational subroutine\", \"Computational tool\", \"Computational operation\", \"Function (programming)\", \"Lambda abstraction\", \"sumo:Function\", \"Mathematical function\", \"Process\", \"Mathematical operation\", \"Function\", \"Computational method\"], \"children\": [{\"text\": \"Annotation\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_0226\"}, \"children\": [{\"text\": \"Sequence annotation\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_0361\"}, \"children\": [{\"text\": \"Genome annotation\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_0362\"}, \"children\": [], \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Functional genome annotation\", \"Metagenome annotation\", \"Structural genome annotation\"], \"replaced_by\": [], \"consider\": [], \"definition\": \"Annotate a genome sequence with terms from a controlled vocabulary.\", \"has_input\": [], \"has_output\": [], \"has_topic\": []}, {\"text\": \"SNP annotation\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3661\"}, \"children\": [], \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"replaced_by\": [], \"consider\": [], \"definition\": \"Predict the effect or function of an individual single nucleotide polymorphism (SNP).\", \"has_input\": [], \"has_output\": [], \"has_topic\": []}, {\"text\": \"Gene functional annotation\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3672\"}, \"children\": [], \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Sequence functional annotation\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"replaced_by\": [], \"consider\": [], \"definition\": \"Annotate one or more sequences with functional information, such as cellular processes or metaobolic pathways, by reference to a controlled vocabulary - invariably the Gene Ontology (GO).\", \"has_input\": [], \"has_output\": [], \"has_topic\": []}], \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"replaced_by\": [], \"consider\": [], \"definition\": \"Annotate a molecular sequence record with terms from a controlled vocabulary.\", \"has_input\": [\"http://edamontology.org/data_0849\"], \"has_output\": [\"http://edamontology.org/data_0849\"], \"has_topic\": []}, {\"text\": \"Sequence tag mapping\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_0527\"}, \"children\": [], \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Tag to gene assignment\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"replaced_by\": [], \"consider\": [], \"definition\": \"Make sequence tag to gene assignments (tag mapping) of SAGE, MPSS and SBS data.\", \"has_input\": [], \"has_output\": [], \"has_topic\": []}, {\"text\": \"Phylogenetic tree annotation\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_0558\"}, \"children\": [], \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"replaced_by\": [], \"consider\": [], \"definition\": \"Annotate a phylogenetic tree with terms from a controlled vocabulary.\", \"has_input\": [], \"has_output\": [], \"has_topic\": []}, {\"text\": \"Image annotation\", \"data\": {\"