y estimation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3221\"}, {\"name\": \"Variant calling\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3227\"}, {\"name\": \"DNA profiling\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3894\"}, {\"name\": \"Genome analysis\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3918\"}, {\"name\": \"DNA testing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3920\"}, {\"name\": \"Sequence read processing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3921\"}, {\"name\": \"Selection detection\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3950\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"Analyse genetic linkage.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Operation||Analysis||Sequence analysis||Nucleic acid sequence analysis||Linkage analysis\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2403||operation_2478||operation_0283\"}], \"name\": \"Linkage analysis\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_0283\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Genetic mapping\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_0282\"}, {\"name\": \"Linkage disequilibrium calculation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_0488\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"Generate a genetic (linkage) map of a DNA sequence (typically a chromosome) showing the relative positions of genetic markers based on estimation of non-physical distances.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Operation||Analysis||Sequence analysis||Nucleic acid sequence analysis||Linkage analysis||Genetic mapping\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2403||operation_2478||operation_0283||operation_0282\"}, \"name\": \"Genetic mapping\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_0282\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Functional mapping\", \"Genetic cartography\", \"Genetic map construction\", \"Genetic map generation\", \"Linkage mapping\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"QTL mapping\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Haplotype mapping\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_