ing\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Calculate the differences in codon usage fractions between two sequences, sets of sequences, codon usage tables etc.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Operation||Analysis||Sequence analysis||Nucleic acid sequence analysis||Codon usage analysis||Codon usage fraction calculation\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2403||operation_2478||operation_0286||operation_2964\"}], \"name\": \"Codon usage fraction calculation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_2964\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The development and use of mathematical models and systems analysis for the description of ecological processes, and applications such as the sustainable management of resources.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Operation||Analysis||Sequence analysis||Nucleic acid sequence analysis||Codon usage analysis||Ecological modelling\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2403||operation_2478||operation_0286||operation_3946\"}, \"name\": \"Ecological modelling\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3946\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Perform in-silico (virtual) PCR.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Operation||Analysis||Sequence analysis||Nucleic acid sequence analysis||Virtual PCR\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2403||operation_2478||operation_0307\"}], \"name\": \"Virtual PCR\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_0307\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Combine (align and merge) overlapping fragments of a DNA sequence to reconstruct the original sequence.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Operation||Analysis||Sequence analysis||Nucleic acid sequence analysis||Sequence assembly\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2403||operation_2478||operation_0310\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence assembly\", \"uri\": \"