86\"}, {\"name\": \"Whole genome methylation analysis\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3206\"}, {\"name\": \"Gene methylation analysis\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3207\"}, {\"name\": \"DMR identification\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3809\"}, {\"name\": \"Methylation calling\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3919\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"The mapping of methylation sites in a DNA (genome) sequence.  Typically, the mapping of high-throughput bisulfite reads to the reference genome.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Operation||Analysis||Sequence analysis||Nucleic acid sequence analysis||Methylation analysis||Bisulfite mapping\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2403||operation_2478||operation_3204||operation_3186\"}, \"name\": \"Bisulfite mapping\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3186\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Bisulfite read mapping\", \"Bisulfite sequence alignment\", \"Bisulfite sequence mapping\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Measure the overall level of methyl cytosines in a genome from analysis of experimental data, typically from chromatographic methods and methyl accepting capacity assay.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Operation||Analysis||Sequence analysis||Nucleic acid sequence analysis||Methylation analysis||Whole genome methylation analysis\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2403||operation_2478||operation_3204||operation_3206\"}, {\"name\": \"Operation||Analysis||Sequence analysis||Nucleic acid sequence analysis||Genome analysis||Whole genome methylation analysis\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2403||operation_2478||operation_3918||operation_3206\"}], \"name\": \"Whole genome methylation analysis\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3206\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Genome methylation analysis\", \"Global methylation analysis\", \"Methylation level analysis (global)\"], \"narrow_syno