ucleation or stabilisation key to protein folding.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Operation||Modelling and simulation||Protein folding analysis\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2426||operation_2415\"}, {\"name\": \"Operation||Analysis||Structure analysis||Protein structure analysis||Protein folding analysis\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2480||operation_2406||operation_2415\"}], \"name\": \"Protein folding analysis\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_2415\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Protein folding modelling\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Protein folding simulation\", \"Protein folding site prediction\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The simulation of molecular (typically protein) conformation using a computational model of physical forces and computer simulation.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Operation||Modelling and simulation||Molecular dynamics\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2426||operation_2476\"}, \"name\": \"Molecular dynamics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_2476\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Molecular dynamics simulation\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Protein dynamics\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Predict, analyse, characterize or model splice sites, splicing events and so on, typically by comparing multiple nucleic acid sequences.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Operation||Modelling and simulation||Splicing analysis\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2426||operation_2499\"}, \"name\": \"Splicing analysis\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_2499\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Splicing model analysis\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Alternative splicing prediction\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_0264\"}, {\"name\": \"Splice site prediction\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_0433\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"Predict splicing alternatives or transcript isoforms from analysis of sequence data.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Operation||Modelling