uences.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Operation||Mapping||Adhesin prediction\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2429||operation_3968\"}, \"name\": \"Adhesin prediction\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3968\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Design a biological entity (typically a molecular sequence or structure) with specific properties.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Operation||Design\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2430\"}], \"name\": \"Design\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_2430\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Microarray probe design\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_0309\"}, {\"name\": \"Nucleic acid design\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3095\"}, {\"name\": \"Protein design\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_4008\"}, {\"name\": \"Small molecule design\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_4009\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"Predict and/or optimize oligonucleotide probes for DNA microarrays, for example for transcription profiling of genes, or for genomes and gene families.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Operation||Design||Microarray probe design\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2430||operation_0309\"}, \"name\": \"Microarray probe design\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_0309\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Microarray probe prediction\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Design (or predict) nucleic acid sequences with specific chemical or physical properties.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Operation||Design||Nucleic acid design\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2430||operation_3095\"}, {\"name\": \"Operation||Analysis||Sequence analysis||Nucleic acid sequence analysis||Nucleic acid design\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2403||operation_2478||operation_3095\"}], \"name\": \"Nucleic acid design\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3095\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Gene design\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"RNA inverse folding\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_0483\"}, {\"name\": \"DNA vaccine design\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_0560\"}, {\"name\": \"Primer and probe design\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_2419\"}, {\"name\": \"In vitro selection\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3795\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"Predict or optimise RNA sequences (sequence pools) with likely secondary and tertiary structure for in vitro selection.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Operation||Design||Nucleic acid design||RNA inverse folding\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2430||operation_3095||operation_0483\"}, {\"name\": \"Operation||Analysis||Sequence analysis||Nucleic acid sequence analysis||Nucleic acid design||RNA inverse folding\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2403||operation_2478||operation_3095||operation_0483\"}], \"name\": \"RNA inverse folding\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_0483\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Nucleic acid folding family identification\", \"Structured RNA prediction and optimisation\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Predict or optimise DNA to elicit (via DNA vaccination) an immunological response.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Operation||Design||Nucleic acid design||DNA vaccine design\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2430||operation_3095||operation_0560\"}, {\"name\": \"Operation||Analysis||Sequence analysis||Nucleic acid sequence analysis||Nucleic acid design||DNA vaccine design\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2403||operation_2478||operation_3095||operation_0560\"}], \"name\": \"DNA vaccine design\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_0560\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Predict oligonucleotide primers or probes.\