_3095||operation_2419||operation_0309\"}, \"name\": \"Microarray probe design\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_0309\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Microarray probe prediction\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A technique whereby molecules with desired properties and function are isolated from libraries of random molecules, through iterative cycles of selection, amplification, and mutagenesis.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Operation||Analysis||Sequence analysis||Nucleic acid sequence analysis||Nucleic acid design||In vitro selection\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2403||operation_2478||operation_3095||operation_3795\"}, \"name\": \"In vitro selection\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3795\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Analyse DNA sequences in order to identify a DNA \'barcode\'; marker genes or any short fragment(s) of DNA that are useful to diagnose the taxa of biological organisms.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Operation||Analysis||Sequence analysis||Nucleic acid sequence analysis||DNA barcoding\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2403||operation_2478||operation_3200\"}], \"name\": \"DNA barcoding\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3200\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Community profiling\", \"Sample barcoding\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Analyse cytosine methylation states in nucleic acid sequences.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Operation||Analysis||Sequence analysis||Nucleic acid sequence analysis||Methylation analysis\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2403||operation_2478||operation_3204\"}], \"name\": \"Methylation analysis\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3204\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Methylation profile analysis\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Bisulfite mapping\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operati