abilistic model, e.g. a model that simulates evolution.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Operation||Generation||Probabilistic data generation||Probabilistic sequence generation\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_3429||operation_3480||operation_3481\"}, \"name\": \"Probabilistic sequence generation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3481\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Group together some data entities on the basis of similarities such that entities in the same group (cluster) are more similar to each other than to those in other groups (clusters).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Operation||Clustering\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_3432\"}], \"name\": \"Clustering\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3432\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Sequence clustering\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_0291\"}, {\"name\": \"Expression profile clustering\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_0313\"}, {\"name\": \"Structure clustering\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_2844\"}, {\"name\": \"Document clustering\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3279\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"Build clusters of similar sequences, typically using scores from pair-wise alignment or other comparison of the sequences.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Operation||Clustering||Sequence clustering\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_3432||operation_0291\"}, \"name\": \"Sequence clustering\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_0291\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Sequence cluster construction\", \"Sequence cluster generation\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Functional clustering\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3459\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"Clustering of molecular sequences on the basis of their function, typically using information from an ontology of gene function, or some other measure of f