ession analysis||miRNA expression analysis\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2495||operation_3792\"}], \"name\": \"miRNA expression analysis\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3792\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"miRNA expression profiling\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"operation_3197\": {\"definition\": \"Analyse a genetic variation, for example to annotate its location, alleles, classification, and effects on individual transcripts predicted for a gene model.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Operation||Analysis||Genetic variation analysis\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_3197\"}], \"name\": \"Genetic variation analysis\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3197\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Genetic variation annotation\", \"Sequence variation analysis\", \"Variant analysis\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Transcript variant analysis\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Genotyping\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3196\"}, {\"name\": \"Variant classification\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3225\"}, {\"name\": \"Variant prioritisation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3226\"}, {\"name\": \"Variant calling\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3227\"}, {\"name\": \"Structural variation detection\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3228\"}, {\"name\": \"Variant pattern analysis\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3504\"}, {\"name\": \"Reference identification\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3703\"}, {\"name\": \"Collapsing methods\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3791\"}]}, \"operation_3196\": {\"definition\": \"Analyse DNA sequence data to identify differences between the genetic composition (genotype) of an individual compared to other individual\'s or a reference sequence.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Operation||Analysis||Genetic variation analysis||Genotyping\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_