eration_3658\"}], \"name\": \"Statistical inference\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3658\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Empirical Bayes\"], \"children\": []}, \"operation_3659\": {\"definition\": \"A statistical calculation to estimate the relationships among variables.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Operation||Calculation||Statistical calculation||Regression analysis\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_3438||operation_2238||operation_3659\"}], \"name\": \"Regression analysis\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3659\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Regression\"], \"children\": []}, \"operation_3664\": {\"definition\": \"Construction of a statistical model, or a set of assumptions around some observed data, usually by describing a set of probability distributions which approximate the distribution of data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Operation||Calculation||Statistical calculation||Statistical modelling\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_3438||operation_2238||operation_3664\"}], \"name\": \"Statistical modelling\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3664\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"operation_3960\": {\"definition\": \"A statistical procedure that uses an orthogonal transformation to convert a set of observations of possibly correlated variables into a set of values of linearly uncorrelated variables called principal components.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Operation||Calculation||Statistical calculation||Principal component analysis\", \"key\": \"operation_0004||operation_3438||operation_2238||operation_3960\"}], \"name\": \"Principal component analysis\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3960\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"operation_3632\": {\"definition\": \"Calculate the isotope distribution of a given chemical species.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Operation||Calculation||Isotopic distributio