_2403||operation_2478||operation_3918||operation_0362\"}, \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The process of assembling many short DNA sequences together such thay they represent the original chromosomes from which the DNA originated.\", \"n\": \"Genome assembly\", \"ns\": [\"Breakend assembly\"], \"u\": \"operation_0525\", \"es\": [\"Genomic assembly\", \"Sequence assembly (genome assembly)\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": {\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Sequence analysis||Nucleic acid sequence analysis||Genome analysis||Genome assembly\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2403||operation_2478||operation_3918||operation_0525\"}, \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Align two or more (tpyically huge) molecular sequences that represent genomes.\", \"n\": \"Genome alignment\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3182\", \"es\": [\"Genome alignment construction\", \"Whole genome alignment\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": {\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Sequence analysis||Nucleic acid sequence analysis||Genome analysis||Genome alignment\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2403||operation_2478||operation_3918||operation_3182\"}, \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Compare the features of two genome sequences.\", \"n\": \"Genome feature comparison\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3194\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": {\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Sequence analysis||Nucleic acid sequence analysis||Genome analysis||Genome feature comparison\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2403||operation_2478||operation_3918||operation_3194\"}, \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Measure the overall level of methyl cytosines in a genome from analysis of experimental data, typically from chromatographic methods and methyl accepting capacity assay.\", \"n\": \"Whole genome methylation analysis\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3206\", \"es\": [\"Genome methylation analysis\", \"Global methylati