ies data from an RNA-seq experiment.\", \"n\": \"RNA-seq time series data analysis\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3565\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": {\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Expression analysis||RNA-Seq analysis||RNA-seq time series data analysis\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2495||operation_3680||operation_3565\"}, \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The analysis of microRNAs (miRNAs) : short, highly conserved small noncoding RNA molecules that are naturally occurring plant and animal genomes.\", \"n\": \"miRNA expression analysis\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3792\", \"es\": [\"miRNA expression profiling\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Expression analysis||miRNA expression analysis\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2495||operation_3792\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Analyse a genetic variation, for example to annotate its location, alleles, classification, and effects on individual transcripts predicted for a gene model.\", \"n\": \"Genetic variation analysis\", \"ns\": [\"Transcript variant analysis\"], \"u\": \"operation_3197\", \"es\": [\"Genetic variation annotation\", \"Sequence variation analysis\", \"Variant analysis\"], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Genotyping\", \"u\": \"operation_3196\"}, {\"n\": \"Variant classification\", \"u\": \"operation_3225\"}, {\"n\": \"Variant prioritisation\", \"u\": \"operation_3226\"}, {\"n\": \"Variant calling\", \"u\": \"operation_3227\"}, {\"n\": \"Structural variation detection\", \"u\": \"operation_3228\"}, {\"n\": \"Variant pattern analysis\", \"u\": \"operation_3504\"}, {\"n\": \"Reference identification\", \"u\": \"operation_3703\"}, {\"n\": \"Collapsing methods\", \"u\": \"operation_3791\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Genetic variation analysis\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_3197\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Analyse DNA sequence data to i