null}, {\"d\": \"Estimate the number of copies of loci of particular gene(s) in DNA sequences typically from gene-expression profiling technology based on microarray hybridisation-based experiments. For example, estimate copy number (or marker dosage) of a dominant marker in samples from polyploid plant cells or tissues, or chromosomal gains and losses in tumors.\", \"n\": \"Copy number estimation\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3233\", \"es\": [\"Transcript copy number estimation\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Genetic variation analysis||Structural variation detection||Copy number variation detection||Copy number estimation\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_3197||operation_3228||operation_3961||operation_3233\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Identify deletion events causing the number of repeats in the genome to vary between individuals.\", \"n\": \"Deletion detection\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3962\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Genetic variation analysis||Structural variation detection||Copy number variation detection||Deletion detection\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_3197||operation_3228||operation_3961||operation_3962\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Identify duplication events causing the number of repeats in the genome to vary between individuals.\", \"n\": \"Duplication detection\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3963\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Genetic variation analysis||Structural variation detection||Copy number variation detection||Duplication detection\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_3197||operation_3228||operation_3961||operation_3963\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Identify copy number variations which are complex, e.g. multi-allelic variations that have many structural alleles and have rearranged multiple t