rom a bisulfite sequencing experiment).\", \"n\": \"Methylation calling\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3919\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Sequence analysis||Nucleic acid sequence analysis||Methylation analysis||Methylation calling\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2403||operation_2478||operation_3204||operation_3919\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_3221\": {\"d\": \"Estimate the frequencies of different species from analysis of the molecular sequences, typically of DNA recovered from environmental samples.\", \"n\": \"Species frequency estimation\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3221\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Sequence analysis||Nucleic acid sequence analysis||Species frequency estimation\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2403||operation_2478||operation_3221\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_3227\": {\"d\": \"Detect, identify and map mutations, such as single nucleotide polymorphisms, short indels and structural variants, in multiple DNA sequences. Typically the alignment and comparison of the fluorescent traces produced by DNA sequencing hardware, to study genomic alterations.\", \"n\": \"Variant calling\", \"ns\": [\"Allele calling\", \"Exome variant detection\", \"Genome variant detection\", \"Germ line variant calling\", \"Mutation detection\", \"Somatic variant calling\", \"de novo mutation detection\"], \"u\": \"operation_3227\", \"es\": [\"Variant mapping\"], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Frameshift detection\", \"u\": \"operation_0265\"}, {\"n\": \"Indel detection\", \"u\": \"operation_0452\"}, {\"n\": \"SNP detection\", \"u\": \"operation_0484\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Sequence analysis||Nucleic acid sequence analysis||Variant calling\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2403||operation_2478||operation_3227\"}, {\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Genetic variation analysis||Variant calling\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_3197||operation_3227\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_0452\": {\"d\": \"Identify insertion, deletion and duplication events from a sequence alignment.\", \"n\": \"Indel detection\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_0452\", \"es\": [\"Indel discovery\", \"Sequence alignment analysis (indel detection)\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Sequence analysis||Nucleic acid sequence analysis||Variant calling||Indel detection\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2403||operation_2478||operation_3227||operation_0452\"}, {\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Genetic variation analysis||Variant calling||Indel detection\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_3197||operation_3227||operation_0452\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_0484\": {\"d\": \"Find single nucleotide polymorphisms (SNPs) - single nucleotide change in base positions - between sequences. Typically done for sequences from a high-throughput sequencing experiment that differ from a reference genome and which might, especially by reference to population frequency or functional data, indicate a polymorphism.\", \"n\": \"SNP detection\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_0484\", \"es\": [\"SNP calling\", \"SNP discovery\", \"Single nucleotide polymorphism detection\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Sequence analysis||Nucleic acid sequence analysis||Variant calling||SNP detection\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2403||operation_2478||operation_3227||operation_0484\"}, {\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Genetic variation analysis||Variant calling||SNP detection\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_3197||operation_3227||operation_0484\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_3894\": {\"d\": \"Analyse DNA sequences in order to determine an individual\'s DNA characteristics, for example in criminal forensics, parentag