peration_0314\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_3223\": {\"d\": \"Identify from molecular sequence analysis (typically from analysis of microarray or RNA-seq data) genes whose expression levels are significantly different between two sample groups.\", \"n\": \"Differential gene expression profiling\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3223\", \"es\": [\"Differential expression analysis\", \"Differential gene analysis\", \"Differential gene expression analysis\", \"Differentially expressed gene identification\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Expression analysis||Gene expression profiling||Differential gene expression profiling\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2495||operation_0314||operation_3223\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_0315\": {\"d\": \"Comparison of expression profiles.\", \"n\": \"Expression profile comparison\", \"ns\": [\"Gene expression comparison\", \"Gene expression profile comparison\"], \"u\": \"operation_0315\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Expression profile clustering\", \"u\": \"operation_0313\"}, {\"n\": \"Expression correlation analysis\", \"u\": \"operation_3463\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Expression analysis||Expression profile comparison\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2495||operation_0315\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_0313\": {\"d\": \"Perform cluster analysis of expression data to identify groups with similar expression profiles, for example by clustering.\", \"n\": \"Expression profile clustering\", \"ns\": [\"Gene expression clustering\", \"Gene expression profile clustering\"], \"u\": \"operation_0313\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Expression analysis||Expression profile comparison||Expression profile clustering\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2495||operation_0315||operation_0313\"}, {\"n\": \"Operation||Clustering||Expression profile clustering\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_3432||operation_0313\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_3463\": {\"d\": \"Analyse the correlation patterns among features/molecules across across a variety of experiments, samples etc.\", \"n\": \"Expression correlation analysis\", \"ns\": [\"Gene co-expression network analysis\", \"Gene expression correlation\", \"Gene expression correlation analysis\"], \"u\": \"operation_3463\", \"es\": [\"Co-expression analysis\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Expression analysis||Expression profile comparison||Expression correlation analysis\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2495||operation_0315||operation_3463\"}, {\"n\": \"Operation||Correlation||Expression correlation analysis\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_3465||operation_3463\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_1781\": {\"d\": \"Analyse a known network of gene regulation.\", \"n\": \"Gene regulatory network analysis\", \"ns\": [\"Gene regulatory network comparison\", \"Gene regulatory network modelling\", \"Regulatory network comparison\", \"Regulatory network modelling\"], \"u\": \"operation_1781\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Expression analysis||Gene regulatory network analysis\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_2495||operation_1781\"}, {\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Network analysis||Gene regulatory network analysis\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_3927||operation_1781\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_2436\": {\"d\": \"Identify classes of genes or proteins that are over or under-represented in a large set of genes or proteins.  For example analysis of a set of genes corresponding to a gene expression profile, annotated with Gene Ontology (GO) concepts, where eventual over-/under-representation of certain GO concept within the studied set of genes is revealed.\", \"n\": \"Gene-set enrichment ana