ants absent in control genomes.\", \"n\": \"Variant prioritisation\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3226\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Genetic variation analysis||Variant prioritisation\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_3197||operation_3226\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_3228\": {\"d\": \"Detect large regions in a genome subject to copy-number variation, or other structural variations in genome(s).\", \"n\": \"Structural variation detection\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3228\", \"es\": [\"Structural variation discovery\"], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Copy number variation detection\", \"u\": \"operation_3961\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Genetic variation analysis||Structural variation detection\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_3197||operation_3228\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_3961\": {\"d\": \"Identify where sections of the genome are repeated and the number of repeats in the genome varies between individuals.\", \"n\": \"Copy number variation detection\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3961\", \"es\": [\"CNV detection\"], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Copy number estimation\", \"u\": \"operation_3233\"}, {\"n\": \"Deletion detection\", \"u\": \"operation_3962\"}, {\"n\": \"Duplication detection\", \"u\": \"operation_3963\"}, {\"n\": \"Complex CNV detection\", \"u\": \"operation_3964\"}, {\"n\": \"Amplification detection\", \"u\": \"operation_3965\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Genetic variation analysis||Structural variation detection||Copy number variation detection\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_3197||operation_3228||operation_3961\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_3233\": {\"d\": \"Estimate the number of copies of loci of particular gene(s) in DNA sequences typically from gene-expression profiling technology based on microarray hybridisation-based experiments. For example, estimate co