lly in order to study the processes that play a role in the disease progression.\", \"n\": \"Cell migration analysis\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3446\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Image analysis||Cell migration analysis\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_3443||operation_3446\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_3450\": {\"d\": \"Measurement of neurites; projections (axons or dendrites) from the cell body of a neuron, from analysis of neuron images.\", \"n\": \"Neurite measurement\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3450\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Image analysis||Neurite measurement\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_3443||operation_3450\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_3501\": {\"d\": \"Analysis of a set of objects, such as genes, annotated with given categories, where eventual over-/under-representation of certain categories within the studied set of objects is revealed.\", \"n\": \"Enrichment analysis\", \"ns\": [\"Functional enrichment\"], \"u\": \"operation_3501\", \"es\": [\"Enrichment\", \"Over-representation analysis\"], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Gene-set enrichment analysis\", \"u\": \"operation_2436\"}, {\"n\": \"Chemical similarity enrichment\", \"u\": \"operation_3502\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Enrichment analysis\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_3501\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_3502\": {\"d\": \"Analyse a dataset with respect to concepts from an ontology of chemical structure, leveraging chemical similarity information.\", \"n\": \"Chemical similarity enrichment\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3502\", \"es\": [\"Chemical class enrichment\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Enrichment analysis||Chemical similarity enrichment\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_3501||operation_3502\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_3927\": {\"d\": \"Generate, process or analyse a biological network.\", \"n\": \"Network analysis\", \"ns\": [\"Biological network modelling\", \"Biological network prediction\", \"Network comparison\", \"Network modelling\", \"Network prediction\", \"Network simulation\", \"Network topology simulation\"], \"u\": \"operation_3927\", \"es\": [\"Biological network analysis\"], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Protein interaction network analysis\", \"u\": \"operation_0276\"}, {\"n\": \"Gene regulatory network analysis\", \"u\": \"operation_1781\"}, {\"n\": \"Gene regulatory network prediction\", \"u\": \"operation_2437\"}, {\"n\": \"Protein interaction network prediction\", \"u\": \"operation_3094\"}, {\"n\": \"Metabolic network modelling\", \"u\": \"operation_3660\"}, {\"n\": \"Weighted correlation network analysis\", \"u\": \"operation_3766\"}, {\"n\": \"Network visualisation\", \"u\": \"operation_3925\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Network analysis\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_3927\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_3660\": {\"d\": \"Model a metabolic network.  This can include 1) reconstruction to break down a metabolic pathways into reactions, enzymes, and other relevant information, and compilation of this into a mathematical model and 2) simulations of metabolism based on the model.\", \"n\": \"Metabolic network modelling\", \"ns\": [\"Metabolic network reconstruction\", \"Metabolic network simulation\", \"Metabolic pathway simulation\", \"Metabolic reconstruction\"], \"u\": \"operation_3660\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Network analysis||Metabolic network modelling\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_3927||operation_3660\"}, {\"n\": \"Operation||Analysis||Pathway analysis||Metabolic network modelling\", \"k\": \"operation_0004||operation_2945||operation_3928||operation_3660\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_3766\": {\"d