al relevance.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Data index\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0955\"}], \"name\": \"Data index\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0955\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Genome index\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3210\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"An index of a genome sequence.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Data index||Genome index\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0955||data_3210\"}], \"name\": \"Genome index\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3210\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Keyword(s) or phrase(s) used (typically) for text-searching purposes.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Keyword\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0968\"}], \"name\": \"Keyword\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0968\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Phrases\", \"Term\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"UniProt keyword\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2007\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"A word or phrase that can appear in the keywords field (KW line) of entries from the UniProt database.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Keyword||UniProt keyword\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0968||data_2007\"}], \"name\": \"UniProt keyword\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2007\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Annotation of positional features of molecular sequence(s), i.e. that can be mapped to position(s) in the sequence.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence features\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_1255\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence features\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1255\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Feature record\", \"Features\", \"General sequence features\", \"Sequence features report\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Feature table\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1270\"}, {\"name\": \"Nucleic acid features\", \"uri\": \"ht