es (report)\", \"Stem loop (report)\", \"d-loop (report)\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Data concerning or describing some core computational resource, as distinct from primary data.  This includes metadata on the origin, source, history, ownership or location of some thing.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Resource metadata\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2337\"}], \"name\": \"Resource metadata\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2337\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Provenance metadata\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Workflow metadata\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0949\"}, {\"name\": \"Database metadata\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0957\"}, {\"name\": \"Tool metadata\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0958\"}, {\"name\": \"User metadata\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0960\"}, {\"name\": \"Database entry metadata\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2193\"}, {\"name\": \"Ontology metadata\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2223\"}, {\"name\": \"System metadata\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3106\"}, {\"name\": \"Sample annotation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3113\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"Basic information, annotation or documentation concerning a workflow (but not the workflow itself).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Resource metadata||Workflow metadata\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2337||data_0949\"}], \"name\": \"Workflow metadata\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0949\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Basic information on bioinformatics database(s) or other data sources such as name, type, description, URL etc.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Resource metadata||Database metadata\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2337||data_0957\"}], \"name\": \"Database metadata\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0957\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Basic information about one or more bioinformatics applications or packages, such as name, type, description, or other documentation.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Resource metadata||Tool metadata\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2337||data_0958\"}], \"name\": \"Tool metadata\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0958\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Textual metadata on a software author or end-user, for example a person or other software.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Resource metadata||User metadata\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2337||data_0960\"}], \"name\": \"User metadata\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0960\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Basic information on any arbitrary database entry.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Resource metadata||Database entry metadata\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2337||data_2193\"}], \"name\": \"Database entry metadata\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2193\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Data concerning a biological ontology.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Resource metadata||Ontology metadata\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2337||data_2223\"}], \"name\": \"Ontology metadata\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2223\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Metadata concerning the software, hardware or other aspects of a computer system.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Resource metadata||System metadata\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2337||data_3106\"}], \"name\": \"System metadata\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3106\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Annotation on a biological sample, for example experimental factors and their values.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Resource metadata||Sample annotation\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2337||data_3113\"}], \"name\": \"Sample annotation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3113\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A human-readable collection of information about a specific organism.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Organism report\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2530\"}], \"name\": \"Organism report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2530\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Organism annotation\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Cell line report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0963\"}, {\"name\": \"Genome report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2711\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"A human-readable collection of information about a particular strain of organism cell line including plants, virus, fungi and bacteria. The data typically includes strain number, organism type, growth conditions, source and so on.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Organism report||Cell line report\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2530||data_0963\"}], \"name\": \"Cell line report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0963\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Cell line annotation\", \"Organism strain data\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A human-readable collection of information concerning a genome as a whole.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Organism report||Genome report\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2530||data_2711\"}], \"name\": \"Genome report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2711\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A human-readable collection of information about about how a scientific experiment or analysis was carried out that results in a specific set of data or results used for further analysis or to test a specific hypothesis.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Protocol\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2531\"}], \"name\": \"Protocol\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2531\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Experiment annotation\", \"Experiment metadata\", \"Experiment report\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"An informative report about a specific or conserved pattern in a molecular sequence, such as its context in genes or proteins, its role, origin or method of construction, etc.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Sequence signature report\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2762\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence signature report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2762\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Sequence motif report\", \"Sequence profile report\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Protein signature\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1355\"}, {\"name\": \"Nucleic acid signature\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3492\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"An informative report about a specific or conserved protein sequence pattern.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Sequence signature report||Protein signature\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2762||data_1355\"}], \"name\": \"Protein signature\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1355\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"InterPro entry\", \"Protein domain signature\", \"Protein family signature\", \"Protein region signature\", \"Protein repeat signature\", \"Protein site signature\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"An informative report about a specific or conserved nucleic acid sequence pattern.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Sequence signature report||Nucleic acid signature\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2762||data_3492\"}], \"name\": \"Nucleic acid signature\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3492\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"An informative report of information about molecular sequence(s), including basic information (metadata), and reports generated from molecular sequence analysis, including positional features and non-positional properties.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Sequence report\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2955\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2955\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Sequence-derived report\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Sequence property\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1254\"}, {\"name\": \"Sequence image\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2969\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"An informative report about non-positional sequence features, typically a report on general molecular sequence properties derived from sequence analysis.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Sequence report||Sequence property\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2955||data_1254\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence property\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1254\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Sequence properties report\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Sequence complexity report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1259\"}, {\"name\": \"Sequence ambiguity report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1260\"}, {\"name\": \"Sequence composition report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1261\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"A report on sequence complexity, for example low-complexity or repeat regions in sequences.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Sequence report||Sequence property||Sequence complexity report\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2955||data_1254||data_1259\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence complexity report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1259\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Sequence property (complexity)\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\"