ue (or column of values) is derived derived from analysis of the corresponding position in a sequence alignment.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Data||Matrix||Position-specific scoring matrix\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2082||data_2854\"}, \"name\": \"Position-specific scoring matrix\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2854\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"PSSM\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Position frequency matrix\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1361\"}, {\"name\": \"Position weight matrix\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1362\"}, {\"name\": \"Information content matrix\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1363\"}, {\"name\": \"Fingerprint\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1365\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"A profile (typically representing a sequence alignment) that is a simple matrix of nucleotide (or amino acid) counts per position.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Data||Matrix||Position-specific scoring matrix||Position frequency matrix\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2082||data_2854||data_1361\"}, \"name\": \"Position frequency matrix\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1361\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"PFM\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A profile (typically representing a sequence alignment) that is weighted matrix of nucleotide (or amino acid) counts per position.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Data||Matrix||Position-specific scoring matrix||Position weight matrix\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2082||data_2854||data_1362\"}, \"name\": \"Position weight matrix\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1362\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"PWM\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A profile (typically representing a sequence alignment) derived from a matrix of nucleotide (or amino acid) counts per position that reflects information content at each position.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Data||Matrix||Position-specific scoring matrix||Information content matrix\",