r  the set of typical spectra one obtains when running a protein through a mass spectrometer.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Molecular property||Protein property||Peptide identification\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2087||data_0897||data_0945\"}, {\"name\": \"Data||Molecular property||Peptide property||Peptide identification\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2087||data_2979||data_0945\"}], \"name\": \"Peptide identification\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0945\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"\'Protein identification\'\", \"Peptide spectrum match\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"List of molecular weight(s) of one or more proteins or peptides, for example cut by proteolytic enzymes or reagents.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Molecular property||Protein property||Peptide molecular weights\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2087||data_0897||data_1519\"}], \"name\": \"Peptide molecular weights\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1519\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A plot of the mean charge of the amino acids within a window of specified length as the window is moved along a protein sequence.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Molecular property||Protein property||Protein charge plot\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2087||data_0897||data_1523\"}], \"name\": \"Protein charge plot\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1523\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The titration curve of a protein.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Molecular property||Protein property||Protein titration curve\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2087||data_0897||data_1527\"}, {\"name\": \"Data||Plot||Protein titration curve\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2884||data_1527\"}], \"name\": \"Protein titration curve\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1527\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The isoelectric point of one proteins.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Molecular property||Protein property||Protein isoelectric point\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2087||data_0897||data_1528\"}], \"name\": \"Protein isoelectric point\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1528\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The pKa value of a protein.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Molecular property||Protein property||Protein pKa value\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2087||data_0897||data_1529\"}], \"name\": \"Protein pKa value\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1529\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The hydrogen exchange rate of a protein.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Molecular property||Protein property||Protein hydrogen exchange rate\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2087||data_0897||data_1530\"}], \"name\": \"Protein hydrogen exchange rate\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1530\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The extinction coefficient of a protein.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Molecular property||Protein property||Protein extinction coefficient\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2087||data_0897||data_1531\"}], \"name\": \"Protein extinction coefficient\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1531\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The optical density of a protein.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Molecular property||Protein property||Protein optical density\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2087||data_0897||data_1532\"}], \"name\": \"Protein optical density\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1532\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"An report on allergenicity / immunogenicity of peptides and proteins.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Molecular property||Protein property||Peptide immunogenicity data\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2087||data_0897||data_1534\"}], \"name\": \"Peptide immunogenicity data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1534\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Peptide immunogenicity\", \"Peptide immunogenicity report\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Hopp and Woods plot\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2957\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"A Hopp and Woods plot of predicted antigenicity of a peptide or protein.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Molecular property||Protein property||Peptide immunogenicity data||Hopp and Woods plot\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2087||data_0897||data_1534||data_2957\"}, {\"name\": \"Data||Plot||Hopp and Woods plot\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2884||data_2957\"}], \"name\": \"Hopp and Woods plot\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2957\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Data on the solvent accessible or buried surface area of a protein structure.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Molecular property||Protein property||Protein solvent accessibility\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2087||data_0897||data_1542\"}], \"name\": \"Protein solvent accessibility\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1542\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Data on the net charge distribution (dipole moment) of a protein structure.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Molecular property||Protein property||Protein dipole moment\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2087||data_0897||data_1545\"}], \"name\": \"Protein dipole moment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1545\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Data concerning chemical reaction(s) catalysed by enzyme(s).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Molecular property||Protein property||Enzyme kinetics data\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2087||data_0897||data_2024\"}, {\"name\": \"Data||Reaction d