\\\"hits\\\") between sequences, sequence profiles, motifs (conserved or functional patterns) and other types of sequence signatures.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence signature data||Sequence signature matches\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0860||data_0858\"}, {\"name\": \"Data||Alignment||Sequence signature matches\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_1916||data_0858\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence signature matches\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0858\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Profile-profile alignment\", \"Protein secondary database search results\", \"Search results (protein secondary database)\", \"Sequence motif hits\", \"Sequence motif matches\", \"Sequence profile alignment\", \"Sequence profile hits\", \"Sequence profile matches\", \"Sequence-profile alignment\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Any specific or conserved pattern (typically expressed as a regular expression) in a molecular sequence.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence signature data||Sequence motif\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0860||data_1353\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence motif\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1353\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Sequence motif (nucleic acid)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2070\"}, {\"name\": \"Sequence motif (protein)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2071\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"A nucleotide sequence motif.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence signature data||Sequence motif||Sequence motif (nucleic acid)\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0860||data_1353||data_2070\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence motif (nucleic acid)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2070\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Nucleic acid sequence motif\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"DNA sequence motif\", \"RNA sequence motif\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"An amino acid sequence motif.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence signature data||Sequence motif||Sequence motif (protein)\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0860||data_1353||data_2071\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence motif (protein)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2071\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Protein sequence motif\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Some type of statistical model representing a (typically multiple) sequence alignment.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence signature data||Sequence profile\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0860||data_1354\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence profile\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1354\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Position-specific scoring matrix\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2854\"}, {\"name\": \"Profile HMM\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3949\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"A simple matrix of numbers, where each value (or column of values) is derived derived from analysis of the corresponding position in a sequence alignment.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence signature data||Sequence profile||Position-specific scoring matrix\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0860||data_1354||data_2854\"}, {\"name\": \"Data||Matrix||Position-specific scoring matrix\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2082||data_2854\"}], \"name\": \"Position-specific scoring matrix\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2854\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"PSSM\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Position frequency matrix\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1361\"}, {\"name\": \"Position weight matrix\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1362\"}, {\"name\": \"Information content matrix\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1363\"}, {\"name\": \"Fingerprint\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1365\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"A profile (typically representing a sequence alignment) that is a simple matrix of nucleotide (or amino acid) counts per position.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence signature data||Sequence pr