t results in a specific set of data or results used for further analysis or to test a specific hypothesis.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Protocol\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2531\"}], \"name\": \"Protocol\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2531\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Experiment annotation\", \"Experiment metadata\", \"Experiment report\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"An informative report about a specific or conserved pattern in a molecular sequence, such as its context in genes or proteins, its role, origin or method of construction, etc.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Sequence signature report\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2762\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence signature report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2762\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Sequence motif report\", \"Sequence profile report\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Protein signature\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1355\"}, {\"name\": \"Nucleic acid signature\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3492\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"An informative report about a specific or conserved protein sequence pattern.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Sequence signature report||Protein signature\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2762||data_1355\"}], \"name\": \"Protein signature\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1355\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"InterPro entry\", \"Protein domain signature\", \"Protein family signature\", \"Protein region signature\", \"Protein repeat signature\", \"Protein site signature\"], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"An informative report about a specific or conserved nucleic acid sequence pattern.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Sequence signature report||Nucleic acid signature\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2762||data_3492\"}], \"name\": \"Nucleic acid signature\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3492\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"An informative report of information about molecular sequence(s), including basic information (metadata), and reports generated from molecular sequence analysis, including positional features and non-positional properties.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Sequence report\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2955\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2955\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Sequence-derived report\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Sequence property\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1254\"}, {\"name\": \"Sequence image\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2969\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"An informative report about non-positional sequence features, typically a report on general molecular sequence properties derived from sequence analysis.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Sequence report||Sequence property\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2955||data_1254\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence property\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1254\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Sequence properties report\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Sequence complexity report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1259\"}, {\"name\": \"Sequence ambiguity report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1260\"}, {\"name\": \"Sequence composition report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1261\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"A report on sequence complexity, for example low-complexity or repeat regions in sequences.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Sequence report||Sequence property||Sequence complexity report\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2955||data_1254||data_1259\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence complexity report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1259\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Sequence property (complexity)\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"child