adable collection of information concerning a clinical trial.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Clinical trial report\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_3558\"}], \"name\": \"Clinical trial report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3558\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Clinical trial information\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A report about a biosample.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Reference sample report\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_3567\"}], \"name\": \"Reference sample report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3567\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Biosample report\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A human-readable collection of information concerning biosafety data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Biosafety report\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_3716\"}], \"name\": \"Biosafety report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3716\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Biosafety information\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Pathogenicity report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3718\"}, {\"name\": \"Biosafety classification\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3719\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"Information about the ability of an organism to cause disease in a corresponding host.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Biosafety report||Pathogenicity report\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_3716||data_3718\"}], \"name\": \"Pathogenicity report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3718\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Pathogenicity\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Information about the biosafety classification of an organism according to corresponding law.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Biosafety report||Biosafety classification\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_3716||data_3719\"}], \"name\": \"Biosafety classification\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3719\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Biosafety level\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A report about any kind of isolation of biological material.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Isolation report\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_3717\"}], \"name\": \"Isolation report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3717\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Geographic location\", \"Isolation source\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Geographic location\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3720\"}, {\"name\": \"Isolation source\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3721\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"A report about localisation of the isolaton of biological material e.g. country or coordinates.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Isolation report||Geographic location\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_3717||data_3720\"}], \"name\": \"Geographic location\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3720\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A report about any kind of isolation source of biological material e.g. blood, water, soil.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Isolation report||Isolation source\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_3717||data_3721\"}], \"name\": \"Isolation source\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3721\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A human-readable systematic collection of patient (or population) health information in a digital format.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Electronic health record\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_3861\"}], \"name\": \"Electronic health record\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3861\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"EHR\", \"EMR\", \"Electronic medical record\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A human-readable collection of information about about how a scientific experiment or analysis was carried out that results in a specific set of data or results used for further analysis or to test a specific hypothesis.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Quality control report\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_3914\"}], \"name\": \"Quality control report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3914\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"QC metrics\", \"QC report\", \"Quality control metrics\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A report of hits from searching a database of some type.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Database search results\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2080\"}], \"name\": \"Database search results\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2080\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Database hits\", \"Search results\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Sequence search results\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0857\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"A report of sequence hits and associated data from searching a database of sequences (for example a BLAST search). This will typically include a list of scores (often with statistical evaluation) and a set of alignments for the hits.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Database search results||Sequence search results\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2080||data_0857\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence search results\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0857\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Database hits (sequence)\", \"Sequence database hits\", \"Sequence database search results\", \"Sequence search hits\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"An array of numerical values.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Matrix\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2082\"}], \"name\": \"Matrix\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2082\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Array\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Comparison matrix\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0874\"}, {\"name\": \"Protein sequence-structure scoring matrix\", \"uri\": \"http://