Sequencing metadata name||Flow cell identifier\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0842||data_2099||data_3732||data_3733\"}], \"name\": \"Flow cell identifier\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3733\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_3734\": {\"definition\": \"An identifier of a lane within a flow cell of a sequencing machine, within which millions of sequences are immobilised, amplified and sequenced.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Identifier||Name||Sequencing metadata name||Lane identifier\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0842||data_2099||data_3732||data_3734\"}], \"name\": \"Lane identifier\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3734\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_3735\": {\"definition\": \"A number corresponding to the number of an analysis performed by a sequencing machine.  For example, if it\'s the 13th analysis, the run is 13.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Identifier||Name||Sequencing metadata name||Run number\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0842||data_2099||data_3732||data_3735\"}], \"name\": \"Run number\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3735\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_2109\": {\"definition\": \"An identifier that is re-used for data objects of fundamentally different types (typically served from a single database).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Identifier||Identifier (hybrid)\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0842||data_2109\"}], \"name\": \"Identifier (hybrid)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2109\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"TIGR identifier\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1036\"}, {\"name\": \"FlyBase ID\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1089\"}, {\"name\": \"KEGG object identifier\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1154\"}, {\"name\": \"iHOP symbol\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1891\"}, {\"name\": \"