data_0006||data_0842||data_2109||data_2113||data_1092\"}], \"name\": \"WormBase class\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1092\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_2917\": {\"definition\": \"An identifier of an entity from the ConsensusPathDB database.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Identifier||Identifier (hybrid)||ConsensusPathDB identifier\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0842||data_2109||data_2917\"}], \"name\": \"ConsensusPathDB identifier\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2917\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Pathway ID (ConsensusPathDB)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2345\"}, {\"name\": \"ConsensusPathDB entity ID\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2776\"}, {\"name\": \"ConsensusPathDB entity name\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2777\"}]}, \"data_0850\": {\"definition\": \"A collection of one or typically multiple molecular sequences (which can include derived data or metadata) that do not (typically) correspond to molecular sequence database records or entries and which (typically) are derived from some analytical method.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence set\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0850\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence set\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0850\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Alignment reference\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Sequence set (protein)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1233\"}, {\"name\": \"Sequence set (nucleic acid)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1234\"}, {\"name\": \"Sequence cluster\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1235\"}]}, \"data_1233\": {\"definition\": \"Any collection of multiple protein sequences and associated metadata that do not (typically) correspond to common sequence database records or database entries.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence set||Sequence set (protein)\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0850||data_1233\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence set (protein)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1233\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Proteolytic digest\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1238\"}, {\"name\": \"Sequence cluster (protein)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1245\"}, {\"name\": \"Peptide molecular weight hits\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1262\"}]}, \"data_1238\": {\"definition\": \"A protein sequence cleaved into peptide fragments (by enzymatic or chemical cleavage) with fragment masses.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence set||Sequence set (protein)||Proteolytic digest\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0850||data_1233||data_1238\"}], \"name\": \"Proteolytic digest\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1238\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_1245\": {\"definition\": \"A cluster of protein sequences.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence set||Sequence set (protein)||Sequence cluster (protein)\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0850||data_1233||data_1245\"}, {\"name\": \"Data||Sequence set||Sequence cluster||Sequence cluster (protein)\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0850||data_1235||data_1245\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence cluster (protein)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1245\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Protein sequence cluster\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_1262\": {\"definition\": \"A report on peptide fragments of certain molecular weight(s) in one or more protein sequences.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence set||Sequence set (protein)||Peptide molecular weight hits\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0850||data_1233||data_1262\"}], \"name\": \"Peptide molecular weight hits\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1262\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_1234\": {\"definition\": \"Any collection of multiple nucleotide sequences and associated metadata that do not (typically) correspond to common sequence database records or database entries.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence set||Sequence set (nucleic acid)\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0850||data_1234\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence set (nucleic acid)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1234\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Sequence trace\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0924\"}, {\"name\": \"Sequence assembly\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0925\"}, {\"name\": \"Restriction digest\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1239\"}, {\"name\": \"PCR primers\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1240\"}, {\"name\": \"Sequence cluster (nucleic acid)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1246\"}]}, \"data_0924\": {\"definition\": \"Fluorescence trace data generated by an automated DNA sequencer, which can be interprted as a molecular sequence (reads), given associated sequencing metadata such as base-call quality scores.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence set||Sequence set (nucleic acid)||Sequence trace\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0850||data_1234||data_0924\"}, {\"name\": \"Data||Experimental measurement||Sequence trace\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3108||data_0924\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence trace\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0924\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0925\": {\"definition\": \"An assembly of fragments of a (typically genomic) DNA sequence.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence set||Sequence set (nucleic acid)||Sequence assembly\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0850||data_1234||data_0925\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence assembly\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0925\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Contigs\", \"SO:0000353\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"SO:0001248\"], \"children\": []}, \"data_1239\": {\"definition\": \"Restriction digest fragments from digesting a nucleotide sequence with restriction sites using a restriction endonuclease.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence set||Sequence set (nucleic acid)||Restriction digest\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0850||data_1234||data_1239\"}], \"name\": \"Restriction digest\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1239\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_1240\": {\"definition\": \"Oligonucleotide primer(s) for PCR and DNA amplification, for example a minimal primer set.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence set||Sequence set (nucleic acid)||PCR primers\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0850||data_1234||data_1240\"}], \"name\": \"PCR primers\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1240\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_1246\": {\"definition\": \"A cluster of nucleotide sequences.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence set||Sequence set (nucleic acid)||Sequence cluster (nucleic acid)\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0850||data_1234||data_1246\"}, {\"name\": \"Data||Sequence set||Sequence cluster||Sequence cluster (nucleic acid)\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0850||data_1235||data_1246\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence cluster (nucleic acid)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1246\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Nucleotide sequence cluster\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_1235\": {\"definition\": \"A set of sequences that have been clustered or otherwise classified as belonging to a group including (typically) sequence cluster information.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence set||Sequence cluster\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0850||data_1235\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence cluster\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1235\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Sequence cluster (protein)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1245\"}, {\"name\": \"Sequence cluster (nucleic acid)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1246\"}]}, \"data_0860\": {\"definition\": \"Data concering concerning specific or conserved pattern in molecular sequences and the classifiers used for their identification, including sequence motifs, profiles or other diagnostic element.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence signature data\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0860\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence signature data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0860\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Sequence signature matches\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0858\"}, {\"name\": \"Sequence motif\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1353\"}, {\"name\": \"Sequence profile\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1354\"}]}, \"data_0858\": {\"definition\": \"Report on the location of matches (\\\"hits\\\") between sequences, sequence profiles, motifs (conserved or functional patterns) and other types of sequence signatures.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence signature data||Sequence signature matches\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0860||data_0858\"}, {\"name\": \"Data||Alignment||Sequence signature matches\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_1916||data_0858\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence signature matches\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0858\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Profile-profile alignment\", \"Protein secondary database search results\", \"Search results (protein secondary database)\", \"Sequence motif hits\", \"Sequence motif matches\", \"Sequence profile alignment\", \"Sequence profile hits\", \"Sequence profile matches\", \"Sequence-profile alignment\"], \"children\": []}, \"data_1353\": {\"definition\": \"Any specific or conserved pattern (typically expressed as a regular expression) in a molecular sequence.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence signature data||Sequence motif\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0860||data_1353\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence motif\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1353\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Sequence motif (nucleic acid)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2070\"}, {\"name\": \"Sequence motif (protein)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2071\"}]}, \"data_2070\": {\"definition\": \"A nucleotide sequence motif.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence signature data||Sequence motif||Sequence motif (nucleic acid)\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0860||data_1353||data_2070\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence motif (nucleic acid)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2070\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Nucleic acid sequence motif\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"DNA sequence motif\", \"RNA sequence motif\"], \"children\": []}, \"data_2071\": {\"definition\": \"An amino acid sequence motif.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence signature data||Sequence motif||Sequence motif (protein)\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0860||data_1353||data_2071\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence motif (protein)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2071\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Protein sequence motif\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_1354\": {\"definition\": \"Some type of statistical model representing a (typically multiple) sequence alignment.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence signature data||Sequence profile\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0860||data_1354\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence profile\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1354\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Position-specific scoring matrix\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2854\"}, {\"name\": \"Profile HMM\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3949\"}]}, \"data_2854\": {\"definition\": \"A simple matrix of numbers, where each value (or column of values) is derived derived from analysis of the corresponding position in a sequence alignment.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence signature data||Sequence profile||Position-specific scoring matrix\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0860||data_1354||data_2854\"}, {\"name\": \"Data||Matrix||Position-specific scoring matrix\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2082||data_2854\"}], \"name\": \"Position-specific scoring matrix\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2854\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"PSSM\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Position frequency matrix\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1361\"}, {\"name\": \"Position weight matrix\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1362\"}, {\"name\": \"Information content matrix\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1363\"}, {\"name\": \"Fingerprint\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1365\"}]}, \"data_1361\": {\"definition\": \"A profile (typically representing a sequence alignment) that is a simple matrix of nucleotide (or amino acid) counts per position.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence signature data||Sequence profile||Position-specific scoring matrix||Position frequency matrix\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0860||data_1354||data_2854||data_1361\"}, {\"name\": \"Data||Matrix||Position-specific scoring matrix||Position frequency matrix\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2082||data_2854||data_1361\"}], \"name\": \"Position frequency matrix\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1361\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"PFM\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_1362\": {\"definition\": \"A profile (typically representing a sequence alignment) that is weighted matrix of nucleotide (or amino acid) counts per position.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence signature data||Sequence profile||Position-specific scoring matrix||Position weight matrix\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0860||data_1354||data_2854||data_1362\"}, {\"name\": \"Data||Matrix||Position-specific scoring matrix||Position weight matrix\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2082||data_2854||data_1362\"}], \"name\": \"Position weight matrix\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1362\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"PWM\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_1363\": {\"definition\"