re||Lipid structure\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0883||data_2850\"}], \"name\": \"Lipid structure\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2850\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_3805\": {\"definition\": \"Structural 3D model (volume map) from electron microscopy.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Structure||3D EM Map\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0883||data_3805\"}], \"name\": \"3D EM Map\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3805\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_3806\": {\"definition\": \"Annotation on a structural 3D EM Map from electron microscopy. This might include one or several locations in the map of the known features of a particular macromolecule.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Structure||3D EM Mask\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0883||data_3806\"}], \"name\": \"3D EM Mask\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3806\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0889\": {\"definition\": \"Some type of structural (3D) profile or template (representing a structure or structure alignment).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Structural profile\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0889\"}], \"name\": \"Structural profile\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0889\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"3D profile\", \"Structural (3D) profile\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0914\": {\"definition\": \"Data derived from analysis of codon usage (typically a codon usage table) of DNA sequences.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Codon usage data\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0914\"}], \"name\": \"Codon usage data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0914\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Codon usage report\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Codon usage table\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1597\"}, {\"name\": \"Genetic code\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1598\"}, {\"name\": \"Codon usage bias plot\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1600\"}, {\"name\": \"Codon usage fraction difference\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1602\"}, {\"name\": \"Codon usage bias\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2865\"}]}, \"data_1597\": {\"definition\": \"Table of codon usage data calculated from one or more nucleic acid sequences.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Codon usage data||Codon usage table\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0914||data_1597\"}], \"name\": \"Codon usage table\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1597\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_1598\": {\"definition\": \"A genetic code for an organism.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Codon usage data||Genetic code\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0914||data_1598\"}], \"name\": \"Genetic code\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1598\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_1600\": {\"definition\": \"A plot of the synonymous codon usage calculated for windows over a nucleotide sequence.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Codon usage data||Codon usage bias plot\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0914||data_1600\"}], \"name\": \"Codon usage bias plot\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1600\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Synonymous codon usage statistic plot\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_1602\": {\"definition\": \"The differences in codon usage fractions between two codon usage tables.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Codon usage data||Codon usage fraction difference\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_0914||data_1602\"}], \"name\": \"Codon usage fraction difference\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1602\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_2865\": {\"definition\": \"A numerical measure of differences in the frequency of occurrence of synonymous codons in DNA sequences.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Codon usage data||Codon usage bias\", 