 property||Protein property||Enzyme kinetics data||Km\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2087||data_0897||data_2024||data_0910\"}, {\"name\": \"Data||Reaction data||Enzyme kinetics data||Km\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2978||data_2024||data_0910\"}], \"name\": \"Km\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0910\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_2025\": {\"definition\": \"A plot giving an approximation of the kinetics of an enzyme-catalysed reaction, assuming simple kinetics (i.e. no intermediate or product inhibition, allostericity or cooperativity). It plots initial reaction rate to the substrate concentration (S) from which the maximum rate (vmax) is apparent.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Molecular property||Protein property||Enzyme kinetics data||Michaelis Menten plot\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2087||data_0897||data_2024||data_2025\"}, {\"name\": \"Data||Reaction data||Enzyme kinetics data||Michaelis Menten plot\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2978||data_2024||data_2025\"}], \"name\": \"Michaelis Menten plot\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2025\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_2026\": {\"definition\": \"A plot based on the Michaelis Menten equation of enzyme kinetics plotting the ratio of the initial substrate concentration (S) against the reaction velocity (v).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Molecular property||Protein property||Enzyme kinetics data||Hanes Woolf plot\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2087||data_0897||data_2024||data_2026\"}, {\"name\": \"Data||Reaction data||Enzyme kinetics data||Hanes Woolf plot\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2978||data_2024||data_2026\"}], \"name\": \"Hanes Woolf plot\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2026\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_2165\": {\"definition\": \"A plot of pK versus pH for a protein.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Molecular property||Protein property||Prot