"CD spectra\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0939\"}]}, \"data_0937\": {\"definition\": \"X-ray crystallography data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Experimental measurement||Protein structure raw data||Electron density map\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3108||data_2537||data_0937\"}], \"name\": \"Electron density map\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0937\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0938\": {\"definition\": \"Nuclear magnetic resonance (NMR) raw data, typically for a protein.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Experimental measurement||Protein structure raw data||Raw NMR data\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3108||data_2537||data_0938\"}], \"name\": \"Raw NMR data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0938\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Protein NMR data\"], \"children\": []}, \"data_0939\": {\"definition\": \"Protein secondary structure from protein coordinate or circular dichroism (CD) spectroscopic data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Experimental measurement||Protein structure raw data||CD spectra\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3108||data_2537||data_0939\"}], \"name\": \"CD spectra\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0939\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"CD spectrum\", \"Protein circular dichroism (CD) spectroscopic data\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_3722\": {\"definition\": \"Experimentally determined parameter of the physiology of an organism, e.g. substrate spectrum.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Experimental measurement||Physiology parameter\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3108||data_3722\"}], \"name\": \"Physiology parameter\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3722\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_3723\": {\"definition\": \"Experimentally determined parameter of the morphology of an organism, e.g. size & shape.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Experimental measurement||Morphology parameter\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3108||data_3723\"}], \"name\": \"Morphology parameter\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3723\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_3724\": {\"definition\": \"Experimental determined parameter for the cultivation of an organism.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Experimental measurement||Cultivation parameter\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3108||data_3724\"}], \"name\": \"Cultivation parameter\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3724\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Cultivation conditions\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Carbon source\", \"Culture media composition\", \"Nitrogen source\", \"Salinity\", \"Temperature\", \"pH value\"], \"children\": []}, \"data_3483\": {\"definition\": \"The spectrum of frequencies of electromagnetic radiation emitted from a molecule as a result of some spectroscopy experiment.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Spectrum\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3483\"}], \"name\": \"Spectrum\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3483\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Spectra\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"NMR spectrum\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3488\"}]}, \"data_3488\": {\"definition\": \"Spectral information for a molecule from a nuclear magnetic resonance experiment.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Spectrum||NMR spectrum\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3483||data_3488\"}], \"name\": \"NMR spectrum\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3488\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"NMR spectra\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_3498\": {\"definition\": \"Data on gene sequence variations resulting large-scale genotyping and DNA sequencing projects.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Sequence variations\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3498\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence variations\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3498\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Gene sequence variations\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_3669\": {\"definition\": \"Some material that is used for educational (training) purposes.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Training material\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3669\"}], \"name\": \"Training material\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3669\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"OER\", \"Open educational resource\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Online course\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3670\"}]}, \"data_3670\": {\"definition\": \"A training course available for use on the Web.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Training material||Online course\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3669||data_3670\"}], \"name\": \"Online course\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3670\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"On-line course\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"MOOC\", \"Massive open online course\"], \"children\": []}, \"data_3707\": {\"definition\": \"Machine-readable biodiversity data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Biodiversity data\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3707\"}, {\"name\": \"Data||Ecological data||Biodiversity data\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3736||data_3707\"}], \"name\": \"Biodiversity data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3707\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Biodiversity information\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"OTU table\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Alpha diversity data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3737\"}, {\"name\": \"Beta diversity data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3738\"}, {\"name\": \"Gamma diversity data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3739\"}]}, \"data_3737\": {\"definition\": \"The mean species diversity in sites or habitats at a local scale.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Biodiversity data||Alpha diversity data\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3707||data_3737\"}, {\"name\": \"Data||Ecological data||Biodiversity data||Alpha diversity data\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3736||data_3707||data_3737\"}], \"name\": \"Alpha diversity data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3737\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"\\u03b1-diversity\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_3738\": {\"definition\": \"The ratio between regional and local species diversity.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Biodiversity data||Beta diversity data\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3707||data_3738\"}, {\"name\": \"Data||Ecological data||Biodiversity data||Beta diversity data\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3736||data_3707||data_3738\"}], \"name\": \"Beta diversity data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3738\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"True beta diversity\", \"\\u03b2-diversity\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_3739\": {\"definition\": \"The total species diversity in a landscape.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Biodiversity data||Gamma diversity data\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3707||data_3739\"}, {\"name\": \"Data||Ecological data||Biodiversity data||Gamma diversity data\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3736||data_3707||data_3739\"}], \"name\": \"Gamma diversity data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3739\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"\\u0263-diversity\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_3736\": {\"definition\": \"Data concerning ecology; for example measurements and reports from the study of interactions among organisms and their environment.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Ecological data\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3736\"}], \"name\": \"Ecological data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3736\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Biodiversity data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3707\"}]}, \"data_3753\": {\"definition\": \"A ranked list of categories (usually ontology concepts), each associated with a statistical metric of over-/under-representation within the studied data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Over-representation data\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3753\"}], \"name\": \"Over-representation data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3753\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Enrichment report\", \"Over-representation report\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Functional enrichment report\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"GO-term enrichment data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3754\"}, {\"name\": \"Pathway overrepresentation data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3953\"}]}, \"data_3754\": {\"definition\": \"A ranked list of Gene Ontology concepts, each associated with a p-value, concerning or derived from the analysis of e.g. a set of genes or proteins.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Over-representation data||GO-term enrichment data\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3753||data_3754\"}], \"name\": \"GO-term enrichment data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3754\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"GO-term enrichment report\", \"Gene ontology concept over-representation report\", \"Gene ontology enrichment report\", \"Gene ontology term enrichment report\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_3953\": {\"definition\": \"A ranked list of pathways, each associated with z-score, p-value or similar, concerning or derived from the analysis of e.g. a set of genes or proteins.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Over-representation data||Pathway overrepresentation data\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3753||data_3953\"}], \"name\": \"Pathway overrepresentation data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3953\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Pathway analysis results\", \"Pathway enrichment report\", \"Pathway over-representation report\", \"Pathway report\", \"Pathway term enrichment report\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_3786\": {\"definition\": \"A structured query, in form of a script, that defines a database search task.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Query script\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3786\"}], \"name\": \"Query script\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3786\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_3842\": {\"definition\": \"Data coming from molecular simulations, computer \\\"experiments\\\" on model molecules.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Molecular simulation data\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3842\"}], \"name\": \"Molecular simulation data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3842\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_3869\": {\"definition\": \"Data coming from molecular simulations, computer \\\"experiments\\\" on model molecules. Tipically formed by two separated but indivisible pieces of information: topology data (static) and trajectory data (dynamic).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Simulation\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3869\"}], \"name\": \"Simulation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3869\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Trajectory data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3870\"}, {\"name\": \"Forcefield parameters\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3871\"}, {\"name\": \"Topology data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3872\"}]}, \"data_3870\": {\"definition\": \"Dynamic information of a structure molecular system coming from a molecular simulation: XYZ 3D coordinates (sometimes with their associated velocities) for every atom along time.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Simulation||Trajectory data\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3869||data_3870\"}], \"name\": \"Trajectory data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3870\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_3871\": {\"definition\": \"Force field parameters: charges, masses, radii, bond lengths, bond dihedrals, etc. define the structural molecular system, and are essential for the proper description and simulation of a molecular system.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Simulation||Forcefield parameters\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3869||data_3871\"}], \"name\": \"Forcefield parameters\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3871\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_3872\": {\"definition\": \"Static information of a structure molecular system that is needed for a molecular simulation: the list of atoms, their non-bonded parameters for Van der Waals and electrostatic interactions, and the complete connectivity in terms of bonds, angles and dihedrals.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Simulation||Topology data\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_3869||data_3872\"}], \"name\": \"Topology data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3872\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}}','2025-08-27 12:52:46.328707');
