data_2762||data_1355\"}], \"name\": \"Protein signature\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1355\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"InterPro entry\", \"Protein domain signature\", \"Protein family signature\", \"Protein region signature\", \"Protein repeat signature\", \"Protein site signature\"], \"children\": []}, \"data_3492\": {\"definition\": \"An informative report about a specific or conserved nucleic acid sequence pattern.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Sequence signature report||Nucleic acid signature\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2762||data_3492\"}], \"name\": \"Nucleic acid signature\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3492\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_2955\": {\"definition\": \"An informative report of information about molecular sequence(s), including basic information (metadata), and reports generated from molecular sequence analysis, including positional features and non-positional properties.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Sequence report\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2955\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2955\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Sequence-derived report\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Sequence property\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1254\"}, {\"name\": \"Sequence image\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2969\"}]}, \"data_1254\": {\"definition\": \"An informative report about non-positional sequence features, typically a report on general molecular sequence properties derived from sequence analysis.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Report||Sequence report||Sequence property\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2048||data_2955||data_1254\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence property\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1254\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Sequence properties report\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Sequence complexity r