inction coefficient\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1531\"}, {\"name\": \"Protein optical density\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1532\"}, {\"name\": \"Peptide immunogenicity data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1534\"}, {\"name\": \"Protein solvent accessibility\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1542\"}, {\"name\": \"Protein dipole moment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1545\"}, {\"name\": \"Enzyme kinetics data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2024\"}, {\"name\": \"Protein ionisation curve\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2165\"}, {\"name\": \"Protein secondary structure\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2956\"}, {\"name\": \"Protein hydropathy data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2970\"}, {\"name\": \"Protein geometry data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2991\"}, {\"name\": \"Rate of association\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3451\"}, {\"name\": \"Ordination plot\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3743\"}]}, \"data_0906\": {\"definition\": \"Data concerning the interactions (predicted or known) within or between a protein, structural domain or part of a protein. This includes intra- and inter-residue contacts and distances, as well as interactions with other proteins and non-protein entities such as nucleic acid, metal atoms, water, ions etc.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Molecular property||Protein property||Protein interaction data\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2087||data_0897||data_0906\"}], \"name\": \"Protein interaction data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0906\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Protein interaction record\", \"Protein interaction report\", \"Protein report (interaction)\", \"Protein-protein interaction data\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Atom interaction data\", \"Protein non-covalent interactions report\", \"Residue interaction data\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Protein distance matrix\", \"uri\": \"http://edamont