ntology.org/data_0928\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Sequence tag profile\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2535\"}]}, \"data_2535\": {\"definition\": \"Output from a serial analysis of gene expression (SAGE), massively parallel signature sequencing (MPSS) or sequencing by synthesis (SBS) experiment.  In all cases this is a list of short sequence tags and the number of times it is observed.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Expression data||Gene expression profile||Sequence tag profile\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2603||data_0928||data_2535\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence tag profile\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2535\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Sequencing-based expression profile\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Sequence tag profile (with gene assignment)\"], \"children\": []}, \"data_1714\": {\"definition\": \"An image of spots from a microarray experiment.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Expression data||Microarray spots image\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2603||data_1714\"}, {\"name\": \"Data||Image||Raw image||Microarray spots image\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2968||data_3424||data_1714\"}], \"name\": \"Microarray spots image\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1714\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_3115\": {\"definition\": \"Annotation on the array itself used in a microarray experiment.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Expression data||Microarray metadata\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2603||data_3115\"}], \"name\": \"Microarray metadata\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3115\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Oligonucleotide probe annotation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2717\"}]}, \"data_2717\": {\"definition\": \"General annotation on an oligonucleotide probe, or a set of probes.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Expression data||Microarray metadata||Oligonucleotide probe annotation