es according to a clustering algorithm.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Expression data||Clustered expression profiles\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2603||data_3768\"}], \"name\": \"Clustered expression profiles\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_3768\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"Clustered gene expression profiles\"], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Heat map\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1636\"}]}, \"data_1636\": {\"definition\": \"A graphical 2D tabular representation of expression data, typically derived from an omics experiment. A heat map is a table where rows and columns correspond to different features and contexts (for example, cells or samples) and the cell colour represents the level of expression of a gene that context.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Expression data||Clustered expression profiles||Heat map\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2603||data_3768||data_1636\"}, {\"name\": \"Data||Image||Heat map\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2968||data_1636\"}], \"name\": \"Heat map\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1636\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_2884\": {\"definition\": \"Biological data that has been plotted as a graph of some type, or plotting instructions for rendering such a graph.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Data||Plot\", \"key\": \"data_0006||data_2884\"}], \"name\": \"Plot\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2884\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Graph data\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Protein titration curve\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1527\"}, {\"name\": \"Base pairing probability matrix dotplot\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1595\"}, {\"name\": \"Fickett testcode plot\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2160\"}, {\"name\": \"Sequence similarity plot\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2161\"}, {\"name\": \"Protein ionisation curve\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2165\"}, {\"name\