"data_3707\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Ecological data\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_3736\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Machine-readable biodiversity data.\", \"n\": \"Biodiversity data\", \"ns\": [\"OTU table\"], \"u\": \"data_3707\", \"es\": [\"Biodiversity information\"], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Alpha diversity data\", \"u\": \"data_3737\"}, {\"n\": \"Beta diversity data\", \"u\": \"data_3738\"}, {\"n\": \"Gamma diversity data\", \"u\": \"data_3739\"}], \"p\": {\"n\": \"Data||Ecological data||Biodiversity data\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_3736||data_3707\"}, \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The mean species diversity in sites or habitats at a local scale.\", \"n\": \"Alpha diversity data\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_3737\", \"es\": [\"\\u03b1-diversity\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": {\"n\": \"Data||Ecological data||Biodiversity data||Alpha diversity data\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_3736||data_3707||data_3737\"}, \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The ratio between regional and local species diversity.\", \"n\": \"Beta diversity data\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_3738\", \"es\": [\"True beta diversity\", \"\\u03b2-diversity\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": {\"n\": \"Data||Ecological data||Biodiversity data||Beta diversity data\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_3736||data_3707||data_3738\"}, \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The total species diversity in a landscape.\", \"n\": \"Gamma diversity data\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_3739\", \"es\": [\"\\u0263-diversity\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": {\"n\": \"Data||Ecological data||Biodiversity data||Gamma diversity data\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_3736||data_3707||data_3739\"}, \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"A ranked list of categories (usually ontology concepts), each associated with a statistical metric of over-/under-representation within the studied data.\", \"n\": \"Over-representation data\", \"ns\": [\"Functional enrichment report\"], \"u\": \"data_3753\", \"es\": [\"Enrichment report\", \"Over-representation report\"], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"GO-term enrichment data\", \"u\": \"data_3754\"}, {\"n\": \"Pathway overrepresentation data\", \"u\": \"data_3953\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Over-representation data\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_3753\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"A ranked list of Gene Ontology concepts, each associated with a p-value, concerning or derived from the analysis of e.g. a set of genes or proteins.\", \"n\": \"GO-term enrichment data\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_3754\", \"es\": [\"GO-term enrichment report\", \"Gene ontology concept over-representation report\", \"Gene ontology enrichment report\", \"Gene ontology term enrichment report\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Over-representation data||GO-term enrichment data\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_3753||data_3754\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"A ranked list of pathways, each associated with z-score, p-value or similar, concerning or derived from the analysis of e.g. a set of genes or proteins.\", \"n\": \"Pathway overrepresentation data\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_3953\", \"es\": [\"Pathway analysis results\", \"Pathway enrichment report\", \"Pathway over-representation report\", \"Pathway report\", \"Pathway term enrichment report\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Over-representation data||Pathway overrepresentation data\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_3753||data_3953\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"A structured query, in form of a script, that defines a database search task.\", \"n\": \"Query script\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_3786\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Query script\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_3786\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Data coming from molecular simulations, computer \\\"experiments\\\" on model molecules.\", \"n\": \"Molecular simulation data\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_3842\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Molecular simulation data\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_3842\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Data coming from molecular simulations, computer \\\"experiments\\\" on model molecules. Tipically formed by two separated but indivisible pieces of information: topology data (static) and trajectory data (dynamic).\", \"n\": \"Simulation\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_3869\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Trajectory data\", \"u\": \"data_3870\"}, {\"n\": \"Forcefield parameters\", \"u\": \"data_3871\"}, {\"n\": \"Topology data\", \"u\": \"data_3872\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Simulation\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_3869\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Dynamic information of a structure molecular system coming from a molecular simulation: XYZ 3D coordinates (sometimes with their associated velocities) for every atom along time.\", \"n\": \"Trajectory data\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_3870\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Simulation||Trajectory data\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_3869||data_3870\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Force field parameters: charges, masses, radii, bond lengths, bond dihedrals, etc. define the structural molecular system, and are essential for the proper description and simulation of a molecular system.\", \"n\": \"Forcefield parameters\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_3871\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Simulation||Forcefield parameters\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_3869||data_3871\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Static information of a structure molecular system that is needed for a molecular simulation: the list of atoms, their non-bonded parameters for Van der Waals and electrostatic interactions, and the complete connectivity in terms of bonds, angles and dihedrals.\", \"n\": \"Topology data\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_3872\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Sim