ta_1234||data_1239\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_1240\": {\"d\": \"Oligonucleotide primer(s) for PCR and DNA amplification, for example a minimal primer set.\", \"n\": \"PCR primers\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_1240\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Sequence set||Sequence set (nucleic acid)||PCR primers\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_0850||data_1234||data_1240\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_1246\": {\"d\": \"A cluster of nucleotide sequences.\", \"n\": \"Sequence cluster (nucleic acid)\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_1246\", \"es\": [\"Nucleotide sequence cluster\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Sequence set||Sequence set (nucleic acid)||Sequence cluster (nucleic acid)\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_0850||data_1234||data_1246\"}, {\"n\": \"Data||Sequence set||Sequence cluster||Sequence cluster (nucleic acid)\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_0850||data_1235||data_1246\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_1235\": {\"d\": \"A set of sequences that have been clustered or otherwise classified as belonging to a group including (typically) sequence cluster information.\", \"n\": \"Sequence cluster\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_1235\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Sequence cluster (protein)\", \"u\": \"data_1245\"}, {\"n\": \"Sequence cluster (nucleic acid)\", \"u\": \"data_1246\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Sequence set||Sequence cluster\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_0850||data_1235\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_0860\": {\"d\": \"Data concering concerning specific or conserved pattern in molecular sequences and the classifiers used for their identification, including sequence motifs, profiles or other diagnostic element.\", \"n\": \"Sequence signature data\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_0860\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Sequence signature matches\", \"u\": \"data_0858\"}, {\"n\": \"Sequence motif\", \"u\": \"data_1353\"}, {\"n\": \"Sequence profile\", \"u\": \"data_1354\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Sequence signature data\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_0860\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_0858\": {\"d\": \"Report on the location of matches (\\\"hits\\\") between sequences, sequence profiles, motifs (conserved or functional patterns) and other types of sequence signatures.\", \"n\": \"Sequence signature matches\", \"ns\": [\"Profile-profile alignment\", \"Protein secondary database search results\", \"Search results (protein secondary database)\", \"Sequence motif hits\", \"Sequence motif matches\", \"Sequence profile alignment\", \"Sequence profile hits\", \"Sequence profile matches\", \"Sequence-profile alignment\"], \"u\": \"data_0858\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Sequence signature data||Sequence signature matches\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_0860||data_0858\"}, {\"n\": \"Data||Alignment||Sequence signature matches\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_1916||data_0858\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_1353\": {\"d\": \"Any specific or conserved pattern (typically expressed as a regular expression) in a molecular sequence.\", \"n\": \"Sequence motif\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_1353\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Sequence motif (nucleic acid)\", \"u\": \"data_2070\"}, {\"n\": \"Sequence motif (protein)\", \"u\": \"data_2071\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Sequence signature data||Sequence motif\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_0860||data_1353\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_2070\": {\"d\": \"A nucleotide sequence motif.\", \"n\": \"Sequence motif (nucleic acid)\", \"ns\": [\"DNA sequence motif\", \"RNA sequence motif\"], \"u\": \"data_2070\", \"es\": [\"Nucleic acid sequence motif\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Sequence signature data||Sequence motif||Sequence motif (nucleic acid)\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_0860||data_1353||data_2070\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_2071\": {\"d\": \"An amino acid sequence motif.\", \"n\": \"Sequence motif (protein)\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_2071\", \"es\": [\"Protein sequence motif\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Sequence signature data||Sequence motif||Sequence motif (protein)\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_0860||data_1353||data_2071\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_1354\": {\"d\": \"Some type of statistical model representing a (typically multiple) sequence alignment.\", \"n\": \"Sequence profile\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_1354\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Position-specific scoring matrix\", \"u\": \"data_2854\"}, {\"n\": \"Profile HMM\", \"u\": \"data_3949\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Sequence signature data||Sequence profile\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_0860||data_1354\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_2854\": {\"d\": \"A simple matrix of numbers, where each value (or column of values) is derived derived from analysis of the corresponding position in a sequence alignment.\", \"n\": \"Position-specific scoring matrix\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_2854\", \"es\": [\"PSSM\"], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Position frequency matrix\", \"u\": \"data_1361\"}, {\"n\": \"Position weight matrix\", \"u\": \"data_1362\"}, {\"n\": \"Information content matrix\", \"u\": \"data_1363\"}, {\"n\": \"Fingerprint\", \"u\": \"data_1365\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Sequence signature data||Sequence profile||Position-specific scoring matrix\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_0860||data_1354||data_2854\"}, {\"n\": \"Data||Matrix||Position-specific scoring matrix\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_2082||data_2854\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_1361\": {\"d\": \"A profile (typically representing a sequence alignment) that is a simple matrix of nucleotide (or amino acid) counts per position.\", \"n\": \"Position frequency matrix\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_1361\", \"es\": [\"PFM\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Sequence signature data||Sequence profile||Position-specific scoring matrix||Position frequency matrix\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_0860||data_1354||data_2854||data_1361\"}, {