ing matrix for scoring characters substitutions and penalties for gap insertion and extension.\", \"n\": \"Sequence similarity\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_1413\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Bit score\", \"u\": \"data_2335\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Score||Sequence similarity score||Sequence similarity\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_1772||data_0865||data_1413\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_2335\": {\"d\": \"A score derived from the alignment of two sequences, which is then normalised with respect to the scoring system.\", \"n\": \"Bit score\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_2335\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Score||Sequence similarity score||Sequence similarity||Bit score\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_1772||data_0865||data_1413||data_2335\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_0888\": {\"d\": \"A value representing molecular structure similarity, measured from structure alignment or some other type of structure comparison.\", \"n\": \"Structure similarity score\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_0888\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Root-mean-square deviation\", \"u\": \"data_1497\"}, {\"n\": \"Tanimoto similarity score\", \"u\": \"data_1498\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Score||Structure similarity score\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_1772||data_0888\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_1497\": {\"d\": \"Root-mean-square deviation (RMSD) is calculated to measure the average distance between superimposed macromolecular coordinates.\", \"n\": \"Root-mean-square deviation\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_1497\", \"es\": [\"RMSD\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Score||Structure similarity score||Root-mean-square deviation\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_1772||data_0888||data_1497\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_1498\": {\"d\": \"A measure of the similarity between two ligand fingerprints.\", \"n\": \"Tanimoto similarity score\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_1498\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Dat