pp and Woods plot\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_2884||data_2957\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_1542\": {\"d\": \"Data on the solvent accessible or buried surface area of a protein structure.\", \"n\": \"Protein solvent accessibility\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_1542\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Molecular property||Protein property||Protein solvent accessibility\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_2087||data_0897||data_1542\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_1545\": {\"d\": \"Data on the net charge distribution (dipole moment) of a protein structure.\", \"n\": \"Protein dipole moment\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_1545\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Molecular property||Protein property||Protein dipole moment\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_2087||data_0897||data_1545\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_2024\": {\"d\": \"Data concerning chemical reaction(s) catalysed by enzyme(s).\", \"n\": \"Enzyme kinetics data\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_2024\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Vmax\", \"u\": \"data_0909\"}, {\"n\": \"Km\", \"u\": \"data_0910\"}, {\"n\": \"Michaelis Menten plot\", \"u\": \"data_2025\"}, {\"n\": \"Hanes Woolf plot\", \"u\": \"data_2026\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Molecular property||Protein property||Enzyme kinetics data\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_2087||data_0897||data_2024\"}, {\"n\": \"Data||Reaction data||Enzyme kinetics data\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_2978||data_2024\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_0909\": {\"d\": \"The maximum initial velocity or rate of a reaction. It is the limiting velocity as substrate concentrations get very large.\", \"n\": \"Vmax\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_0909\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Molecular property||Protein property||Enzyme kinetics data||Vmax\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_2087||data_0897||data_2024||data_0909\"}, {\"n\": \"Data||Reaction data||Enzyme kinetics data||Vmax\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_297