uences and associated metadata that do not (typically) correspond to common sequence database records or database entries.\", \"n\": \"Sequence set (nucleic acid)\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_1234\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Sequence trace\", \"u\": \"data_0924\"}, {\"n\": \"Sequence assembly\", \"u\": \"data_0925\"}, {\"n\": \"Restriction digest\", \"u\": \"data_1239\"}, {\"n\": \"PCR primers\", \"u\": \"data_1240\"}, {\"n\": \"Sequence cluster (nucleic acid)\", \"u\": \"data_1246\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Sequence set||Sequence set (nucleic acid)\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_0850||data_1234\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_0924\": {\"d\": \"Fluorescence trace data generated by an automated DNA sequencer, which can be interprted as a molecular sequence (reads), given associated sequencing metadata such as base-call quality scores.\", \"n\": \"Sequence trace\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_0924\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Sequence set||Sequence set (nucleic acid)||Sequence trace\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_0850||data_1234||data_0924\"}, {\"n\": \"Data||Experimental measurement||Sequence trace\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_3108||data_0924\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_0925\": {\"d\": \"An assembly of fragments of a (typically genomic) DNA sequence.\", \"n\": \"Sequence assembly\", \"ns\": [\"SO:0001248\"], \"u\": \"data_0925\", \"es\": [\"Contigs\", \"SO:0000353\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Sequence set||Sequence set (nucleic acid)||Sequence assembly\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_0850||data_1234||data_0925\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_1239\": {\"d\": \"Restriction digest fragments from digesting a nucleotide sequence with restriction sites using a restriction endonuclease.\", \"n\": \"Restriction digest\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_1239\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Sequence set||Sequence set (nucleic acid)||Restriction digest\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_085