ov model representation of a set or alignment of sequences.\", \"n\": \"Hidden Markov model\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_1364\", \"es\": [\"HMM\"], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Profile HMM\", \"u\": \"data_3949\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Mathematical model||Hidden Markov model\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_0950||data_1364\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_1439\": {\"d\": \"A model of DNA substitution that explains a DNA sequence alignment, derived from phylogenetic tree analysis.\", \"n\": \"DNA substitution model\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_1439\", \"es\": [\"Phylogenetic tree report (DNA substitution model)\", \"Sequence alignment report (DNA substitution model)\", \"Substitution model\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Mathematical model||DNA substitution model\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_0950||data_1439\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_3241\": {\"d\": \"Mathematical model of a network, that contains biochemical kinetics.\", \"n\": \"Kinetic model\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_3241\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Mathematical model||Kinetic model\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_0950||data_3241\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_0955\": {\"d\": \"An index of data of biological relevance.\", \"n\": \"Data index\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_0955\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"Genome index\", \"u\": \"data_3210\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Data index\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_0955\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_3210\": {\"d\": \"An index of a genome sequence.\", \"n\": \"Genome index\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_3210\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Data||Data index||Genome index\", \"k\": \"data_0006||data_0955||data_3210\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_0968\": {\"d\": \"Keyword(s) or phrase(s) used (typically) for text-searching purposes.\", \"n\": \"Keyword\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_0968\", \"es\": [\"Phrases\", \"Term\"], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"UniProt keywor