essed NMR data. It is relying on SDF molecule data and allows to store assignments of NMR peaks to molecule features.  The NMR-extracted data (or \\\"NMReDATA\\\") includes: Chemical shift,scalar coupling, 2D correlation, assignment, etc.\", \"has_input\": [], \"has_output\": [], \"has_topic\": []}], \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Nuclear magnetic resonance spectroscopy data format\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [\"NMR peak assignment data\", \"NMR processed data format\", \"NMR raw data format\", \"Processed NMR data format\", \"Raw NMR data format\"], \"replaced_by\": [], \"consider\": [], \"definition\": \"Data format for raw data from a nuclear magnetic resonance (NMR) spectroscopy experiment.\", \"has_input\": [], \"has_output\": [], \"has_topic\": []}, {\"text\": \"Raw microarray data format\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3828\"}, \"children\": [{\"text\": \"GPR\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3829\"}, \"children\": [], \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"replaced_by\": [], \"consider\": [], \"definition\": \"GenePix Results (GPR) text file format developed by Axon Instruments that is used to save GenePix Results data.\", \"has_input\": [], \"has_output\": [], \"has_topic\": []}], \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Microarray data format\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"replaced_by\": [], \"consider\": [], \"definition\": \"Data format for raw microarray data.\", \"has_input\": [], \"has_output\": [], \"has_topic\": []}, {\"text\": \"NLP format\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3841\"}, \"children\": [{\"text\": \"NLP annotation format\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3862\"}, \"children\": [{\"text\": \"NLP corpus format\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3863\"}, \"children\": [], \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"replaced_by\": [], \"consider\": [], \"definition\": \"NLP format used by a specific type of corpus (collection of texts).\", \"h