ame\": \"GFF2-seq\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_1938\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"GFF feature file format with sequence in the header.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Sequence feature annotation format||Sequence feature table format||Sequence feature table format (text)||GFF||GFF2||GFF2-seq\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1920||format_2548||format_2206||format_2305||format_1974||format_1938\"}, \"name\": \"GFF2-seq\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_1938\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Generic Feature Format version 3 (GFF3) of sequence features.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Sequence feature annotation format||Sequence feature table format||Sequence feature table format (text)||GFF||GFF3\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1920||format_2548||format_2206||format_2305||format_1975\"}, \"name\": \"GFF3\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_1975\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"GFF3-seq\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_1939\"}, {\"name\": \"GVF\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3019\"}, {\"name\": \"mirGFF3\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3864\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"GFF3 feature file format with sequence.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Sequence feature annotation format||Sequence feature table format||Sequence feature table format (text)||GFF||GFF3||GFF3-seq\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1920||format_2548||format_2206||format_2305||format_1975||format_1939\"}, \"name\": \"GFF3-seq\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_1939\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Genome Variation Format (GVF). A GFF3-compatible format with defined header and attribute tags for sequence variation.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Format||Forma