rix Market matrix (MTX) format stores numerical or pattern matrices in a dense (array format) or sparse (coordinate format) representation.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Matrix format||MTX\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3033||format_3916\"}, \"name\": \"MTX\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3916\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Format of data concerning the classification of the sequences and/or structures of protein structural domain(s).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Protein domain classification format\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3097\"}], \"name\": \"Protein domain classification format\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3097\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Raw SCOP domain classification format\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3098\"}, {\"name\": \"Raw CATH domain classification format\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3099\"}, {\"name\": \"CATH domain report format\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3100\"}, {\"name\": \"InterProScan XML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3846\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"Format of raw SCOP domain classification data files.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Protein domain classification format||Raw SCOP domain classification format\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3097||format_3098\"}], \"name\": \"Raw SCOP domain classification format\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3098\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Format of raw CATH domain classification data files.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Protein domain classification format||Raw CATH domain classification format\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3097||format_3099\"}], \"na