rometry, initially developed for infrared spectrometry.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Mass spectrometry data format||JCAMP-DX\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3245||format_3859\"}, \"name\": \"JCAMP-DX\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3859\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Data format for a metadata on an individual and their genetic data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Individual genetic data format\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3287\"}], \"name\": \"Individual genetic data format\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3287\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"PED/MAP\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3288\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"The PED/MAP file describes data used by the Plink package.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Individual genetic data format||PED/MAP\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3287||format_3288\"}, \"name\": \"PED/MAP\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3288\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Plink PED/MAP\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"MAP\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3285\"}, {\"name\": \"PED\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3286\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"The MAP file describes SNPs and is used by the Plink package.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Individual genetic data format||PED/MAP||MAP\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3287||format_3288||format_3285\"}, \"name\": \"MAP\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3285\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Plink MAP\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The PED file describes individuals and genetic data and is used by the Plink package.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Individual genetic data format||