ytoband format\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_2078||format_3235\"}], \"name\": \"Cytoband format\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3235\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Tabular Molecular Interaction format (MITAB), standardised by HUPO PSI MI.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Textual format||PSI MI TAB (MITAB)\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2330||format_3242\"}, {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Protein interaction format||PSI MI TAB (MITAB)\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_2054||format_3242\"}], \"name\": \"PSI MI TAB (MITAB)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3242\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A human-readable encoding for the Web Ontology Language (OWL).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Textual format||OWL Functional Syntax\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2330||format_3252\"}, {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Ontology format||OWL format||OWL Functional Syntax\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_2195||format_2197||format_3252\"}, {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Ontology format||RDF format||OWL format||OWL Functional Syntax\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_2195||format_2376||format_2197||format_3252\"}, {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Linked data format||RDF format||OWL format||OWL Functional Syntax\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3748||format_2376||format_2197||format_3252\"}, {\"name\": \"Format||RDF format||OWL format||OWL Functional Syntax\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2376||format_2197||format_3252\"}], \"name\": \"OWL Functional Syntax\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3252\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A syntax for writing OWL class expressions.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Textual format||Manchester OWL Synta