ormat_3655\"}, {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Mass spectrometry data format||pepXML\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3245||format_3655\"}], \"name\": \"pepXML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3655\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Graphical Pathway Markup Language (GPML) is an XML format used for exchanging biological pathways.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||XML||GPML\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2332||format_3657\"}, {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Biological pathway or network format||GPML\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_2013||format_3657\"}], \"name\": \"GPML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3657\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"imzML metadata is a data format for mass spectrometry imaging metadata.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||XML||imzML metadata file\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2332||format_3682\"}, {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Mass spectrometry data format||imzML metadata file\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3245||format_3682\"}], \"name\": \"imzML metadata file\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3682\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"qcML is an XML format for quality-related data of mass spectrometry and other high-throughput measurements.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||XML||qcML\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2332||format_3683\"}, {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Experiment annotation format||qcML\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3167||format_3683\"}, {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Mass spectrometry data format||qcML\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3245||format_3683\"}], \"name\": \"qcML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3683\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\"