ns an electropherogram and the DNA base sequence.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Binary format||AB1\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2333||format_3000\"}, {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Sequence record format||Sequence trace format||AB1\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1919||format_2057||format_3000\"}], \"name\": \"AB1\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3000\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"bigBed format for large sequence annotation tracks, similar to textual BED format.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Binary format||bigBed\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2333||format_3004\"}, {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Sequence feature annotation format||Sequence annotation track format||bigBed\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1920||format_2919||format_3004\"}], \"name\": \"bigBed\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3004\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"bigWig format for large sequence annotation tracks that consist of a value for each sequence position. Similar to textual WIG format.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Binary format||bigWig\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2333||format_3006\"}, {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Sequence feature annotation format||Sequence annotation track format||bigWig\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1920||format_2919||format_3006\"}], \"name\": \"bigWig\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3006\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"2bit binary format of nucleotide sequences using 2 bits per nucleotide. In addition encodes unknown nucleotides and lower-case \'masking\'.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Binary format||2bit\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2333||format_3009\"}, {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Raw sequence format||2bit\", \