e Matrix Market matrix (MTX) format stores numerical or pattern matrices in a dense (array format) or sparse (coordinate format) representation.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Matrix format||MTX\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3033||format_3916\"}, \"name\": \"MTX\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3916\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Format of data concerning the classification of the sequences and/or structures of protein structural domain(s).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Protein domain classification format\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3097\"}], \"name\": \"Protein domain classification format\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3097\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Raw SCOP domain classification format\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3098\"}, {\"name\": \"Raw CATH domain classification format\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3099\"}, {\"name\": \"CATH domain report format\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3100\"}, {\"name\": \"InterProScan XML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3846\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"Format of raw SCOP domain classification data files.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Protein domain classification format||Raw SCOP domain classification format\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3097||format_3098\"}], \"name\": \"Raw SCOP domain classification format\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3098\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Format of raw CATH domain classification data files.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Protein domain classification format||Raw CATH domain classification format\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3097||format_3099\"}], \"name\": \"Raw CATH domain classification format\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3099\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Format of summary of domain classification information for a CATH domain.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Protein domain classification format||CATH domain report format\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3097||format_3100\"}], \"name\": \"CATH domain report format\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3100\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Output xml file from the InterProScan sequence analysis application.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Protein domain classification format||InterProScan XML\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3097||format_3846\"}, \"name\": \"InterProScan XML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3846\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Data format for a report of information derived from a biological pathway or network.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Biological pathway or network report format\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3166\"}], \"name\": \"Biological pathway or network report format\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3166\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"SBRML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3155\"}, {\"name\": \"CopasiML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3239\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"Systems Biology Result Markup Language (SBRML), the standard XML format for simulated or calculated results (e.g. trajectories) of systems biology models.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Biological pathway or network report format||SBRML\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3166||format_3155\"}, \"name\": \"SBRML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3155\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"CopasiML, the native format of COPASI.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Biological pathway or network report format||CopasiML\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3166||format_3239\"}, \"name\": \"CopasiML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3239\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Data format for annotation on a laboratory experiment.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Experiment annotation format\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3167\"}], \"name\": \"Experiment annotation format\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3167\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"Microarray experiment data format\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_2056\"}, {\"name\": \"GCDML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3163\"}, {\"name\": \"GelML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3249\"}, {\"name\": \"spML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3250\"}, {\"name\": \"qcML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3683\"}, {\"name\": \"PRIDE XML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3684\"}, {\"name\": \"SED-ML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3685\"}, {\"name\": \"COMBINE OMEX\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3686\"}, {\"name\": \"ISA-TAB\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3687\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"Format for information about a microarray experimental per se (not the data generated from that experiment).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Experiment annotation format||Microarray experiment data format\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3167||format_2056\"}], \"name\": \"Microarray experiment data format\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_2056\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"affymetrix-exp\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_1641\"}]}, {\"definition\": \"Affymetrix data file format for information about experimental conditions and protocols.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Experiment annotation format||Microarray experiment data format||affymetrix-exp\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3167||format_2056||format_1641\"}, \"name\": \"affymetrix-exp\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_1641\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Affymetrix experimental conditions data file format\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"GCDML XML format for genome and metagenome metadata according to MIGS/MIMS/MIMARKS information standards, standardised by the Genomic Standards Consortium (GSC).\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Experiment annotation format||GCDML\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3167||format_3163\"}, \"name\": \"GCDML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3163\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"GelML is the format for describing the process of gel electrophoresis, standardised by HUPO PSI PS.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Experiment annotation format||GelML\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3167||format_3249\"}, \"name\": \"GelML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3249\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"spML is the format for describing proteomics sample processing, other than using gels, prior to mass spectrometric protein identification, standardised by HUPO PSI PS. It may also be applicable for metabolomics.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Experiment annotation format||spML\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3167||format_3250\"}, \"name\": \"spML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3250\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"qcML is an XML format for quality-related data of mass spectrometry and other high-throughput measurements.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Experiment annotation format||qcML\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3167||format_3683\"}, \"name\": \"qcML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3683\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"PRIDE XML is an XML format for mass spectra, peptide and protein identifications, and metadata about a corresponding measurement, sample, experiment.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Experiment annotation format||PRIDE XML\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3167||format_3684\"}, \"name\": \"PRIDE XML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3684\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Simulation Experiment Description Markup Language (SED-ML) is an XML format for encoding simulation setups, according to the MIASE (Minimum Information About a Simulation Experiment) requirements.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Experiment annotation format||SED-ML\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3167||format_3685\"}, \"name\": \"SED-ML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3685\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Open Modeling EXchange format (OMEX) is a ZIPped format for encapsulating all information necessary for a modeling and simulation project in systems biology.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Experiment annotation format||COMBINE OMEX\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3167||format_3686\"}, \"name\": \"COMBINE OMEX\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3686\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The Investigation / Study / Assay (ISA) tab-delimited (TAB) format incorporates metadata from\\nexperiments employing a combination of technologies.\", \"path\": {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Experiment annotation format||ISA-TAB\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3167||format_3687\"}, \"name\": \"ISA-TAB\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3687\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Format for mass pectra and derived data, include peptide sequences etc.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Mass spectrometry data format\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3245\"}], \"name\": \"Mass spectrometry data format\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3245\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"mzML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3244\"}, {\"name\": \"TraML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3246\"}, {\"name\": \"mzIdentML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3247\"}, {\"name\": \"mzQuantML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3248\"}, {\"name\": \"netCDF\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3650\"}, {\"name\": \"MGF\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3651\"}, {\"name\": \"dta\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3652\"}, {\"name\": \"pkl\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3653\"}, {\"name\": \"mzXML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3654\"}, {\"name\": \"pepXML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3655\"}, {\"name\": \"mzTab\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3681\"}, {\"name\": \"imzML metadata file\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3682\"}, {\"name\": \"qcML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3683\"}, {\"name\": \"PRIDE XML\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3684\"}, {\"name\": \"MSF\", \"uri\"