hics Interchange Format.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Binary format||GIF\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2333||format_3467\"}], \"name\": \"GIF\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3467\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"format_3484\": {\"definition\": \"Bowtie format for indexed reference genome for \\\"small\\\" genomes.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Binary format||ebwt\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2333||format_3484\"}, {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Data index format||ebwt\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3326||format_3484\"}], \"name\": \"ebwt\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3484\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Bowtie index format\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"format_3491\": {\"definition\": \"Bowtie format for indexed reference genome for \\\"large\\\" genomes.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Binary format||ebwtl\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2333||format_3491\"}, {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Data index format||ebwtl\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3326||format_3491\"}], \"name\": \"ebwtl\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3491\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Bowtie long index format\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"format_3508\": {\"definition\": \"Portable Document Format\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Binary format||PDF\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2333||format_3508\"}, {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Document format||PDF\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3507||format_3508\"}], \"name\": \"PDF\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3508\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"format_3548\": {\"definition\": \"Medical image format corresponding to the Digital Imaging and Communications in Medicine (DICOM) standard.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Binary format||DICOM format\", \"key\": \"format_1915||fo