age to index TAB-delimited genome position files.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Binary format||Tabix index file format\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2333||format_3700\"}, {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Data index format||Tabix index file format\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3326||format_3700\"}], \"name\": \"Tabix index file format\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3700\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"format_3710\": {\"definition\": \"Mass spectrum file format from QSTAR and QTRAP instruments (ABI/Sciex).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Binary format||WIFF format\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2333||format_3710\"}, {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Mass spectrometry data format||WIFF format\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3245||format_3710\"}], \"name\": \"WIFF format\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3710\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"wiff\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"format_3712\": {\"definition\": \"Proprietary file format for mass spectrometry data from Thermo Scientific.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Binary format||Thermo RAW\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2333||format_3712\"}, {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Mass spectrometry data format||Thermo RAW\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3245||format_3712\"}], \"name\": \"Thermo RAW\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3712\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"format_3727\": {\"definition\": \"Image file format used by the Open Microscopy Environment (OME).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Binary format||OME-TIFF\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2333||format_3727\"}, {\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Image format||OME-TIFF\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3547||format_3727\"}], \"name\": \"OME-TIFF\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3727\", \"e