 syntax for rapidly generating visualizations to support analysis. Vega-Lite specifications can be compiled to Vega specifications.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Image format||Vega-lite\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3547||format_3970\"}, {\"name\": \"Format||JSON||Vega-lite\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_3464||format_3970\"}, {\"name\": \"Format||YAML||JSON||Vega-lite\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_3750||format_3464||format_3970\"}], \"name\": \"Vega-lite\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3970\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"format_3606\": {\"definition\": \"Textual report format for sequence quality for reports from sequencing machines.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Sequence quality report format (text)\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3606\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence quality report format (text)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3606\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"qual\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3607\"}]}, \"format_3617\": {\"definition\": \"Data format for graph data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Graph format\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3617\"}], \"name\": \"Graph format\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3617\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": [{\"name\": \"xgmml\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3618\"}, {\"name\": \"K-mer countgraph\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3665\"}]}, \"format_3618\": {\"definition\": \"XML-based format used to store graph descriptions within Galaxy.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Graph format||xgmml\", \"key\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3617||format_3618\"}], \"name\": \"xgmml\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/format_3618\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow