": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"An XML format resembling EMBL entry format.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"SBML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_2585\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Systems Biology Markup Language (SBML), the standard XML format for models of biological processes such as for example metabolism, cell signaling, and gene regulation.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"SBRML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3155\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Systems Biology Result Markup Language (SBRML), the standard XML format for simulated or calculated results (e.g. trajectories) of systems biology models.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"EBI Application Result XML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3157\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"EBI Application Result XML is a format returned by sequence similarity search Web services at EBI.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"PSI MI XML (MIF)\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3158\"}, \"ch\": [{\"t\": \"PSI-PAR\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3243\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Protein affinity format (PSI-PAR), standardised by HUPO PSI MI. It is compatible with PSI MI XML (MIF) and uses the same XML Schema.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}], \"es\": [\"MIF\"], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"XML Molecular Interaction Format (MIF), standardised by HUPO PSI MI.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"phyloXML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3159\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"phyloXML is a standardised XML format for phylogenetic trees, networks, and associated data.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"NeXML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3160\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"NeXML is a standardised XML format for rich phyloinformatic data.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"MAGE-ML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3161\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"MAGE-ML XML format for microarray expression data, standardised by MGED (now FGED).\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"GCDML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3163\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"GCDML XML format for genome and metagenome metadata according to MIGS/MIMS/MIMARKS information standards, standardised by the Genomic Standards Consortium (GSC).\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"CopasiML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3239\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"CopasiML, the native format of COPASI.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"CellML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3240\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"CellML, the format for mathematical models of biological and other networks.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"mzML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3244\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"mzML format for raw spectrometer output data, standardised by HUPO PSI MSS.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"TraML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3246\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"TraML (Transition Markup Language) is the format for mass spectrometry transitions, standardised by HUPO PSI MSS.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"mzIdentML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3247\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"mzIdentML is the exchange format for peptides and proteins identified from mass spectra, standardised by HUPO PSI PI. It can be used for outputs of proteomics search engines.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"mzQuantML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3248\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"mzQuantML is the format for quantitation values associated with peptides, proteins and small molecules from mass spectra, standardised by HUPO PSI PI. It can be used for outputs of quantitation software for proteomics.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"GelML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3249\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"GelML is the format for describing the process of gel electrophoresis, standardised by HUPO PSI PS.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"spML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3250\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"spML is the format for describing proteomics sample processing, other than using gels, prior to mass spectrometric protein identification, standardised by HUPO PSI PS. It may also be applicable for metabolomics.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"RDF/XML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3261\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Resource Description Framework (RDF) XML format.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"OWL/XML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3262\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [\"OWL\"], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"OWL ontology XML serialisation format.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"RNAML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3311\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"RNA Markup Language.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"BLAST XML results format\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3331\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"XML format as produced by the NCBI Blast package\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"xls\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3468\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [\"Microsoft Excel format\"], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Microsoft Excel spreadsheet format.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"BSML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3487\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Bioinformatics Sequence Markup Language format.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"docx\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3506\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [\"Microsoft Word format\", \"doc\"], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Microsoft Word format.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"SVG\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3604\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [\"Scalable Vector Graphics\"], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Scalable Vector Graphics (SVG) is an XML-based vector image format for two-dimensional graphics with support for interactivity and animation.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"pepXML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3655\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Open data format for the storage, exchange, and processing of peptide sequence assignments of MS/MS scans, intended to provide a common data output format for many different MS/MS search engines and subsequent peptide-level analyses.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"GPML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3657\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Graphical Pathway Markup Language (GPML) is an XML format used for exchanging biological pathways.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"imzML metadata file\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3682\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"imzML metadata is a data format for mass spectrometry imaging metadata.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"qcML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3683\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"qcML is an XML format