 standardised by the Genomic Standards Consortium (GSC).\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"GelML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3249\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"GelML is the format for describing the process of gel electrophoresis, standardised by HUPO PSI PS.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"spML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3250\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"spML is the format for describing proteomics sample processing, other than using gels, prior to mass spectrometric protein identification, standardised by HUPO PSI PS. It may also be applicable for metabolomics.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"qcML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3683\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"qcML is an XML format for quality-related data of mass spectrometry and other high-throughput measurements.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"PRIDE XML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3684\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"PRIDE XML is an XML format for mass spectra, peptide and protein identifications, and metadata about a corresponding measurement, sample, experiment.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"SED-ML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3685\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Simulation Experiment Description Markup Language (SED-ML) is an XML format for encoding simulation setups, according to the MIASE (Minimum Information About a Simulation Experiment) requirements.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"COMBINE OMEX\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3686\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Open Modeling EXchange format (OMEX) is a ZIPped format for encapsulating all information necessary for a modeling and simulation project in systems biology.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"ISA-TAB\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3687\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"The Investigation / Study / Assay (ISA) tab-delimited (TAB) format incorporates metadata from\\nexperiments employing a combination of technologies.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Data format for annotation on a laboratory experiment.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"Mass spectrometry data format\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3245\"}, \"ch\": [{\"t\": \"mzML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3244\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"mzML format for raw spectrometer output data, standardised by HUPO PSI MSS.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"TraML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3246\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"TraML (Transition Markup Language) is the format for mass spectrometry transitions, standardised by HUPO PSI MSS.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"mzIdentML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3247\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"mzIdentML is the exchange format for peptides and proteins identified from mass spectra, standardised by HUPO PSI PI. It can be used for outputs of proteomics search engines.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"mzQuantML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3248\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"mzQuantML is the format for quantitation values associated with peptides, proteins and small molecules from mass spectra, standardised by HUPO PSI PI. It can be used for outputs of quantitation software for proteomics.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"netCDF\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3650\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [\"ANDI-MS\"], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Format used by netCDF software  library for writing and reading chromatography-MS data files.  Also used to store trajectory atom coordinates information, such as the ones obtained by Molecular Dynamics simulations.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"MGF\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3651\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Mascot Generic Format.  Encodes multiple MS/MS spectra in a single file.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"dta\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3652\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Spectral data format file where each spectrum is written to a separate file.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"pkl\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3653\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Spectral data file similar to dta.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"mzXML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3654\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Common file format for proteomics mass spectrometric data developed at the Seattle Proteome Center/Institute for Systems Biology.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"pepXML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3655\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Open data format for the storage, exchange, and processing of peptide sequence assignments of MS/MS scans, intended to provide a common data output format for many different MS/MS search engines and subsequent peptide-level analyses.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"mzTab\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3681\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"mzTab is a tab-delimited format for mass spectrometry-based proteomics and metabolomics results.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"imzML metadata file\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3682\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"imzML metadata is a data format for mass spectrometry imaging metadata.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"qcML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3683\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"qcML is an XML format for quality-related data of mass spectrometry and other high-throughput measurements.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"PRIDE XML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3684\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"PRIDE XML is an XML format for mass spectra, peptide and protein identifications, and metadata about a corresponding measurement, sample, experiment.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"MSF\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3702\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [\"Magellan storage file format\"], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Proprietary mass-spectrometry format of Thermo Scientific\'s ProteomeDiscoverer software.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"WIFF format\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3710\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [\"wiff\"], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Mass spectrum file format from QSTAR and QTRAP instruments (ABI/Sciex).\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"X!Tandem XML\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3711\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Output format used by X! series search engines that is based on the XML language BIOML.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"Thermo RAW\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3712\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Proprietary file format for mass spectrometry data from Thermo Scientific.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"Mascot .dat file\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3713\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"\\\"Raw\\\" result file from Mascot database search.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\"