pported by the UCSC Genome Browser.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"axt\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3013\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"axt format of alignments, typically produced from BLASTZ.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"LAV\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3014\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"LAV format of alignments generated by BLASTZ and LASTZ.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"Pileup\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3015\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Pileup format of alignment of sequences (e.g. sequencing reads) to (a) reference sequence(s). Contains aligned bases per base of the reference sequence(s).\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"VCF\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3016\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Variant Call Format (VCF) for sequence variation (indels, polymorphisms, structural variation).\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"GTrack\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3164\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [\"BioXSD/GTrack GTrack\", \"BioXSD|GTrack GTrack\", \"GTrack format\", \"GTrack|BTrack|GSuite GTrack\", \"GTrack|GSuite|BTrack GTrack\"], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"GTrack is a generic and optimised tabular format for genome or sequence feature tracks. GTrack unifies the power of other track formats (e.g. GFF3, BED, WIG), and while optimised in size, adds more flexibility, customisation, and automation (\\\"machine understandability\\\").\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"Cytoband format\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3235\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\": [], \"rb\": [], \"co\": [], \"d\": \"Cytoband format for chromosome cytobands.\", \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, {\"t\": \"PSI MI TAB (MITAB)\", \"data\": {\"uri\": \"format_3242\"}, \"ch\": [], \"es\": [], \"ns\":