type of data)||Alignment format||Alignment format (text)||Phylip format variant||Relaxed PHYLIP Interleaved\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1921||format_2554||format_2924||format_3819\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Phylip multiple alignment sequence format, less stringent than PHYLIP sequential format (format_1998).\", \"n\": \"Relaxed PHYLIP Sequential\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3820\", \"es\": [\"Relaxed PHYLIP non-interleaved\", \"Relaxed PHYLIP non-interleaved format\", \"Relaxed PHYLIP sequential format\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Textual format||Phylip format variant||Relaxed PHYLIP Sequential\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2330||format_2924||format_3820\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Sequence record format||Sequence record format (text)||Phylip format variant||Relaxed PHYLIP Sequential\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1919||format_2551||format_2924||format_3820\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Alignment format||Alignment format (text)||Phylip format variant||Relaxed PHYLIP Sequential\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1921||format_2554||format_2924||format_3820\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"ACE sequence assembly format including contigs, base-call qualities, and other metadata (version Aug 1998 and onwards).\", \"n\": \"ACE\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3001\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Textual format||ACE\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2330||format_3001\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Sequence assembly format||ACE\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_2055||format_3001\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Browser Extensible Data (BED) format of sequence annotation track, typically to be displayed in a genome browser.\", \"n\": \"BED\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3003\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"bedstrict\", \"u\": \"format_3584\"}, {\"n\": \"chrominfo\", \"u\": \"format_3587\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Textual format||BED\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2330||format_3003\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Sequence feature annotation format||Sequence annotation track format||BED\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1920||format_2919||format_3003\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Browser Extensible Data (BED) format of sequence annotation track that strictly does not contain non-standard fields beyond the first 3 columns.\", \"n\": \"bedstrict\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3584\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"bed6\", \"u\": \"format_3585\"}, {\"n\": \"bed12\", \"u\": \"format_3586\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Textual format||BED||bedstrict\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2330||format_3003||format_3584\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Sequence feature annotation format||Sequence annotation track format||BED||bedstrict\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1920||format_2919||format_3003||format_3584\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"BED file format where each feature is described by chromosome, start, end, name, score, and strand.\", \"n\": \"bed6\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3585\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"ENCODE peak format\", \"u\": \"format_3612\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Textual format||BED||bedstrict||bed6\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2330||format_3003||format_3584||format_3585\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Sequence feature annotation format||Sequence annotation track format||BED||bedstrict||bed6\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1920||format_2919||format_3003||format_3584||format_3585\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Human ENCODE peak format.\", \"n\": \"ENCODE peak format\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3612\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"ENCODE narrow peak format\", \"u\": \"format_3613\"}, {\"n\": \"ENCODE broad peak format\", \"u\