ribed by all twelve columns.\", \"n\": \"bed12\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3586\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Textual format||BED||bedstrict||bed12\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2330||format_3003||format_3584||format_3586\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Sequence feature annotation format||Sequence annotation track format||BED||bedstrict||bed12\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1920||format_2919||format_3003||format_3584||format_3586\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Tabular format of chromosome names and sizes used by Galaxy.\", \"n\": \"chrominfo\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3587\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Textual format||BED||chrominfo\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2330||format_3003||format_3587\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||Textual format||chrominfo\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2330||format_3587\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Sequence feature annotation format||Sequence annotation track format||BED||chrominfo\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1920||format_2919||format_3003||format_3587\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Wiggle format (WIG) of a sequence annotation track that consists of a value for each sequence position. Typically to be displayed in a genome browser.\", \"n\": \"WIG\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3005\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Textual format||WIG\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2330||format_3005\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Sequence feature annotation format||Sequence annotation track format||WIG\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1920||format_2919||format_3005\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"PSL format of alignments, typically generated by BLAT or psLayout. Can be displayed in a genome browser like a sequence annotation track.\", \"n\": \"PSL\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3007\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Textual format||PSL\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2330||format_3007\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Sequence feature annotation format||Sequence annotation track format||PSL\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1920||format_2919||format_3007\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Alignment format||Alignment format (pair only)||PSL\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1921||format_2920||format_3007\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Multiple Alignment Format (MAF) supporting alignments of whole genomes with rearrangements, directions, multiple pieces to the alignment, and so forth.\", \"n\": \"MAF\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3008\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Textual format||MAF\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2330||format_3008\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Sequence feature annotation format||Sequence annotation track format||MAF\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1920||format_2919||format_3008\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Alignment format||Alignment format (text)||MAF\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1921||format_2554||format_3008\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"genePred table format for gene prediction tracks.\", \"n\": \"genePred\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3011\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Textual format||genePred\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2330||format_3011\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Sequence feature annotation format||Sequence annotation track format||genePred\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1920||format_2919||format_3011\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Personal Genome SNP (pgSnp) format for sequence variation tracks (indels and polymorphisms), supported by the UCSC Genome Browser.\", \"n\": \"pgSnp\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3012\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \