920||format_2919||format_3008\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Alignment format||Alignment format (text)||MAF\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1921||format_2554||format_3008\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"format_3011\": {\"d\": \"genePred table format for gene prediction tracks.\", \"n\": \"genePred\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3011\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Textual format||genePred\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2330||format_3011\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Sequence feature annotation format||Sequence annotation track format||genePred\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1920||format_2919||format_3011\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"format_3012\": {\"d\": \"Personal Genome SNP (pgSnp) format for sequence variation tracks (indels and polymorphisms), supported by the UCSC Genome Browser.\", \"n\": \"pgSnp\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3012\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Textual format||pgSnp\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2330||format_3012\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Sequence feature annotation format||Sequence annotation track format||pgSnp\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1920||format_2919||format_3012\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"format_3013\": {\"d\": \"axt format of alignments, typically produced from BLASTZ.\", \"n\": \"axt\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3013\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Textual format||axt\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2330||format_3013\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Alignment format||Alignment format (pair only)||axt\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1921||format_2920||format_3013\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"format_3014\": {\"d\": \"LAV format of alignments generated by BLASTZ and LASTZ.\", \"n\": \"LAV\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3014\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Textual format||LAV\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2330||format_3014\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Alignment format||Alignment format (pair only)||LAV\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1921||format_2920||format_3014\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"format_3015\": {\"d\": \"Pileup format of alignment of sequences (e.g. sequencing reads) to (a) reference sequence(s). Contains aligned bases per base of the reference sequence(s).\", \"n\": \"Pileup\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3015\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Textual format||Pileup\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2330||format_3015\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Alignment format||Alignment format (pair only)||Pileup\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_1921||format_2920||format_3015\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"format_3016\": {\"d\": \"Variant Call Format (VCF) for sequence variation (indels, polymorphisms, structural variation).\", \"n\": \"VCF\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3016\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Textual format||VCF\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2330||format_3016\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Sequence variation annotation format||VCF\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_2921||format_3016\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"format_3164\": {\"d\": \"GTrack is a generic and optimised tabular format for genome or sequence feature tracks. GTrack unifies the power of other track formats (e.g. GFF3, BED, WIG), and while optimised in size, adds more flexibility, customisation, and automation (\\\"machine understandability\\\").\", \"n\": \"GTrack\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3164\", \"es\": [\"BioXSD/GTrack GTrack\", \"BioXSD|GTrack GTrack\", \"GTrack format\", \"GTrack|BTrack|GSuite GTrack\", \"GTrack|GSuite|BTrack GTrack\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Textual format||GTrack\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2330||format_3164\"}, {\"n\": \"Form