ization designs. With Vega, you can describe the visual appearance and interactive behavior of a visualization in a JSON format, and generate web-based views using Canvas or SVG.\", \"n\": \"Vega\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3969\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Image format||Vega\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3547||format_3969\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||JSON||Vega\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_3464||format_3969\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||YAML||JSON||Vega\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_3750||format_3464||format_3969\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"format_3970\": {\"d\": \"Vega-Lite is a high-level grammar of interactive graphics. It provides a concise JSON syntax for rapidly generating visualizations to support analysis. Vega-Lite specifications can be compiled to Vega specifications.\", \"n\": \"Vega-lite\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3970\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Image format||Vega-lite\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3547||format_3970\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||JSON||Vega-lite\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_3464||format_3970\"}, {\"n\": \"Format||YAML||JSON||Vega-lite\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_3750||format_3464||format_3970\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"format_3606\": {\"d\": \"Textual report format for sequence quality for reports from sequencing machines.\", \"n\": \"Sequence quality report format (text)\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3606\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"qual\", \"u\": \"format_3607\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Sequence quality report format (text)\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3606\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"format_3617\": {\"d\": \"Data format for graph data.\", \"n\": \"Graph format\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3617\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"xgmml\", \"u\": \"format_3618\"}, {\"n\": \"K-mer countgraph\", \"u\": \"format_3665\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Graph format\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3617\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"format_3618\": {\"d\": \"XML-based format used to store graph descriptions within Galaxy.\", \"n\": \"xgmml\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3618\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Graph format||xgmml\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3617||format_3618\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"format_3706\": {\"d\": \"Data format for biodiversity data.\", \"n\": \"Biodiversity data format\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3706\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"ABCD format\", \"u\": \"format_3708\"}, {\"n\": \"BIOM format\", \"u\": \"format_3746\"}, {\"n\": \"MCPD\", \"u\": \"format_3777\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Biodiversity data format\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3706\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"format_3708\": {\"d\": \"Exchange format of the Access to Biological Collections Data (ABCD) Schema; a standard for the access to and exchange of data about specimens and observations (primary biodiversity data).\", \"n\": \"ABCD format\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3708\", \"es\": [\"ABCD\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Biodiversity data format||ABCD format\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3706||format_3708\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"format_3748\": {\"d\": \"A linked data format enables publishing structured data as linked data (Linked Data), so that the data can be interlinked and become more useful through semantic queries.\", \"n\": \"Linked data format\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"format_3748\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [{\"n\": \"RDF format\", \"u\": \"format_2376\"}, {\"n\": \"JSON-LD\", \"u\": \"format_3749\"}], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Format||Format (by type of data)||Linked data format\", \"k\": \"format_1915||format_2350||format_3748\"