hisms.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||DNA variation\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0918\"}], \"name\": \"DNA variation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0918\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"PCR experiments, e.g. quantitative real-time PCR.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||PCR experiment report\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0923\"}], \"name\": \"PCR experiment report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0923\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"microarray experiments including conditions, protocol, sample:data relationships etc.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Microarray experiment report\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0931\"}], \"name\": \"Microarray experiment report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0931\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Data on oligonucleotide probes (typically for use with DNA microarrays).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Oligonucleotide probe data\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0932\"}], \"name\": \"Oligonucleotide probe data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0932\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Output from a serial analysis of gene expression (SAGE) experiment.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||SAGE experimental data\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0933\"}], \"name\": \"SAGE experimental data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0933\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Massively parallel signature sequencing (MPSS) data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||MPSS experimental data\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#de