\": \"Controlled vocabulary from National Library of Medicine. The MeSH thesaurus is used to index articles in biomedical journals for the Medline/PubMED databases.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||MeSH vocabulary\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0831\"}], \"name\": \"MeSH vocabulary\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0831\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Controlled vocabulary for gene names (symbols) from HUGO Gene Nomenclature Committee.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||HGNC vocabulary\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0832\"}], \"name\": \"HGNC vocabulary\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0832\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Compendium of controlled vocabularies for the biomedical domain (Unified Medical Language System).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||UMLS vocabulary\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0835\"}], \"name\": \"UMLS vocabulary\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0835\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"An entry (retrievable via URL) from a biological database.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Database entry\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0843\"}], \"name\": \"Database entry\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0843\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A raw molecular sequence (string of characters) which might include ambiguity, unknown positions and non-sequence characters.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Raw sequence\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0848\"}], \"name\": \"Raw sequence\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0848\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A character used to replace (mask) other characters in a molecular sequence.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence mask character\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0851\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence mask character\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0851\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A label (text token) describing the type of sequence masking to perform.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence mask type\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0852\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence mask type\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0852\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The strand of a DNA sequence (forward or reverse).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||DNA sense specification\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0853\"}], \"name\": \"DNA sense specification\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0853\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A specification of sequence length(s).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence length specification\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0854\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence length specification\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0854\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Basic or general information concerning molecular sequences.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence metadata\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0855\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence metadata\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0855\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Data files used by motif or profile methods.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence signature model\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0859\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence signature model\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0859\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Alignment of exact matches between subsequences (words) within two or more molecular sequences.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence alignment (words)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0861\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence alignment (words)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0861\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Sequence word alignment\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Some simple value controlling a sequence alignment (or similar \'match\') operation.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence alignment parameter\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0864\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence alignment parameter\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0864\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Report of general information on a sequence alignment, typically include a description, sequence identifiers and alignment score.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence alignment metadata\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0866\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence alignment metadata\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0866\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A profile-profile alignment (each profile typically representing a sequence alignment).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Profile-profile alignment\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0868\"}], \"name\": \"Profile-profile alignment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0868\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Alignment of one or more molecular sequence(s) to one or more sequence profile(s) (each profile typically representing a sequence alignment).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence-profile alignment\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0869\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence-profile alignment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0869\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Predicted or actual protein topology represented as a string of protein secondary structure elements.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Protein topology\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0875\"}], \"name\": \"Protein topology\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0875\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Secondary structure (predicted or real) of a protein.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Protein features report (secondary structure)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0876\"}], \"name\": \"Protein features report (secondary structure)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0876\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Super-secondary structure of protein sequence(s).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Protein features report (super-secondary)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0877\"}], \"name\": \"Protein features report (super-secondary)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0877\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"An informative report on protein secondary structure alignment-derived data or metadata.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Secondary structure alignment metadata (protein)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0879\"}], \"name\": \"Secondary structure alignment metadata (protein)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0879\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"An informative report of RNA secondary structure alignment-derived data or metadata.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Secondary structure alignment metadata (RNA)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0882\"}], \"name\": \"Secondary structure alignment metadata (RNA)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0882\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"An entry from a molecular tertiary (3D) structure database.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Tertiary structure record\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0884\"}], \"name\": \"Tertiary structure record\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0884\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Results (hits) from searching a database of tertiary structure.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Structure database search results\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0885\"}], \"name\": \"Structure database search results\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0885\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"An alignment of a sequence to a 3D profile (representing structures or a structure alignment).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence-3D profile alignment\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0891\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence-3D profile alignment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0891\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Sequence-structural profile alignment\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"An informative report about a specific amino acid.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Amino acid annotation\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0894\"}], \"name\": \"Amino acid annotation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0894\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"An informative report about a specific peptide.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Peptide annotation\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0895\"}], \"name\": \"Peptide annotation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0895\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"3D structural motifs in a protein.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Protein structural motifs and surfaces\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0899\"}], \"name\": \"Protein structural motifs and surfaces\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0899\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Data concerning the classification of the sequences and/or structures of protein structural domain(s).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Protein domain classification\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0900\"}], \"name\": \"Protein domain classification\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0900\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"structural domains or 3D folds in a protein or polypeptide chain.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Protein features report (domains)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0901\"}], \"name\": \"Protein features report (domains)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0901\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"An informative report on architecture (spatial arrangement of secondary structure) of a protein structure.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Protein architecture report\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0902\"}], \"name\": \"Protein architecture report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0902\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A report on an analysis or model of protein folding properties, folding pathways, residues or sites that are key to protein folding, nucleation or stabilisation centers etc.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Protein folding report\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0903\"}], \"name\": \"Protein folding report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0903\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Data on the effect of (typically point) mutation on protein folding, stability, structure and function.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Protein features (mutation)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0904\"}], \"name\": \"Protein features (mutation)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0904\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"An informative report about a specific nucleotide base.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Nucleotide base annotation\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0911\"}], \"name\": \"Nucleotide base annotation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0911\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A report on the classification of nucleic acid / gene sequences according to the functional classification of their gene products.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Gene classification\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0917\"}], \"name\": \"Gene classification\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0917\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"stable, naturally occuring mutations in a nucleotide sequence including alleles, naturally occurring mutations such as single base nucleotide substitutions, deletions and insertions, RFLPs and other polymorphisms.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||DNA variation\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0918\"}], \"name\": \"DNA variation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0918\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"PCR experiments, e.g. quantitative real-time PCR.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||PCR experiment report\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0923\"}], \"name\": \"PCR experiment report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0923\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"microarray experiments including conditions, protocol, sample:data relationships etc.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Microarray experiment report\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0931\"}], \"name\": \"Microarray experiment report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0931\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Data on oligonucleotide probes (typically for use with DNA microarrays).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Oligonucleotide probe data\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0932\"}], \"name\": \"Oligonucleotide probe data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0932\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Output from a serial analysis of gene expression (SAGE) experiment.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||SAGE experimental data\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0933\"}], \"name\": \"SAGE experimental data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0933\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Massively parallel signature sequencing (MPSS) data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||MPSS experimental data\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/o