e.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Search parameter\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_2079\"}], \"name\": \"Search parameter\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2079\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The secondary structure assignment (predicted or real) of a nucleic acid or protein.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Secondary structure\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_2081\"}], \"name\": \"Secondary structure\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2081\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Data concerning, extracted from, or derived from the analysis of molecular alignment of some type.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Alignment data\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_2083\"}], \"name\": \"Alignment data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2083\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"A report on nucleic acid structure-derived data, describing structural properties of a DNA molecule, or any other annotation or information about specific nucleic acid 3D structure(s).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Nucleic acid structure data\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_2086\"}], \"name\": \"Nucleic acid structure data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2086\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Information on a database (or ontology) entry version, such as name (or other identifier) or parent database, unique identifier of entry, data, author and so on.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Database entry version information\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_2090\"}], \"name\": \"Database entry version information\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2090\"