owl#deprecatedclass||operation_2941\"}], \"name\": \"Whole microarray graph plotting\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_2941\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Process or analyse an alignment of molecular sequences or structures.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Alignment analysis\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_2946\"}], \"name\": \"Alignment analysis\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_2946\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Analyse a body of scientific text (typically a full text article from a scientific journal.)\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Article analysis\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_2947\"}], \"name\": \"Article analysis\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_2947\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Analyse the interactions of two or more molecules (or parts of molecules) that are known to interact.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Molecular interaction analysis\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_2948\"}], \"name\": \"Molecular interaction analysis\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_2948\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Process (read and / or write) an alignment of two or more molecular sequences, structures or derived data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Alignment processing\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_2951\"}], \"name\": \"Alignment processing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_2951\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Process (read and / or write) a molecular tertiary (3D) structure alignment.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Structure alignment processing\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_2952\"}], \"name\": \"Structure alignment processing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_2952\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Generate a codon usage bias plot.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Codon usage bias plotting\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_2963\"}], \"name\": \"Codon usage bias plotting\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_2963\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Process (read and / or write) molecular interaction data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Molecular interaction data processing\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_2993\"}], \"name\": \"Molecular interaction data processing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_2993\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Predict, recognise, detect or identify some properties of proteins.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Prediction and recognition (protein)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3023\"}], \"name\": \"Prediction and recognition (protein)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3023\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Predict, recognise, detect or identify some properties of nucleic acids.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Prediction and recognition (nucleic acid)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3024\"}], \"name\": \"Prediction and recognition (nucleic acid)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3024\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Render (visualise) a biological pathway or network.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Pathway or network visualisation\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3083\"}], \"name\": \"Pathway or network visualisation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3083\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Predict general (non-positional) functional properties of a protein from analysing its sequence.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Protein function prediction (from sequence)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3084\"}], \"name\": \"Protein function prediction (from sequence)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3084\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Predict, recognise and identify functional or other key sites within protein sequences, typically by scanning for known motifs, patterns and regular expressions.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Protein sequence feature detection\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3087\"}], \"name\": \"Protein sequence feature detection\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3087\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Calculate (or predict) physical or chemical properties of a protein, including any non-positional properties of the molecular sequence, from processing a protein sequence.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Protein property calculation (from sequence)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3088\"}], \"name\": \"Protein property calculation (from sequence)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3088\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Predict, recognise and identify positional features in proteins from analysing protein structure.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Protein feature prediction (from structure)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3090\"}], \"name\": \"Protein feature prediction (from structure)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3090\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Screen a molecular sequence(s) against a database (of some type) to identify similarities between the sequence and database entries.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Database search (by sequence)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3093\"}], \"name\": \"Database search (by sequence)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3093\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Trim sequences (typically from an automated DNA sequencer) to remove misleading ends.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Trim ends\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3189\"}], \"name\": \"Trim ends\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3189\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Trim sequences (typically from an automated DNA sequencer) to remove sequence-specific end regions, typically contamination from vector sequences.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Trim vector\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3190\"}], \"name\": \"Trim vector\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3190\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Trim sequences (typically from an automated DNA sequencer) to remove the sequence ends that extend beyond an assembled reference sequence.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Trim to reference\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3191\"}], \"name\": \"Trim to reference\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3191\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Identify single nucleotide change in base positions in sequencing data that differ from a reference genome and which might, especially by reference to population frequency or functional data, indicate a polymorphism.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||SNP calling\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3201\"}], \"name\": \"SNP calling\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3201\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Detect mutations in multiple DNA sequences, for example, from the alignment and comparison of the fluorescent traces produced by DNA sequencing hardware.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Polymorphism detection\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3202\"}], \"name\": \"Polymorphism detection\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3202\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Determine cytosine methylation status of specific positions in a nucleic acid sequences.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Methylation calling\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3205\"}], \"name\": \"Methylation calling\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3205\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Generate an index of a genome sequence using the Burrows-Wheeler algorithm.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Genome indexing (Burrows-Wheeler)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3212\"}], \"name\": \"Genome indexing (Burrows-Wheeler)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3212\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Generate an index of a genome sequence using a suffix arrays algorithm.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Genome indexing (suffix arrays)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3213\"}], \"name\": \"Genome indexing (suffix arrays)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3213\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Analyse gene expression patterns (typically from DNA microarray datasets) to identify sets of genes that are associated with a specific trait, condition, clinical outcome etc.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Gene set testing\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3224\"}], \"name\": \"Gene set testing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3224\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Infer a transcriptome sequence without the aid of a reference genome, i.e. by comparing short sequences (reads) to each other.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Transcriptome assembly (de novo)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3259\"}], \"name\": \"Transcriptome assembly (de novo)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3259\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"de novo transcriptome assembly\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Infer a transcriptome sequence by mapping short reads to a reference genome.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Transcriptome assembly (mapping)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3260\"}], \"name\": \"Transcriptome assembly (mapping)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3260\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Search for and retrieve a data identifier of some kind, e.g. a database entry accession.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||ID retrieval\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3289\"}], \"name\": \"ID retrieval\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3289\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Compare two or more ontologies, e.g. identify differences.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Ontology comparison\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3353\"}], \"name\": \"Ontology comparison\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3353\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Predict, recognise and identify functional or other key sites within nucleic acid sequences, typically by scanning for known motifs, patterns and regular expressions.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Nucleic acid sequence feature detection\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3430\"}], \"name\": \"Nucleic acid sequence feature detection\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3430\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Construct some entity (typically a molecule sequence) from component pieces.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Assembly\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3433\"}], \"name\": \"Assembly\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3433\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Predict a molecular pathway or network.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Pathway or network prediction\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3439\"}], \"name\": \"Pathway or network prediction\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3439\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"The process of assembling many short DNA sequences together such thay they represent the original chromosomes from which the DNA originated.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Genome assembly\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3440\"}], \"name\": \"Genome assembly\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3440\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Generate a graph, or other visual representation, of data, showing the relationship between two or more variables.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Plotting\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3441\"}], \"name\": \"Plotting\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3441\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Predict RNA secondary structure by analysis, e.g. probabilistic analysis, of the shape of RNA folds.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||RNA secondary structure prediction (shape-based)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3470\"}], \"name\": \"RNA secondary structure prediction (shape-based)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3470\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Prediction of nucleic-acid folding using sequence alignments as a source of data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Nucleic acid folding prediction (alignment-based)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3471\"}], \"name\": \"Nucleic acid folding prediction (alignment-based)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3471\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Model some biological system using mathematical techniques including  dynamical systems, statistical models, differential equations, and game theoretic models.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Mathematical modelling\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3545\"}], \"name\": \"Mathematical modelling\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3545\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, {\"definition\": \"Simulate the bevaviour of a biological pathway or network.\