ification of nucleic acid / gene sequences according to the functional classification of their gene products.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Gene classification\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0917\"}], \"name\": \"Gene classification\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0917\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0918\": {\"definition\": \"stable, naturally occuring mutations in a nucleotide sequence including alleles, naturally occurring mutations such as single base nucleotide substitutions, deletions and insertions, RFLPs and other polymorphisms.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||DNA variation\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0918\"}], \"name\": \"DNA variation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0918\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0923\": {\"definition\": \"PCR experiments, e.g. quantitative real-time PCR.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||PCR experiment report\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0923\"}], \"name\": \"PCR experiment report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0923\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0931\": {\"definition\": \"microarray experiments including conditions, protocol, sample:data relationships etc.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Microarray experiment report\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0931\"}], \"name\": \"Microarray experiment report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0931\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0932\": {\"definition\": \"Data on oligonucleotide probes (typically for use with DNA microarrays).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Oligonucleotide probe data\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0932\"}], \"name\": \"Oligonucleotide probe data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0932\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0933\": {\"definition\": \"Output from a serial analysis of gene expression (SAGE) experiment.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||SAGE experimental data\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0933\"}], \"name\": \"SAGE experimental data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0933\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0934\": {\"definition\": \"Massively parallel signature sequencing (MPSS) data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||MPSS experimental data\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0934\"}], \"name\": \"MPSS experimental data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0934\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0935\": {\"definition\": \"Sequencing by synthesis (SBS) data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||SBS experimental data\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0935\"}], \"name\": \"SBS experimental data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0935\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0936\": {\"definition\": \"Tag to gene assignments (tag mapping) of SAGE, MPSS and SBS data. Typically this is the sequencing-based expression profile annotated with gene identifiers.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence tag profile (with gene assignment)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0936\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence tag profile (with gene assignment)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0936\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0941\": {\"definition\": \"Annotation on a structural 3D model (volume map) from electron microscopy.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Electron microscopy model\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#d