_2215\"}], \"name\": \"Mutation annotation (functional)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2215\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_2217\": {\"definition\": \"An informative report on a specific tumor including nature and origin of the sample, anatomic site, organ or tissue, tumor type, including morphology and/or histologic type, and so on.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Tumor annotation\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_2217\"}], \"name\": \"Tumor annotation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2217\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_2218\": {\"definition\": \"Basic information about a server on the web, such as an SRS server.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Server metadata\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_2218\"}], \"name\": \"Server metadata\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2218\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_2235\": {\"definition\": \"Raw SCOP domain classification data files.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Raw SCOP domain classification\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_2235\"}], \"name\": \"Raw SCOP domain classification\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2235\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_2236\": {\"definition\": \"Raw CATH domain classification data files.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Raw CATH domain classification\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_2236\"}], \"name\": \"Raw CATH domain classification\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_2236\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_2240\": {\"definition\": \"An informative report on the types of small molecules or \'heterogens\' (non-protein groups) that are represented in PDB files.\", \"path\": [