amontology.org/topic_0090\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0094\": {\"definition\": \"The study of the thermodynamic properties of a nucleic acid.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Nucleic acid thermodynamics\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0094\"}], \"name\": \"Nucleic acid thermodynamics\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0094\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0100\": {\"definition\": \"Topic for the study of restriction enzymes, their cleavage sites and the restriction of nucleic acids.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Nucleic acid restriction\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0100\"}], \"name\": \"Nucleic acid restriction\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0100\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0107\": {\"definition\": \"The study of codon usage in nucleotide sequence(s), genetic codes and so on.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Genetic codes and codon usage\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0107\"}], \"name\": \"Genetic codes and codon usage\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0107\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0109\": {\"definition\": \"Methods that aims to identify, predict, model or analyse genes or gene structure in DNA sequences.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Gene finding\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0109\"}], \"name\": \"Gene finding\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0109\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0110\": {\"definition\": \"The transcription of DNA into mRNA.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Transcription\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0110\"}], \"name\": \"Transcription\", \"uri\": 