omly or specifically.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence editing\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0156\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence editing\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0156\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0158\": {\"definition\": \"Conserved patterns (motifs) in molecular sequences, that (typically) describe functional or other key sites.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence motifs\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0158\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence motifs\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0158\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Motifs\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0159\": {\"definition\": \"The comparison of two or more molecular sequences, for example sequence alignment and clustering.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence comparison\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0159\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence comparison\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0159\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0163\": {\"definition\": \"Search and retrieve molecular sequences that are similar to a sequence-based query (typically a simple sequence).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence database search\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0163\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence database search\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0163\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0164\": {\"definition\": \"The comparison and grouping together of molecular sequences on the basis of their similarities.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence clustering\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0164\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence clustering\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0164\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0167\": {\"definition\": \"The processing, analysis or use of some type of structural (3D) profile or template; a computational entity (typically a numerical matrix) that is derived from and represents a structure or structure alignment.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Structural (3D) profiles\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0167\"}], \"name\": \"Structural (3D) profiles\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0167\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0172\": {\"definition\": \"The prediction, modelling, recognition or design of protein secondary or tertiary structure or other structural features.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Protein structure prediction\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0172\"}], \"name\": \"Protein structure prediction\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0172\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0173\": {\"definition\": \"The folding of nucleic acid molecules and the prediction or design of nucleic acid (typically RNA) sequences with specific conformations.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Nucleic acid structure prediction\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0173\"}], \"name\": \"Nucleic acid structure prediction\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0173\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0174\": {\"definition\": \"The prediction of three-dimensional structure of a (typically protein) sequence from first principles, using a physics-based or empirical scoring function and without using explicit structural templates.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Ab initio structure prediction\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0174\"}], \"name\": \"Ab initio structure prediction\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0174\"