/www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0180\"}], \"name\": \"Protein fold recognition\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0180\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0182\": {\"definition\": \"The alignment of molecular sequences or sequence profiles (representing sequence alignments).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence alignment\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0182\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence alignment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0182\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0183\": {\"definition\": \"The superimposition of molecular tertiary structures or structural (3D) profiles (representing a structure or structure alignment).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Structure alignment\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0183\"}], \"name\": \"Structure alignment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0183\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0184\": {\"definition\": \"The alignment of molecular sequences to structures, structural (3D) profiles or templates (representing a structure or structure alignment).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Threading\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0184\"}], \"name\": \"Threading\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0184\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0188\": {\"definition\": \"Sequence profiles; typically a positional, numerical matrix representing a sequence alignment.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence profiles and HMMs\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0188\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence profiles and HMMs\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0188\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0191\": {\"definition\": \"The r