owl#deprecatedclass||data_0848\"}], \"name\": \"Raw sequence\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0848\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0851\": {\"definition\": \"A character used to replace (mask) other characters in a molecular sequence.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence mask character\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0851\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence mask character\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0851\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0852\": {\"definition\": \"A label (text token) describing the type of sequence masking to perform.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence mask type\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0852\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence mask type\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0852\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0853\": {\"definition\": \"The strand of a DNA sequence (forward or reverse).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||DNA sense specification\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0853\"}], \"name\": \"DNA sense specification\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0853\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0854\": {\"definition\": \"A specification of sequence length(s).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence length specification\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0854\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence length specification\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0854\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0855\": {\"definition\": \"Basic or general information concerning molecular sequences.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence metadata\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0855\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence metadata\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0855\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0859\": {\"definition\": \"Data files used by motif or profile methods.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence signature model\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0859\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence signature model\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0859\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0861\": {\"definition\": \"Alignment of exact matches between subsequences (words) within two or more molecular sequences.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence alignment (words)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0861\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence alignment (words)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0861\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Sequence word alignment\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0864\": {\"definition\": \"Some simple value controlling a sequence alignment (or similar \'match\') operation.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence alignment parameter\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0864\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence alignment parameter\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0864\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0866\": {\"definition\": \"Report of general information on a sequence alignment, typically include a description, sequence identifiers and alignment score.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence alignment metadata\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0866\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence alignment metadata\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0866\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0868\": {\"definition\": \"A profile-profile alignment (each profile typically representing a sequence alignment).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Profile