ence-3D profile alignment\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0891\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Sequence-structural profile alignment\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0894\": {\"definition\": \"An informative report about a specific amino acid.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Amino acid annotation\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0894\"}], \"name\": \"Amino acid annotation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0894\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0895\": {\"definition\": \"An informative report about a specific peptide.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Peptide annotation\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0895\"}], \"name\": \"Peptide annotation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0895\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0899\": {\"definition\": \"3D structural motifs in a protein.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Protein structural motifs and surfaces\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0899\"}], \"name\": \"Protein structural motifs and surfaces\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0899\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0900\": {\"definition\": \"Data concerning the classification of the sequences and/or structures of protein structural domain(s).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Protein domain classification\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0900\"}], \"name\": \"Protein domain classification\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0900\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0901\": {\"definition\": \"structural domains or 3D folds in a protein or polypeptide chain.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Protein features report (domains)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0901\"}], \"name\": \"Protein features report (domains)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0901\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0902\": {\"definition\": \"An informative report on architecture (spatial arrangement of secondary structure) of a protein structure.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Protein architecture report\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0902\"}], \"name\": \"Protein architecture report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0902\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0903\": {\"definition\": \"A report on an analysis or model of protein folding properties, folding pathways, residues or sites that are key to protein folding, nucleation or stabilisation centers etc.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Protein folding report\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0903\"}], \"name\": \"Protein folding report\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0903\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0904\": {\"definition\": \"Data on the effect of (typically point) mutation on protein folding, stability, structure and function.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Protein features (mutation)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0904\"}], \"name\": \"Protein features (mutation)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0904\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0911\": {\"definition\": \"An informative report about a specific nucleotide base.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Nucleotide base annotation\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0911\"}], \"name\": \"Nucleotide base annotation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0911\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0917\": {\"definition\": \"A report on the 