obe data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0932\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0933\": {\"definition\": \"Output from a serial analysis of gene expression (SAGE) experiment.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||SAGE experimental data\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0933\"}], \"name\": \"SAGE experimental data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0933\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0934\": {\"definition\": \"Massively parallel signature sequencing (MPSS) data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||MPSS experimental data\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0934\"}], \"name\": \"MPSS experimental data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0934\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0935\": {\"definition\": \"Sequencing by synthesis (SBS) data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||SBS experimental data\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0935\"}], \"name\": \"SBS experimental data\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0935\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0936\": {\"definition\": \"Tag to gene assignments (tag mapping) of SAGE, MPSS and SBS data. Typically this is the sequencing-based expression profile annotated with gene identifiers.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence tag profile (with gene assignment)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0936\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence tag profile (with gene assignment)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0936\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0941\": {\"definition\": \"Annotation on a structural 3D model (volume map) from electron microscopy.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Electron microscopy model\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0941\"}], \"name\": \"Electron microscopy model\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0941\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0946\": {\"definition\": \"An informative report about a specific biological pathway or network, typically including a map (diagram) of the pathway.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Pathway or network annotation\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0946\"}], \"name\": \"Pathway or network annotation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0946\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0947\": {\"definition\": \"A map (typically a diagram) of a biological pathway.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Biological pathway map\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0947\"}], \"name\": \"Biological pathway map\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0947\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0948\": {\"definition\": \"A definition of a data resource serving one or more types of data, including metadata and links to the resource or data proper.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Data resource definition\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0948\"}], \"name\": \"Data resource definition\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0948\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0952\": {\"definition\": \"Resource definition for an EMBOSS database.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||EMBOSS database resource definition\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0952\"}], \"name\": \"EMBOSS database resource definition\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0952\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0953\": {\"definition\": \"Information on a version of software or data, for example name, version number