fier\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0986\"}], \"name\": \"Chemical identifier\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0986\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_0992\": {\"definition\": \"Code word for a ligand, for example from a PDB file.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Ligand identifier\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_0992\"}], \"name\": \"Ligand identifier\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_0992\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_1014\": {\"definition\": \"A specification (partial or complete) of one or more positions or regions of a molecular sequence or map.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Sequence position specification\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_1014\"}], \"name\": \"Sequence position specification\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1014\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_1018\": {\"definition\": \"Name or other identifier of an nucleic acid feature.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Nucleic acid feature identifier\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_1018\"}], \"name\": \"Nucleic acid feature identifier\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1018\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_1019\": {\"definition\": \"Name or other identifier of a protein feature.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Protein feature identifier\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_1019\"}], \"name\": \"Protein feature identifier\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/data_1019\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"data_1024\": {\"definition\": \"String of one or more ASCII characters representing a codon.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Codon name\", \"key\": \"http://www.w