of RNA folds.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||RNA secondary structure prediction (shape-based)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3470\"}], \"name\": \"RNA secondary structure prediction (shape-based)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3470\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"operation_3471\": {\"definition\": \"Prediction of nucleic-acid folding using sequence alignments as a source of data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Nucleic acid folding prediction (alignment-based)\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3471\"}], \"name\": \"Nucleic acid folding prediction (alignment-based)\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3471\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"operation_3545\": {\"definition\": \"Model some biological system using mathematical techniques including  dynamical systems, statistical models, differential equations, and game theoretic models.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Mathematical modelling\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3545\"}], \"name\": \"Mathematical modelling\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3545\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"operation_3562\": {\"definition\": \"Simulate the bevaviour of a biological pathway or network.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Network simulation\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3562\"}], \"name\": \"Network simulation\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/operation_3562\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"operation_3648\": {\"definition\": \"Statistical estimation of false discovery rate from score distribution for peptide-spectrum-matches, following a peptide database search.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Validation of peptide-spectrum matches\", \"ke