amontology.org/topic_0606\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0608\": {\"definition\": \"General cell culture or data on a specific cell lines.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Cell and tissue culture\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0608\"}], \"name\": \"Cell and tissue culture\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0608\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0612\": {\"definition\": \"The cell cycle including key genes and proteins.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Cell cycle\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0612\"}], \"name\": \"Cell cycle\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0612\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0613\": {\"definition\": \"The physicochemical, biochemical or structural properties of amino acids or peptides.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Peptides and amino acids\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0613\"}], \"name\": \"Peptides and amino acids\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0613\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0616\": {\"definition\": \"A specific organelle, or organelles in general, typically the genes and proteins (or genome and proteome).\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Organelles\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0616\"}], \"name\": \"Organelles\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0616\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0617\": {\"definition\": \"Ribosomes, typically of ribosome-related genes and proteins.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Ribosomes\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0617\"}], \"name\": \"Ribosomes\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0617\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0618\": {\"definition\": \"A database about scents.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Scents\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0618\"}], \"name\": \"Scents\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0618\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0620\": {\"definition\": \"The structures of drugs, drug target, their interactions and binding affinities.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Drugs and target structures\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0620\"}], \"name\": \"Drugs and target structures\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0620\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0624\": {\"definition\": \"Study of chromosomes.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Chromosomes\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0624\"}], \"name\": \"Chromosomes\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0624\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0629\": {\"definition\": \"Gene expression e.g. microarray data, northern blots, gene-indexed expression profiles etc.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Gene expression and microarray\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0629\"}], \"name\": \"Gene expression and microarray\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0629\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0635\": {\"definition\": \"A particular protein, protein family or other group of proteins.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Specific protein resources\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0635\"}], \"name\": \"Specific protein resources\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0635\", \"exact_synonyms\": [\"Specific protein\"], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0639\": {\"definition\": \"Arc