equences, genes and annotation.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Pathogens\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0783\"}], \"name\": \"Pathogens\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0783\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0786\": {\"definition\": \"Arabidopsis-specific data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Arabidopsis\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0786\"}], \"name\": \"Arabidopsis\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0786\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0787\": {\"definition\": \"Rice-specific data.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Rice\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0787\"}], \"name\": \"Rice\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0787\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0796\": {\"definition\": \"Informatics resources that aim to identify, map or analyse genetic markers in DNA sequences, for example to produce a genetic (linkage) map of a chromosome or genome or to analyse genetic linkage and synteny.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Genetic mapping and linkage\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0796\"}], \"name\": \"Genetic mapping and linkage\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0796\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0803\": {\"definition\": \"Human diseases, typically describing the genes, mutations and proteins implicated in disease.\", \"path\": [{\"name\": \"Deprecated||Human disease\", \"key\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0803\"}], \"name\": \"Human disease\", \"uri\": \"http://edamontology.org/topic_0803\", \"exact_synonyms\": [], \"narrow_synonyms\": [], \"children\": []}, \"topic_0922\": {\"definition\": \"PCR primers and hybridisation oligos in a nucleic acid sequence.\