gical pathway or network.\", \"n\": \"Pathway or network visualisation\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3083\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Pathway or network visualisation\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3083\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Predict general (non-positional) functional properties of a protein from analysing its sequence.\", \"n\": \"Protein function prediction (from sequence)\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3084\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein function prediction (from sequence)\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3084\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Predict, recognise and identify functional or other key sites within protein sequences, typically by scanning for known motifs, patterns and regular expressions.\", \"n\": \"Protein sequence feature detection\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3087\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein sequence feature detection\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3087\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Calculate (or predict) physical or chemical properties of a protein, including any non-positional properties of the molecular sequence, from processing a protein sequence.\", \"n\": \"Protein property calculation (from sequence)\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3088\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein property calculation (from sequence)\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3088\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Predict, recognise and identify positional features in proteins from analysing protein structure.\", \"n\": \"Protein feature prediction (from structure)\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3090\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein feature pre