Validation of peptide-spectrum matches\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3648\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The analysis, using any of diverse techniques, to identify genes that are differentially expressed under a given experimental setup.\", \"n\": \"Differential gene expression analysis\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3742\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Differential gene expression analysis\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3742\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The structures of reactants or products of metabolism, for example small molecules such as including vitamins, polyols, nucleotides and amino acids.\", \"n\": \"Metabolites\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0079\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Metabolites\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0079\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The alignment (equivalence between sites) of molecular sequences, structures or profiles (representing a sequence or structure alignment).\", \"n\": \"Alignment\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0083\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Alignment\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0083\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The search and query of data sources (typically databases or ontologies) in order to retrieve entries or other information.\", \"n\": \"Information retrieval\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0090\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Information retrieval\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0090\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The study of the thermodynamic properties of a nucleic acid.\", \"n\": \"Nucleic acid thermodynamics\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0094\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Dep