-directed mutagenesis) to an existing protein.\", \"n\": \"Protein design\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0150\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein design\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0150\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"G-protein coupled receptors (GPCRs).\", \"n\": \"G protein-coupled receptors (GPCR)\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0151\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||G protein-coupled receptors (GPCR)\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0151\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Edit, convert or otherwise change a molecular sequence, either randomly or specifically.\", \"n\": \"Sequence editing\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0156\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Sequence editing\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0156\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Conserved patterns (motifs) in molecular sequences, that (typically) describe functional or other key sites.\", \"n\": \"Sequence motifs\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0158\", \"es\": [\"Motifs\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Sequence motifs\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0158\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The comparison of two or more molecular sequences, for example sequence alignment and clustering.\", \"n\": \"Sequence comparison\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0159\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Sequence comparison\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0159\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Search and retrieve molecular sequences that are similar to a sequence-based query (typically a simple sequence).\", \"n\": \"Sequence database search\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0163\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Sequence database search\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0163\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The comparison and grouping together of molecular sequences on the basis of their similarities.\", \"n\": \"Sequence clustering\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0164\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Sequence clustering\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0164\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The processing, analysis or use of some type of structural (3D) profile or template; a computational entity (typically a numerical matrix) that is derived from and represents a structure or structure alignment.\", \"n\": \"Structural (3D) profiles\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0167\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Structural (3D) profiles\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0167\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The prediction, modelling, recognition or design of protein secondary or tertiary structure or other structural features.\", \"n\": \"Protein structure prediction\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0172\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein structure prediction\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0172\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The folding of nucleic acid molecules and the prediction or design of nucleic acid (typically RNA) sequences with specific conformations.\", \"n\": \"Nucleic acid structure prediction\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0173\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Nucleic acid structure prediction\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0173\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The prediction of three-dimensional structure of a (typically protein) sequence from first principles, using a physics-based or empirical scoring function and without using explicit structural templates.\", \"n\": \"Ab initio structure prediction\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0174\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Ab initio structure prediction\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0174\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The modelling of the three-dimensional structure of a protein using known sequence and structural data.\", \"n\": \"Homology modelling\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0175\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Homology modelling\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0175\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The modelling the structure of proteins in complex with small molecules or other macromolecules.\", \"n\": \"Molecular docking\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0177\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Molecular docking\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0177\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The prediction of secondary or supersecondary structure of protein sequences.\", \"n\": \"Protein secondary structure prediction\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0178\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein secondary structure prediction\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0178\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The prediction of tertiary structure of protein sequences.\", \"n\": \"Protein tertiary structure prediction\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0179\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein tertiary structure prediction\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0179\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The recognition (prediction and assignment) of known protein structural domains or folds in protein sequence(s).\", \"n\": \"Protein fold recognition\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0180\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein fold recognition\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0180\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The alignment of molecular sequences or sequence profiles (representing sequence alignments).\", \"n\": \"Sequence alignment\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0182\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Sequence alignment\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0182\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The superimposition of molecular tertiary structures or structural (3D) profiles (representing a structure or structure alignment).\", \"n\": \"Structure alignment\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0183\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Structure alignment\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0183\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The alignment of molecular sequences to structures, structural (3D) profiles or templates (representing a structure or structure alignment).\", \"n\": \"Threading\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0184\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Threading\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0184\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"Sequence profiles; typically a positional, numerical matrix representing a sequence alignment.\", \"n\": \"Sequence profiles and HMMs\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0188\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Sequence profiles and HMMs\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0188\"}], \"hi\": null, \"ht\": null, \"ho\": null}, {\"d\": \"The reconstruction of a phylogeny (evolutionary relatedness amongst organisms), for example, by building a phylogenetic tree.\", \"n\": \"Phylogeny reconstruction\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0191\", \"es\":