ing specific or conserved pattern in molecular sequences.\", \"n\": \"Sequence motif data\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_2981\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Sequence motif data\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_2981\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_2982\": {\"d\": \"Data concerning models representing a (typically multiple) sequence alignment.\", \"n\": \"Sequence profile data\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_2982\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Sequence profile data\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_2982\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_2983\": {\"d\": \"Data concerning a specific biological pathway or network.\", \"n\": \"Pathway or network data\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_2983\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Pathway or network data\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_2983\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_2986\": {\"d\": \"Data concerning the classification of nucleic acid sequences or structures.\", \"n\": \"Nucleic acid classification\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_2986\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Nucleic acid classification\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_2986\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_2987\": {\"d\": \"A report on a classification of molecular sequences, structures or other entities.\", \"n\": \"Classification report\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_2987\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Classification report\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||data_2987\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"data_2989\": {\"d\": \"key residues involved in protein folding.\", \"n\": \"Protein features report (key folding sites)\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"data_2989\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein features report (key f