ition, clinical outcome etc.\", \"n\": \"Gene set testing\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3224\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Gene set testing\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3224\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_3259\": {\"d\": \"Infer a transcriptome sequence without the aid of a reference genome, i.e. by comparing short sequences (reads) to each other.\", \"n\": \"Transcriptome assembly (de novo)\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3259\", \"es\": [\"de novo transcriptome assembly\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Transcriptome assembly (de novo)\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3259\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_3260\": {\"d\": \"Infer a transcriptome sequence by mapping short reads to a reference genome.\", \"n\": \"Transcriptome assembly (mapping)\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3260\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Transcriptome assembly (mapping)\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3260\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_3289\": {\"d\": \"Search for and retrieve a data identifier of some kind, e.g. a database entry accession.\", \"n\": \"ID retrieval\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3289\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||ID retrieval\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3289\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_3353\": {\"d\": \"Compare two or more ontologies, e.g. identify differences.\", \"n\": \"Ontology comparison\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3353\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Ontology comparison\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3353\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_3430\": {\"d\": \"Predict, recognise and identify functional or other key sites within nucleic acid s