#deprecatedclass||operation_3648\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"operation_3742\": {\"d\": \"The analysis, using any of diverse techniques, to identify genes that are differentially expressed under a given experimental setup.\", \"n\": \"Differential gene expression analysis\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"operation_3742\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Differential gene expression analysis\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||operation_3742\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0079\": {\"d\": \"The structures of reactants or products of metabolism, for example small molecules such as including vitamins, polyols, nucleotides and amino acids.\", \"n\": \"Metabolites\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0079\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Metabolites\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0079\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0083\": {\"d\": \"The alignment (equivalence between sites) of molecular sequences, structures or profiles (representing a sequence or structure alignment).\", \"n\": \"Alignment\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0083\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Alignment\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0083\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0090\": {\"d\": \"The search and query of data sources (typically databases or ontologies) in order to retrieve entries or other information.\", \"n\": \"Information retrieval\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0090\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Information retrieval\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0090\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0094\": {\"d\": \"The study of the thermodynamic properties of a nucleic acid.\", \"n\": \"Nucleic acid thermodynamics\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0094\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Nucleic acid thermodynamics\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0094\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0100\": {\"d\": \"Topic for the study of restriction enzymes, their cleavage sites and the restriction of nucleic acids.\", \"n\": \"Nucleic acid restriction\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0100\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Nucleic acid restriction\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0100\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0107\": {\"d\": \"The study of codon usage in nucleotide sequence(s), genetic codes and so on.\", \"n\": \"Genetic codes and codon usage\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0107\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Genetic codes and codon usage\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0107\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0109\": {\"d\": \"Methods that aims to identify, predict, model or analyse genes or gene structure in DNA sequences.\", \"n\": \"Gene finding\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0109\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Gene finding\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0109\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0110\": {\"d\": \"The transcription of DNA into mRNA.\", \"n\": \"Transcription\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0110\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Transcription\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0110\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0111\": {\"d\": \"Promoters in DNA sequences (region of DNA that facilitates the transcription of a particular gene by binding RNA polymerase and transcription factor proteins).\", \"n\": \"Promoters\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0111\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Promoters\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0111\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0112\": {\"d\": \"The folding (in 3D space) of nucleic acid molecules.\", \"n\": \"Nucleic acid folding\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0112\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Nucleic acid folding\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0112\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0133\": {\"d\": \"Two-dimensional gel electrophoresis image and related data.\", \"n\": \"Two-dimensional gel electrophoresis\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0133\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Two-dimensional gel electrophoresis\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0133\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0134\": {\"d\": \"An analytical chemistry technique that measures the mass-to-charge ratio and abundance of ions in the gas phase.\", \"n\": \"Mass spectrometry\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0134\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Mass spectrometry\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0134\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0135\": {\"d\": \"Protein microarray data.\", \"n\": \"Protein microarrays\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0135\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein microarrays\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0135\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0137\": {\"d\": \"The study of the hydrophobic, hydrophilic and charge properties of a protein.\", \"n\": \"Protein hydropathy\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0137\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein hydropathy\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0137\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0141\": {\"d\": \"Enzyme or chemical cleavage sites and proteolytic or mass calculations on a protein sequence.\", \"n\": \"Protein cleavage sites and proteolysis\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0141\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein cleavage sites and proteolysis\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0141\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0143\": {\"d\": \"The comparison of two or more protein structures.\", \"n\": \"Protein structure comparison\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0143\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein structure comparison\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0143\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0144\": {\"d\": \"The processing and analysis of inter-atomic or inter-residue interactions in protein (3D) structures.\", \"n\": \"Protein residue interactions\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0144\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein residue interactions\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0144\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0147\": {\"d\": \"Protein-protein interactions, individual interactions and networks, protein complexes, protein functional coupling etc.\", \"n\": \"Protein-protein interactions\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0147\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein-protein interactions\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0147\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0148\": {\"d\": \"Protein-ligand (small molecule) interactions.\", \"n\": \"Protein-ligand interactions\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0148\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein-ligand interactions\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0148\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0149\": {\"d\": \"Protein-DNA/RNA interactions.\", \"n\": \"Protein-nucleic acid interactions\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0149\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein-nucleic acid interactions\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0149\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0150\": {\"d\": \"The design of proteins with specific properties, typically by designing changes (via site-directed mutagenesis) to an existing protein.\", \"n\": \"Protein design\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0150\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein design\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0150\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0151\": {\"d\": \"G-protein coupled receptors (GPCRs).\", \"n\": \"G protein-coupled receptors (GPCR)\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0151\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||G protein-coupled receptors (GPCR)\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0151\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0156\": {\"d\": \"Edit, convert or otherwise change a molecular sequence, either randomly or specifically.\", \"n\": \"Sequence editing\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0156\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Sequence editing\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0156\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0158\": {\"d\": \"Conserved patterns (motifs) in molecular sequences, that (typically) describe functional or other key sites.\", \"n\": \"Sequence motifs\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0158\", \"es\": [\"Motifs\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Sequence motifs\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0158\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0159\": {\"d\": \"The comparison of two or more molecular sequences, for example sequence alignment and clustering.\", \"n\": \"Sequence comparison\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0159\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Sequence comparison\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0159\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0163\": {\"d\": \"Search and retrieve molecular sequences that are similar to a sequence-based query (typically a simple sequence).\", \"n\": \"Sequence database search\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0163\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Sequence database search\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0163\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0164\": {\"d\": \"The comparison and grouping together of molecular sequences on the basis of their similarities.\", \"n\": \"Sequence clustering\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0164\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Sequence clustering\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0164\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0167\": {\"d\": \"The processing, analysis or use of some type of structural (3D) profile or template; a computational entity (typically a numerical matrix) that is derived from and represents a structure or structure alignment.\", \"n\": \"Structural (3D) profiles\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0167\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Structural (3D) profiles\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0167\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0172\": {\"d\": \"The prediction, modelling, recognition or design of protein secondary or tertiary structure or other structural features.\", \"n\": \"Protein structure prediction\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0172\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein structure prediction\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0172\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0173\": {\"d\": \"The folding of nucleic acid molecules and the prediction or design of nucleic acid (typically RNA) sequences with specific conformations.\", \"n\": \"Nucleic acid structure prediction\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0173\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Nucleic acid structure prediction\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0173\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0174\": {\"d\": \"The prediction of three-dimensional structure of a (typically protein) sequence from first principles, using a physics-based or empirical scoring function and without using explicit structural templates.\", \"n\": \"Ab initio structure prediction\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0174\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Ab initio structure prediction\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0174\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0175\": {\"d\": \"The modelling of the three-dimensional structure of a protein using known sequence and structural data.\", \"n\": \"Homology modelling\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0175\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Homology modelling\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0175\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0177\": {\"d\": \"The modelling the structure of proteins in complex with small molecules or other macromolecules.\", \"n\": \"Molecular docking\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0177\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Molecular docking\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0177\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0178\": {\"d\": \"The prediction of secondary or supersecondary structure of protein sequences.\", \"n\": \"Protein secondary structure prediction\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0178\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein secondary structure prediction\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0178\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0179\": {\"d\": \"The prediction of tertiary structure of protein sequences.\", \"n\": \"Protein tertiary structure prediction\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0179\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein tertiary structure prediction\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0179\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0180\": {\"d\": \"The recognition (prediction and assignment) of known protein structural domains or folds in protein sequence(s).\", \"n\": \"Protein fold recognition\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0180\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein fold recognition\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0180\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0182\": {\"d\": \"The alignment of molecular sequences or sequence profiles (representing sequence alignments).\", \"n\": \"Sequence alignment\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0182\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Sequence alignment\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0182\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0183\": {\"d\": \"The superimposition of molecular tertiary structures or structural (3D) profiles (representing a structure or structure alignment).\", \"n\": \"Structure alignment\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0183\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Structure alignment\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0183\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0184\": {\"d\": \"The alignment of molecular sequences to structures, structural (3D) profiles or templates (representing a structure or structure alignment).\", \"n\": \"Threading\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0184\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Threading\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0184\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0188\": {\"d\": \"Sequence profiles; typically a positional, numerical matrix representing a sequence alignment.\", \"n\": \"Sequence profiles and HMMs\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0188\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Sequence profiles and HMMs\",