.\", \"n\": \"Mice or rats\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0213\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Mice or rats\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0213\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0215\": {\"d\": \"Information on a specific worm genome including molecular sequences, genes and annotation.\", \"n\": \"Worms\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0215\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Worms\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0215\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0217\": {\"d\": \"The processing and analysis of the bioinformatics literature and bibliographic data, such as literature search and query.\", \"n\": \"Literature analysis\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0217\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Literature analysis\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0217\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0220\": {\"d\": \"The management and manipulation of digital documents, including database records, files and reports.\", \"n\": \"Document, record and content management\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0220\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Document, record and content management\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0220\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0221\": {\"d\": \"Annotation of a molecular sequence.\", \"n\": \"Sequence annotation\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0221\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Sequence annotation\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0221\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_0222\": {\"d\": \"Annotation of a genome.\", \"n\": \"Genome annotation\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_0222\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Genome annotation\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_0222\"}], \