rces.\", \"n\": \"Protein databases\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2225\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein databases\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2225\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2226\": {\"d\": \"Experimental methods for biomolecular structure determination, such as X-ray crystallography, nuclear magnetic resonance (NMR), circular dichroism (CD) spectroscopy, microscopy etc., including the assignment or modelling of molecular structure from such data.\", \"n\": \"Structure determination\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2226\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Structure determination\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2226\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2230\": {\"d\": \"Topic focused on identifying, grouping, or naming things in a structured way according to some schema based on observable relationships.\", \"n\": \"Classification\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2230\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Classification\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2230\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2232\": {\"d\": \"Lipoproteins (protein-lipid assemblies).\", \"n\": \"Lipoproteins\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2232\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Lipoproteins\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2232\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2257\": {\"d\": \"Visualise a phylogeny, for example, render a phylogenetic tree.\", \"n\": \"Phylogeny visualisation\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2257\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Phylogeny visualisation\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2257\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2271\": {\"d\": \"Search for and retrieve molecular structures that are similar to a structure-based query (typically another structure or part of a structure).\", \"n\": \"Structure database search\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2271\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Structure database search\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2271\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2276\": {\"d\": \"The prediction of functional properties of a protein.\", \"n\": \"Protein function prediction\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2276\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein function prediction\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2276\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2277\": {\"d\": \"Single nucleotide polymorphisms (SNP) and associated data, for example, the discovery and annotation of SNPs.\", \"n\": \"SNP\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2277\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||SNP\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2277\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2278\": {\"d\": \"Predict transmembrane domains and topology in protein sequences.\", \"n\": \"Transmembrane protein prediction\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2278\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Transmembrane protein prediction\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2278\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2280\": {\"d\": \"The comparison two or more nucleic acid (typically RNA) secondary or tertiary structures.\", \"n\": \"Nucleic acid structure comparison\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2280\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Nucleic acid structure comparison\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2280\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2397\": {\"d\": \"Exons in a nucleotide sequences.\", \"n\": \"Exons\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2397\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Exons\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2397\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2399\": {\"d\": \"Transcription of DNA into RNA including the regulation of transcription.\", \"n\": \"Gene transcription\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2399\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Gene transcription\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2399\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2661\": {\"d\": \"Structural and associated data for toxic chemical substances.\", \"n\": \"Toxins and targets\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2661\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Toxins and targets\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2661\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2754\": {\"d\": \"Introns in a nucleotide sequences.\", \"n\": \"Introns\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2754\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Introns\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2754\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2807\": {\"d\": \"A topic concerning primarily bioinformatics software tools, typically the broad function or purpose of a tool.\", \"n\": \"Tool topic\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2807\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Tool topic\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2807\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2809\": {\"d\": \"A general area of bioinformatics study, typically the broad scope or category of content of a bioinformatics journal or conference proceeding.\", \"n\": \"Study topic\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2809\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Study topic\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2809\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2811\": {\"d\": \"Biological nomenclature (naming), symbols and terminology.\", \"n\": \"Nomenclature\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2811\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Nomenclature\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2811\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2813\": {\"d\": \"The genes, gene variations and proteins involved in one or more specific diseases.\", \"n\": \"Disease genes and proteins\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2813\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Disease genes and proteins\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2813\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2816\": {\"d\": \"Informatics resource (typically a database) primarily focussed on genes.\", \"n\": \"Gene resources\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2816\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Gene resources\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2816\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2817\": {\"d\": \"Yeast, e.g. information on a specific yeast genome including molecular sequences, genes and annotation.\", \"n\": \"Yeast\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2817\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Yeast\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2817\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2818\": {\"d\": \"Eukaryotes or data concerning eukaryotes, e.g. information on a specific eukaryote genome including molecular sequences, genes and annotation.\", \"n\": \"Eukaryotes\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2818\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Eukaryotes\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2818\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2819\": {\"d\": \"Invertebrates, e.g. information on a specific invertebrate genome including molecular sequences, genes and annotation.\", \"n\": \"Invertebrates\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2819\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Invertebrates\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2819\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2820\": {\"d\": \"Vertebrates, e.g. information on a specific vertebrate genome including molecular sequences, genes and annotation.\", \"n\": \"Vertebrates\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2820\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Vertebrates\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2820\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2821\": {\"d\": \"Unicellular eukaryotes, e.g. information on a unicellular eukaryote genome including molecular sequences, genes and annotation.\", \"n\": \"Unicellular eukaryotes\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2821\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Unicellular eukaryotes\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2821\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2826\": {\"d\": \"Protein secondary or tertiary structure alignments.\", \"n\": \"Protein structure alignment\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2826\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein structure alignment\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2826\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2829\": {\"d\": \"Conceptualisation, categorisation and naming of entities or phenomena within biology or bioinformatics.\", \"n\": \"Ontologies, nomenclature and classification\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2829\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Ontologies, nomenclature and classification\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2829\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2839\": {\"d\": \"Specific molecules, including large molecules built from repeating subunits (macromolecules) and small molecules of biological significance.\", \"n\": \"Molecules\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2839\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Molecules\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2839\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2842\": {\"d\": \"Parallelised sequencing processes that are capable of sequencing many thousands of sequences simultaneously.\", \"n\": \"High-throughput sequencing\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2842\", \"es\": [\"Next-generation sequencing\"], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||High-throughput sequencing\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2842\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2846\": {\"d\": \"Gene regulatory networks.\", \"n\": \"Gene regulatory networks\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2846\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Gene regulatory networks\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2846\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2847\": {\"d\": \"Informatics resources dedicated to one or more specific diseases (not diseases in general).\", \"n\": \"Disease (specific)\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2847\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Disease (specific)\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2847\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2867\": {\"d\": \"Variable number of tandem repeat (VNTR) polymorphism in a DNA sequence.\", \"n\": \"VNTR\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2867\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||VNTR\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2867\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2868\": {\"d\": \"Microsatellite polymorphism in a DNA sequence.\", \"n\": \"Microsatellites\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2868\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Microsatellites\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2868\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2869\": {\"d\": \"Restriction fragment length polymorphisms (RFLP) in a DNA sequence.\", \"n\": \"RFLP\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2869\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||RFLP\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2869\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_2953\": {\"d\": \"Topic for the design of nucleic acid sequences with specific conformations.\", \"n\": \"Nucleic acid design\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_2953\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Nucleic acid design\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_2953\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3032\": {\"d\": \"The design of primers for PCR and DNA amplification or the design of molecular probes.\", \"n\": \"Primer or probe design\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3032\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Primer or probe design\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_3032\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3038\": {\"d\": \"Molecular secondary or tertiary (3D) structural data resources, typically of proteins and nucleic acids.\", \"n\": \"Structure databases\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3038\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Structure databases\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_3038\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3039\": {\"d\": \"Nucleic acid (secondary or tertiary) structure, such as whole structures, structural features and associated annotation.\", \"n\": \"Nucleic acid structure\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3039\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Nucleic acid structure\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_3039\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3041\": {\"d\": \"Molecular sequence data resources, including sequence sites, alignments, motifs and profiles.\", \"n\": \"Sequence databases\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3041\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Sequence databases\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_3041\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3042\": {\"d\": \"Nucleotide sequences and associated concepts such as sequence sites, alignments, motifs and profiles.\", \"n\": \"Nucleic acid sequences\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3042\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Nucleic acid sequences\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_3042\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3043\": {\"d\": \"Protein sequences and associated concepts such as sequence sites, alignments, motifs and profiles.\", \"n\": \"Protein sequences\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3043\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein sequences\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_3043\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3044\": {\"d\": \"Protein interaction networks\", \"n\": \"Protein interaction networks\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3044\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Protein interaction networks\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_3044\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3048\": {\"d\": \"Mammals, e.g. information on a specific mammal genome including molecular sequences, genes and annotation.\", \"n\": \"Mammals\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3048\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Mammals\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_3048\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3052\": {\"d\": \"The comparison, grouping together and classification of macromolecules on the basis of sequence similarity.\", \"n\": \"Sequence clusters and classification\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3052\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Sequence clusters and classification\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_3052\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3060\": {\"d\": \"Regulatory RNA sequences including microRNA (miRNA) and small interfering RNA (siRNA).\", \"n\": \"Regulatory RNA\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3060\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Regulatory RNA\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_3060\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3061\": {\"d\": \"The documentation of resources such as tools, services and databases and how to get help.\", \"n\": \"Documentation and help\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3061\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Documentation and help\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_3061\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3062\": {\"d\": \"The structural and functional organisation of genes and other genetic elements.\", \"n\": \"Genetic organisation\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3062\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Genetic organisation\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_3062\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3072\": {\"d\": \"The detection of the positional features, such as functional and other key sites, in molecular sequences.\", \"n\": \"Sequence feature detection\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3072\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Sequence feature detection\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_3072\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3073\": {\"d\": \"The detection of positional features such as functional sites in nucleotide sequences.\", \"n\": \"Nucleic acid feature detection\", \"ns\": [], \"u\": \"topic_3073\", \"es\": [], \"ch\": [], \"p\": [{\"n\": \"Deprecated||Nucleic acid feature detection\", \"k\": \"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecatedclass||topic_3073\"}], \"hi\": [], \"ho\": [], \"ht\": []}, \"topic_3074\": {\"d\": \"The detection, identification and analysis of positional protein sequence features, such as functional sites.\", \"n\": \"Protein feature detection\", \